                { author: "marine", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-02-19", text: "We had so much food , it was a feist. We tried 2 Michelin street food and one Thai TV reward street restaurant. K our guide was super friendly and cheerful. Really recommend this tour", photos: ["https://images.asiabylocals.com/asiabylocals/reviews/bangkok-chinatown-michelin-street-food-tour-10-tastings-by-local-operator/5539106/1600.webp", "https://images.asiabylocals.com/asiabylocals/reviews/bangkok-chinatown-michelin-street-food-tour-10-tastings-by-local-operator/5539107/1600.webp", "https://images.asiabylocals.com/asiabylocals/reviews/bangkok-chinatown-michelin-street-food-tour-10-tastings-by-local-operator/5539108/1600.webp"] },
                { author: "Jalisa", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-09-09", text: "I had such a fun time and it was great to try a number of new foods and places I wouldn't have explored on my own." },
                { author: "Meadhbh", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-08-15", text: "Peak was amazing & so great ! We are so much delicious food, such a nice way to see Bangkok at night ! Would definitely recommend, still dreaming of all the delicious food" },
                { author: "Sofie", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-07-06", text: "Friendly guide with good english skills. We enjoyed the tour and the food. The food was not experimental and every one of our group could eat it." },
                { author: "Jackie", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-01-05", text: "Our guide Na was excellent! She is knowledgeable and friendly and fun! We enjoyed the tastings and learned a lot. Highly recommended!" },
                { author: "Julien", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2025-10-09", text: "i'm not poet i like math price : perfect 5/5 food selection : 5/5 ( from french mouth ) food quantity : 5/5 guide kindness and explaination : 5/5 everything was perfect you cannot avoid this activity in bkk" },
                { author: "Kate", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2025-08-06", text: "We had a fabulous evening on our food tour! So much delicious food, it really was a feast. It was a great mix of savoury and sweet snacks! Thank you for a great night Peak." },
                { author: "Brynn", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2025-07-30", text: "Our tour was so much fun and a TON of great food. I’m vegetarian, and our tour guide Peak did a great job of providing vegetarian options. Would highly recommend going with her!" },
                { author: "NICOLE", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2025-06-07", text: "This tour features 10 food storage with 3 Michelin star vendors. Na was super knowledgeable, friendly and offered the best advice on how to enjoy the experience as a local would eat. If you do not enjoy walking or crowds, this may not be the tour for you as Chinatown in Bangkokis large and the streets can get very crowded on the weekends. Great tour! Amazing guide!" },
                { author: "Alexander", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2025-05-10", text: "This was a great tour to eat a wide variety of Thai foods. Peak was an excellent guide for this culinary adventure. The food was delicious, and the tour provides an excellent opportunity to experience the lively Chinatown neighborhood. There is a lot of food to try so you definitely want to arrive hungry and ready to eat." }
