                { author: "Mel", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-09-18", text: "JC was excellent and very knowledgeable about the history and sights especially of the Grand Palace, all of the above mentioned in the tour. Plenty of walking and the heat and humidity in Thailand is not to take lightly. Bring water for hydration and umbrella if you must. Overall, beautiful sightseeing and magical views are all worth the trip.", photos: ["https://images.asiabylocals.com/asiabylocals/reviews/grand-palace-wat-arun-and-wat-pho-guided-tour/8781334/1600.webp", "https://images.asiabylocals.com/asiabylocals/reviews/grand-palace-wat-arun-and-wat-pho-guided-tour/8781335/1600.webp", "https://images.asiabylocals.com/asiabylocals/reviews/grand-palace-wat-arun-and-wat-pho-guided-tour/8781336/1600.webp"] },
                { author: "Elisa", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-09-13", text: "Excellent tour to discover some of the most famous and important attractions of Bangkok. We had enough time to explore the Grand Palace, then we took a ferry to Wat Arun and a ferry back to Wat Pho and all the 3 places were well worth a visit. Our guide Jenny was very friendly and knowledgeable and shared with us many interesting insights about Thai history and culture. Definitely recommended!", photos: ["https://images.asiabylocals.com/asiabylocals/reviews/grand-palace-wat-arun-and-wat-pho-guided-tour/8704125/1600.webp", "https://images.asiabylocals.com/asiabylocals/reviews/grand-palace-wat-arun-and-wat-pho-guided-tour/8704126/1600.webp", "https://images.asiabylocals.com/asiabylocals/reviews/grand-palace-wat-arun-and-wat-pho-guided-tour/8704127/1600.webp"] },
                { author: "Glen", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-09-08", text: "Great tour with Monkey Asia. Our guide was helpful and knowledgeable", photos: ["https://images.asiabylocals.com/asiabylocals/reviews/grand-palace-wat-arun-and-wat-pho-guided-tour/8598685/1600.webp", "https://images.asiabylocals.com/asiabylocals/reviews/grand-palace-wat-arun-and-wat-pho-guided-tour/8598686/1600.webp", "https://images.asiabylocals.com/asiabylocals/reviews/grand-palace-wat-arun-and-wat-pho-guided-tour/8598687/1600.webp"] },
                { author: "Charlie", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-09-17", text: "Our guide was Pam and she was amazing! She was clearly very knowledgeable and explained things in a clear, understandable way. We thoroughly enjoyed learning about Thai culture and history" },
                { author: "david", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-09-14", text: "Excellent, very knowledgeable guide. but weather was too hot and humid." },
                { author: "Carina", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-09-11", text: "“A” was an amazing guide. We learned so much from him. Big recommendation, the tour was totally worth it." },
                { author: "Afsaneh", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-09-10", text: "We had a very good experience with Tiery, highly recommend!" },
                { author: "Vicky", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-09-08", text: "The sites are beautiful and Nok, our guide took good care of us. We had to make some adjustments to the tour due to closure of the waterway (not within the company's control). Nok was clear with the changes, and we still fit all the sites in with enough time to see everything. They even included a tuk tuk ride to bring us back to the Palace for the last stop so we didn't have to walk there. Bring a fan, water, and wear appropriate temple clothing." },
                { author: "Malena", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-09-04", text: "Amazing! A did a magnificent tour. recommendable! Interesting stories, always friendly and always open for questions. And very funny!" },
                { author: "Chris", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-09-03", text: "The guide, Nok, it was very knowledgeable and had excellent communication and English skills" },
                { author: "Mark", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-08-29", text: "Pam was a wonderful guide. The whole family enjoyed the day and beautiful sights. Definitely worthwhile." },
                { author: "Paul", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-09-04", text: "Loved it. ‘A’ had so much positive energy, was very knowledge and genuinely loves Bangkok. Thoroughly recommend- top guide." }
