  'chinatown-food-tour-with-michelin-food-stalls-in-bangkok': {
            averageRating: 4.82,
            totalReviews: 416,
            guideRating: 4.91,
            valueRating: 4.81,
            reviews: [
                { author: "Paul", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-08-17", text: "Amazing tour by Eve she knew the food of Bangkok so well and went to places we would never normally visit. I was so surprised how cheap the food was and how friendly all of the people serving the food were. There’s some places to sit down along the way. Avoid eating a lot beforehand as it it is over ten dishes with some light snacks and desserts towards the end of the tour.", photos: ["https://images.asiabylocals.com/asiabylocals/reviews/chinatown-food-tour-with-michelin-food-stalls-in-bangkok/8190135/1600.webp", "https://images.asiabylocals.com/asiabylocals/reviews/chinatown-food-tour-with-michelin-food-stalls-in-bangkok/8190136/1600.webp", "https://images.asiabylocals.com/asiabylocals/reviews/chinatown-food-tour-with-michelin-food-stalls-in-bangkok/8190137/1600.webp"] },
                { author: "Jacqui", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-08-16", text: "5 hrs after landing from Australia and Na was guiding us around the busy streets of Chinatown tasting everything from coconut pancakes to fish bladder soup. What an absolute superstar she is - keeping us entertained with stories of Chinatown and explanations of all the food whilst battling through the crowds. Soooo much food consumed but soooo much fun.", photos: ["https://images.asiabylocals.com/asiabylocals/reviews/chinatown-food-tour-with-michelin-food-stalls-in-bangkok/8172221/1600.webp", "https://images.asiabylocals.com/asiabylocals/reviews/chinatown-food-tour-with-michelin-food-stalls-in-bangkok/8172222/1600.webp"] },
                { author: "Stella", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-08-11", text: "Our guide, Peak, was absolutely fantastic! We have had a few tours during our visit, and I discovered that who the guide is entirely makes the difference and can very well shift your mood either way. I don't think we could have asked for more. She was patient, giving us enough time between stops to eat or rest, go to the toilet, or just for the group to interact with each other. All the food stalls that we visited had amazing food - 10 out of 10. The walks were not too long, but still enough to allow for a pleasant chat. I am vegetarian I didn't state this when booking because I went with my h", photos: ["https://images.asiabylocals.com/asiabylocals/reviews/chinatown-food-tour-with-michelin-food-stalls-in-bangkok/8080736/1600.webp", "https://images.asiabylocals.com/asiabylocals/reviews/chinatown-food-tour-with-michelin-food-stalls-in-bangkok/8080737/1600.webp", "https://images.asiabylocals.com/asiabylocals/reviews/chinatown-food-tour-with-michelin-food-stalls-in-bangkok/8080738/1600.webp"] },
                { author: "Gillian", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-09-09", text: "Come hungry! Eve was an incredible guide and the mix of dishes was perfect and delicious!" },
                { author: "Mary-Anne", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-09-04", text: "Meet-up instructions were clear and detailed. Our guide Peak made all participants of the group feel welcome and encouraged everyone to engage with each other. Peak was happy to share her time with us and make it a memorable experience. She shared her knowledge about the Chinatown area and showed us some places that are rarely found by the average tourist. Food was plentiful - both savoury and sweet. Would highly recommend. Great value for money." },
                { author: "Robin", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-08-14", text: "Definitely come hungry! Eve was fantastic. Very knowledgeable and made sure we were all very well taken care of. Did I say come hungry? Yeah…skip a meal before (in a good way. You won’t be disappointed)" },
                { author: "Yael", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-08-01", text: "The tour was great. Many different options to try and taste. Eve the guide is fun and cute, with lots of patients and knowledge. Good English! The only thing we may suggest is to add a bit more walking between the stations to have the food go down a bit" },
                { author: "Louise", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-07-30", text: "I highly recommend this tour as a way to see China Town. Be prepared to go starving though as there are many courses both savoury and sweet , big and small. We visited Michelin starred and other awarded places, all food tasted was really good. The group size of 8 was just big enough to feel friendly and thanks to our tour guide Eve the whole evening was a great success. The tour had been a highlight of our stay - book it for sure." },
                { author: "Jasmine", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-07-02", text: "Peak was a great guide! We had an amazing time and ate waayyyy too much food! I’d definitely recommend going hungry! Some highlights for us were the Chinese doughnuts, Thai sausage and banana roti! Yum" },
                { author: "Hayley", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-06-27", text: "Eve was incredible! We started out in a curry stall that I know we would never have even seen let alone be brave enough to try on our own but it was so good! All the foods were delicious and different, taking us to restaurants, food carts down alleys and right through the street night market. Eve made time for special requests as well, our daughter wanted to try durian and she made that happen. Definitely recommend but come hungry! Thanks for a great and very filling evening!" },
                { author: "Katie", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-08-05", text: "Sunday was great, very knowledgeable and kind. The tour was a lot of fun! Good food, good people, just a good time!" },
                { author: "Samera", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-07-17", text: "Eve is such a brilliant guide! She explained all the stops, made us feel like one big group and made sure we were all involved, was so friendly and we all left more than full! Thanks for a brilliant evening!" }
            ]
        },
