                { author: "Gosia", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-09-10", text: "We liked the trip to Ayutthaya. It was organised and transport was well planed. Bus is airconditioned and comfy. Sometimes we had a trouble with understanding our guide but he was friendly and tried to make the tour as interesting as possible. Jeed spoke not only about the temples we visit but also Thailand in general. Thanks to him we tried roti flatbreads." },
                { author: "Baton", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-09-08", text: "An absolute 5-star experience! Sam was exceptionally professional, kind, and knowledgeable. He explained everything clearly and made me feel completely cared for. Thank you for wonderful service!" },
                { author: "Diane", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-09-07", text: "The whole experience was well organized. Are guide Kiwi was amazing, very knowledgeable and full of energies, making sure everybody was getting the best visit possible. Our driver Joxy was also very professional, curtious and so friendly. Beautiful day visiting multiple Temples, saw some Elephants on our way there. Kiwi made sure we stopped for restrooms half way there. We also had stops for refreshments and snacks. Would greatly recommend this tour" },
                { author: "Glen", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-09-06", text: "The day was excellent. We saw so many wonderful sights. Temples and ruins of temples dating back 500 years. Our guide Jeet was so helpful, kind and knowledgeable." }
