  'jay-fai-michelin-star-table-reservation-and-city-tour-in-bangkok': {
            averageRating: 4.35,
            totalReviews: 79,
            guideRating: 4.68,
            valueRating: 4.06,
            reviews: [
                { author: "Johan", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-09-02", text: "Jay Fai is bucketlist work. Tried earlier but without the skip te line it is almost impossible to eat the famius Crab omelete." },
                { author: "Angie", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-07-30", text: "The guide ensured their was minimal wait. She had me pre-order my food, a table was set aside for me, she was prepared and introduced herself and the food came out freshly made and delicious! This restaurant is worth the hype and the crab omelette is like nothing I have ever tasted and was better than I expected. ⭐️⭐️⭐️⭐️⭐️ for service and food." },
                { author: "Aruna", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-07-11", text: "We did not have a city tour. Jay Fai's food was excellent! Best crab curry I've had. The place was not crowded at all and we saw two groups of people just walking in so we did wonder if an expensive booking was necessary. In any case, the food was great and the guide offered us delicious mango with sticky rice as well. Well worth the visit" },
                { author: "Gianluca", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-06-20", text: "Very well organised, with timely and well thought transportation between all the attractions. It was also flexible and adjusted to our needs. Overall excellent experience" },
                { author: "Marcus", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-06-18", text: "Experiencing Jay Fai, was one of the greatest things ever. The food was great, and she was most hospitable to take a picture." },
                { author: "Zack", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-06-14", text: "The team was very good about reaching out and letting me know what information they needed to make sure my experience was enjoyable. I got the most amazing table looking directly into the kitchen, so I could watch all of the activity. The food was amazing and I thoroughly enjoyed myself. There was a Royal funeral happening. In many roads around the restaurant were closed. The team was so helpful in giving me suggestions on how to get back to my hotel." },
                { author: "Felicia", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-04-30", text: "Excellent! I loved that my tour guide really cared that I had a great experience! Five star service along with a 5-star meal! Thank you so much!" },
                { author: "Thomas", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-02-14", text: "Skipped the queue with no waiting at all. Saw menu & pre-ordered with friendly staff making sure it was seamless. Fantastic seat inside watching Jay Fai cook up a storm. The famous Crab omelette cooked fresh was incredible. Wasn’t the cheapest, but it was priceless if on your list, saving time & queuing in the heat. As Bangkok is amazing and you’ll never see it all but this option made sure it was one my highlights. Great stuff - thank you." },
                { author: "Gauke", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-02-12", text: "It was really nice. Helpful, caring and good people. Would definitely recommend!" },
                { author: "Eva", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-02-10", text: "It was great! We got there in our turn to seat. Our order was preordered." },
                { author: "Martin", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-01-31", text: "Great service – everything went exactly as agreed. We arrived on time, didn’t have to wait, and were seated immediately. Communication was smooth, fast, and straightforward. On site, the organizer found us right away, explained everything clearly, and even gave us helpful recommendations. I can only recommend it – 10/10 if you want the certainty that you’ll get a table, enjoy your meal, and have a guaranteed spot. It’s absolutely worth it. And the crab omelette? A big, big, big delight 😄 Thank you!" },
                { author: "Tyler", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-01-31", text: "It was great. A lot of communication beforehand which was very helpful. Definitely recommend. Gives you your day back." }
            ]
        },
