            reviews: [
                { author: "Florencia", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-09-16", text: "Tank has been very polite and has explained the history of the places we’ve visited, always with a smile. He’s been kind, and has successfully to take us to all spots in the trip safe and on time." },
                { author: "Jose", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-09-16", text: "Kudos to Jack for giving a one-of-a-kind tour in Maeklong and Ayutthaya. Despite being the lone booking for the day, the tour still proceeded. The whole trip feels so personal and accommodating. Not only did we visit picturesque temples and markets, I have learned a lot about Thai history and culture as well. Jack is very knowledgeable not only about the places we visit, but the Thai history in general. He is also a huge help when navigating through the market and attending to my needs if there are any. I am looking forward to booking another with TripGuru and of course, Jack." },
                { author: "Claire", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-09-14", text: "Highly recommended and such a fun tour! We learnt a lot about Thai culture and history from our tour guide, Jack. He was a really cool guy, very knowledgeable, and a pleasure to talk to. My favourite part of the tour was definitely the railway market — such a unique experience and something I’d highly recommend seeing while in Thailand! ⭐️⭐️⭐️⭐️⭐️" },
                { author: "Sigita", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-09-13", text: "wonderful trip, I loved everything in Ayutthaya! and railway& floating market experience🥰 we had the best driver & the guide Jack was brilliant & gave us lots of advise & his knowledge about Bangkok and Thailand is jus amazing! would love to go again in few years and see how the country changed🥰" },
                { author: "Jakob", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-09-13", text: "What a brilliant day. VIP treatment throughout. Very small group. Nancy our guide was truly first class. sweet and full of character. Highly recommended. Great way to spend a day." },
                { author: "Thaddeus", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-09-12", text: "Wonderful tour! Nacy was very knowledgeable and shared the beautiful history of the Thai culture. Each experience was a memorable moment that will last a lifetime. The stop we enjoyed the most was the railway market. We highly recommend and hope to have Nancy as our tour guide for our next visit to Thailand." },
                { author: "Rochelle", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-09-07", text: "Perfect tour to do from Bangkok! I didn't feel it was rush, and contemplated all the highlights of each place. Guide Thai was the kindest and taught us so much about thai history. Definitely a must do while in Bangkok!" },
                { author: "Lisa", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-09-06", text: "Our trip was so awesome. We loved our hide Mr X! We had almost a private tour and our guide was so accommodating. We even got to do an elephant ride. So much fun!!" },
                { author: "Nazarena", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-09-05", text: "Our trip to Ayutthaya was absolutely wonderful all thanks to Mr. Tank. Not only was he knowledgeable when it came to explaining the rich history of each site and was patient when it came to guiding us throughout chaotic moments of the market; Mr. Tank was a true gentleman and made himself easily accessible when it came to each individual’s need. Because the tour is quite the distance, lasting about 11 hrs, he made sure we had access to bathrooms and fresh drinks throughout the day to keep us comfortable. Because many of us were solo travelers he also offered to take pictures of us to remember" },
                { author: "Cara", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-09-02", text: "We had a great experience on our Ayutthaya tour with our guide, Tank! He was very nice, friendly, and informative throughout the entire tour. He explained the history and significance of the different places we visited in a way that was easy to understand and made the experience even more interesting. We really enjoyed our time exploring Ayutthaya with him. Thank you, Tank, for a wonderful tour! 😊🇹🇭" },
                { author: "Dominik", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-09-02", text: "I really liked the train market and the temples in Ayutthaya! Very good food on boat market." },
                { author: "Chrystelle", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-08-30", text: "We had a wonderful experience with our guide. She was very friendly, helpful, enthusiastic, and always willing to make our visit as enjoyable as possible. She shared a lot of interesting information and took great care of us throughout the day. We really appreciated her kindness and professionalism. Highly recommended!" }
            ]
