                { author: "Elisa-Aida", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-09-05", text: "It was very fun. Many stops and a lot of Little Extras. The whole team and especially palm are very nice and the photographer took a lot of nice pictures" },
                { author: "Ryn", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-08-31", text: "Wawa is a great tour guide. Very funny and knowledgeable. The tour was fun and it was a great way to get out of the city for a few hours" },
                { author: "Alison", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-08-28", text: "Enjoyed today’s tour. Palm, the driver, assistant and photographer were excellent. As we went through Bangkok, Palm shared history. The ride was pleasant and very comfortable. Surprised by the snacks and food served —very good — especially the mango and sweet rice and the afternoon local snacks; plus we had a full lunch main course. The floating market was my highlight. Highly recommend the tour. Palm is a professional guide." },
                { author: "Frank", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-08-26", text: "Floating market and train market are a must see during a stay in Bangkok. Tour was well organised and Wawa a great and warm tour guide." },
                { author: "Kiran", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-08-23", text: "Wawa, the driver and the photographer gave us an amazing experience of the train market and floating market. She was very knowledgeable about Thailand and the areas that we visited. The journey and coach was comfortable and the food was tasty. A great experience overall. It’s to have a guide to understand the culture. Many thanks for a wonderful day Pathak Family" },
                { author: "Elizabeth", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-08-20", text: "the train was the most exhileratimg part thank you and would highly recommend visiting these locations. the floating markets and all the boats is a different way of life. well worth the visit. thank you" }
