                { author: "Vjola", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2025-04-12", text: "I highly recommend this tour. Everything went smoothly and all the cafes were charming and unique. Keng was a very cheerful and helpful guide, gave us plenty of interesting information and made the trip enjoyable." }
