                { author: "Stella", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-07-20", text: "What an incredible pool party! The atmosphere was amazing from start to finish, with great music, stunning views, and a fun, friendly crowd. The DJs kept the energy high all day, the drinks were excellent, and the staff were welcoming and attentive. Everything was well organized, making it easy to relax and enjoy the experience. If you're looking for one of the best pool parties in Bangkok, this is definitely the place to be. Highly recommended—I can't wait to come back! If you'd like, I can also make it sound more luxurious, more energetic, or more like a genuine traveler review.", photos: ["https://images.asiabylocals.com/asiabylocals/reviews/rooftop-pool-party-at-centara-grand-bangkok-by-local-operator/7672572/1600.webp", "https://images.asiabylocals.com/asiabylocals/reviews/rooftop-pool-party-at-centara-grand-bangkok-by-local-operator/7672573/1600.webp", "https://images.asiabylocals.com/asiabylocals/reviews/rooftop-pool-party-at-centara-grand-bangkok-by-local-operator/7672574/1600.webp"] }
