  'customize-your-own-private-bangkok-city-tour': {
            averageRating: 4.45,
            totalReviews: 683,
            guideRating: 4.48,
            valueRating: 4.28,
            reviews: [
                { author: "Mark", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-09-10", text: "Jack took me around some of the amazing sites of Bangkok. He is so knowledgeable about the history of Thailand, the Thai monarchy, and the specific history of Bangkok as the nation’s capital! I would recommend him 100%. Very considerate and supportive of me with a temporary sore back. Please, ask for him when you book with GYG. Mr Lit the driver is also wonderfull. What a great team. Mark Morrison" },
                { author: "Lisa", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-08-21", text: "My Tour guide Boi ( unsure of spelling) was very knowledgeable. I left the tour educated on what I saw. It was a lovely day and the driver was safe and provided refreshment on such a warm day. I’m so glad I booked a private tour." },
                { author: "Maria", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-07-24", text: "Napat was an excellent tour guide, who answered all my questioned and taught me a lot about Thai. He made my first travel to Thailand very informative and personalized my itinerary. The driver was also very nice. Thank you for the experience" },
                { author: "jonathon", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-07-20", text: "The whole day was brilliant, with our guide being really insightful and helpful. Having a tour guide allowed us to see all the sights of Bangkok without the stress of doing it ourselves with our children (13 & 2). We got to see everything, learn about the history while being in safe hands." },
                { author: "Lisa", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-07-19", text: "Tank was a fabulous guide. He was very accomodating when our flight ran late and adjusted the tour to suit the time we had. He is very knowledgeable and gave us a great insight into the attractions. Highly recommend!" },
                { author: "Nicole", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-07-04", text: "We enjoyed a lot this private tour. The driver was helpful, on time and provided clear instructions." },
                { author: "Amy", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-06-18", text: "The trip with Eddy was amazing! He took us all around the city, saw many temples and sights of the city. We loved the experience. Glad we were in a private tour to have time to see everything. Eddy was very informative and took us places we would have never known to go! Recommend to anyone on your stay in Bangkok. We could have never seen or got the experience we had with Eddy on our own." },
                { author: "Filippo", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-04-04", text: "awesome, the guide was lovely and she organized everything perfectly. thank you." },
                { author: "Priya", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-03-23", text: "It was an absolute delight from beginning to end. The guide Nancy is really fabulous- she was considerate of the older members in our group, joked with the younger ones and has phenomenal knowledge and advice about all the sights and experiences. When I come back I would love to have Nancy as a guide again to show us the rest of Bangkok that e missed this time." },
                { author: "Malcolm", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-03-16", text: "our guide Fern was fantastic,sue took us to everywhere we wanted and some extra places and took her time to explain everything, I can heartedly recommend this tour and Fern" },
                { author: "Romana", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-02-15", text: "It was great! Good help with choosing the right spots to see. A lot of interesting info about the land, city and more. We saw and learned a lot. We highly recommend Thanachoat as guide an expert also in history with his great driver. Thanks again" },
                { author: "Pedro", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-02-14", text: "Jacky was phenomenal. Great service!! Amazing performance. He went far and beyond his duties to provide a great experience. Nick, our driver… extraordinary as well. Congrats!!!" }
            ]
        },
