                { author: "Traveller", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-07-16", text: "Tanya is a very friendly and knowlegable guide. I used to live in Bangkok but this tour showed me some new and vibrant dimensions of Bangkok. Highly recommended." }
