            reviews: [
                { author: "Marra", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-08-27", text: "We had an amazing night! Both our guide and drivers were amazing! Thank you so much!🩷", photos: ["https://images.asiabylocals.com/asiabylocals/reviews/guided-tour-in-a-typical-thai-tuk-tuk-in-bangkok/8398893/1600.webp"] },
                { author: "Ian", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-08-19", text: "I had a private tour and Ken was my tour guide. I had an amazing trip round the key stops and he shared some much information with me about the history of Bangkok and how the city has evolved. An excellent and very informative two hours which answered a lot of questions that had cropped up during my visit to Bangkok.", photos: ["https://images.asiabylocals.com/asiabylocals/reviews/guided-tour-in-a-typical-thai-tuk-tuk-in-bangkok/8237178/1600.webp"] },
                { author: "Cathy", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-07-10", text: "we booked the tour in the last minute. But it was very interesting to explore the old town with Tuk Tuk. Anna is a great guide to explain the history and culture to let us know. I learned lots during the trip. Recommend to people who like to see some glances of Bangkok without much walking!", photos: ["https://images.asiabylocals.com/asiabylocals/reviews/guided-tour-in-a-typical-thai-tuk-tuk-in-bangkok/7530251/1600.webp", "https://images.asiabylocals.com/asiabylocals/reviews/guided-tour-in-a-typical-thai-tuk-tuk-in-bangkok/7530252/1600.webp"] },
                { author: "Jelle", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-09-20", text: "Tour was very fun, Anna was a great tour guide. We already visited some of the places ourselves, but with the guide we got a lot of new information. Also nice to explore some places we would never be at without this tour" },
                { author: "Robyn", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-09-17", text: "Our tuk tuk guide, Anna, was very amiable and knowledgable - her explanation of the places we visited was extensive and easy to understand. We (sisters from Australia) enjoyed learning about Thai customs and traditions. Thanks Anna for your care and teaching us to say some Thai words and decorate a Lotus Lily flower. We had fun." },
                { author: "julie", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-09-04", text: "Great tour! So informative and great knowledge about the city." },
                { author: "Kerry", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-08-22", text: "Nikki was an excellent tour guide - helpful, very knowledgeable and friendly. It was a great way to see Bangkok, especially at night time." },
                { author: "Lluch", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-08-10", text: "Thanks to Jochen and our drivers, we had a great experience. I recommend this activity highly." },
                { author: "Susan", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-08-05", text: "Anna the tour guide was excellent. Spoke very good English and gave us lots of information about the sites we saw. Would highly recommend." },
                { author: "Virginie", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-07-24", text: "Wonderful Time with Anna, who gave us many « behind the scene » informations about the local life" },
                { author: "Lauren", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-07-08", text: "Ana was a fantastic tour guide. She answered all our questions about Bangkok and Thailand. Incredibly knowledgeable and had great local facts. Highly recommend for a quick overview of the city!" },
                { author: "Jeanett", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-06-29", text: "Excellent tour! Especially our tour guide Anna - thank you :)" }
            ]
