  'theluxurywhite-and-whiteorchid-dinner-cruise-free-beer-in-bangkok': {
            averageRating: 4.29,
            totalReviews: 148,
            guideRating: 4.34,
            valueRating: 4.25,
            reviews: [
                { author: "Joe", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-08-04", text: "Great food and amazing views!!! Staff was amazing!! Very professional.", photos: ["https://images.asiabylocals.com/asiabylocals/reviews/theluxurywhite-and-whiteorchid-dinner-cruise-free-beer-in-bangkok/7943247/1600.webp", "https://images.asiabylocals.com/asiabylocals/reviews/theluxurywhite-and-whiteorchid-dinner-cruise-free-beer-in-bangkok/7943248/1600.webp", "https://images.asiabylocals.com/asiabylocals/reviews/theluxurywhite-and-whiteorchid-dinner-cruise-free-beer-in-bangkok/7943249/1600.webp"] },
                { author: "I", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-06-29", text: "great wibes people from all over the world,some celebrating special occasions. great food and plenty of it too. drinks included but you can order special cocktails for 150tbh too nice views from the river to new and old Bangkok", photos: ["https://images.asiabylocals.com/asiabylocals/reviews/theluxurywhite-and-whiteorchid-dinner-cruise-free-beer-in-bangkok/7379294/1600.webp", "https://images.asiabylocals.com/asiabylocals/reviews/theluxurywhite-and-whiteorchid-dinner-cruise-free-beer-in-bangkok/7379295/1600.webp", "https://images.asiabylocals.com/asiabylocals/reviews/theluxurywhite-and-whiteorchid-dinner-cruise-free-beer-in-bangkok/7379296/1600.webp"] },
                { author: "Kevin", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-02-02", text: "This was more than I expected, in a great way ! Weather could not have been nicer. We were on Deck 1 / Upper Deck, as was everyone I would deem. Buffet was decent. We did not sample any free beer or wine. Singers were good. The burlesque show was quite entertaining ! The Entertainers walked throughout the guests, posing for pictures, and generating pictures. This was the most fun we have had in Bangkok. We had been visiting historic sites. We wrapped up the evening with a ride on the giant Ferris wheel. It was quite a care-free and very nice evening !", photos: ["https://images.asiabylocals.com/asiabylocals/reviews/theluxurywhite-and-whiteorchid-dinner-cruise-free-beer-in-bangkok/5363513/1600.webp"] },
                { author: "Veronica", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-09-16", text: "They were super helpful when the taxi got us there really late, and then also moved us to a window table :-)" },
                { author: "Nardu", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-09-08", text: "Nothing, it was a very affordable night out with great entertainment and fantastic views" },
                { author: "Nichole", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-07-27", text: "Hilarious! We weren't expecting it to be as lively as it was but we laughed a lot. Food was lovely as well." },
                { author: "Adam", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-04-09", text: "Excellent would recommend to any tourists visiting Bangkok as a must!" },
                { author: "Sharon", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-02-11", text: "Nice cruise, good food. Signage for where to be could be a little easier to find" },
                { author: "Michael", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 4, date: "2026-04-28", text: "When we got there we went to the check in counter and they only had us down for 2 people when in fact there were 5 of us and we had paid for 5 and had the vouchers to prove it but they still made me open the app to show them this, they then gave us 5 tickets. When we got on the boat there was still only a table for 2 of us, again we had to get that sorted and they again checked everything first. Less than ideal. Cruise was ok." },
                { author: "Ana", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 4, date: "2026-09-20", text: "Fuimos en grupo y fue divertido. Se pasa rápido el tour. Los monumentos iluminados preciosos. Lo peor el embarque, lloviendo, lento y sin nada donde guardarse. Embarcamos mucho más tarde de lo previsto. La comida buffet rica y en cantidad. Las actuaciones lipsing, pero graciosas." },
                { author: "Barbara", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 4, date: "2026-09-17", text: "Serata carina, intrattenimento divertente e coinvolgente. Il personale è molto disponibile e gentile. Cibo abbondante per tutti i gusti. Da provare!" },
                { author: "Estela", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-09-15", text: "La verdad que me gustó bastante! Pudimos ver los templos de noche, el ambiente de Bangkok, el skyline, el puente maravilloso que cruza el río. Me parece que es una actividad que hay que hacer si vienes a esta maravillosa ciudad." }
            ]
        },
