  'opulence-luxury-buffet-dinner-cruise-with-live-band-in-bangkok': {
            averageRating: 4.53,
            totalReviews: 387,
            guideRating: 4.55,
            valueRating: 4.42,
            reviews: [
                { author: "Angie", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2025-12-23", text: "One of the largest, modern and best looking ship in the harbour! The dinner buffet was well presented with jumbo prawns, shrimps and oysters. Also had a good selection of sushi and sashimi and other meats/vegetable and pasta dishes as well. Ample fruits, desserts and welcome drink. The band was lively and kept us entertained. Great value! Must do if you are in Bangkok!", photos: ["https://images.asiabylocals.com/asiabylocals/reviews/opulence-luxury-buffet-dinner-cruise-with-live-band-in-bangkok/4977854/1600.webp", "https://images.asiabylocals.com/asiabylocals/reviews/opulence-luxury-buffet-dinner-cruise-with-live-band-in-bangkok/4977856/1600.webp", "https://images.asiabylocals.com/asiabylocals/reviews/opulence-luxury-buffet-dinner-cruise-with-live-band-in-bangkok/4977857/1600.webp"] },
                { author: "Nicola", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2025-12-08", text: "Very efficient service throughout! Thoroughly enjoyed this river cruise with my husband & 2 dayghters( 20&19) it was the 19 year old’s birthday. Loved that the crew waved to us as the ship was coming into doc! We were welcomed on board with the lovely friendly sta, welcoming staff. They showed us to our seats straight away. The waiter was there in a flash to take drink orders of which there was an extensive range. And was nearby to top up my glass of wine when he saw it was running low. The brilliant singer then talked us through the safety instructions and intinery of the trip and then the bu", photos: ["https://images.asiabylocals.com/asiabylocals/reviews/opulence-luxury-buffet-dinner-cruise-with-live-band-in-bangkok/4852470/1600.webp", "https://images.asiabylocals.com/asiabylocals/reviews/opulence-luxury-buffet-dinner-cruise-with-live-band-in-bangkok/4852471/1600.webp", "https://images.asiabylocals.com/asiabylocals/reviews/opulence-luxury-buffet-dinner-cruise-with-live-band-in-bangkok/4852472/1600.webp"] },
                { author: "Andreas", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-04-11", text: "Roughly 2h cruise up and down river. Some of the landmarks really shine from river. Service was great, all staff so friendly and attentive. The guide sang many songs and him and his colleague was actually really good singers. Food was maybe a 4/5. For the price I thought it was good. Some hit and miss, but the prawns and the sushi was great. Overall happy and would do it again" },
                { author: "Diana", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-02-25", text: "Great experience. We had a lovely time and ate so much!!!! It was a delightful time and would highly recommend to book when in Bangkok." },
                { author: "Joseph", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-02-21", text: "The boarding/entering was not organized 300 people and rushing in to get into the boat. And then when they say it’s time to eat it’s like it was the last supper. Once you get your food and sit down. The DJ does an awesome job. Definitely worth going. But be prepared for chaos." },
                { author: "Eveline", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2025-12-27", text: "The food was really good and the band was great! Be mindful that the boat has 3 levels and the tickets you get with this provider are on the lower floor. Please allow sufficient time to exchange the voucher confirmation to an actual ticket and board the boat." },
                { author: "Melanie", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2025-12-25", text: "Pros; the staff was superb and there was more the enough AMAZING food. River prawns were huge. The buffet still had food as we prepared to dock so there is no need to rush to the buffet when it opens. There is more than enough food for everyone. Cons: get there early as there is a crowd who all board at different times for different boats. We were category 1, which means we were in the basement… I wish I knew how to book the roof top instead. And getting transportation after was a gong show and traffic was so bad our Grab took an hour to arrive. End: I’d book this boat again. We were a family" },
                { author: "Helen", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2025-11-27", text: "Excellent from the moment we arrived at the boarding point to the end Staff were very helpful, polite, & friendly The singers were excellent Food was tasty & plentiful, ( no need to rush for food, chefs keep it all topped up) All in all a lovely trip ( just a shame the light show was cancelled, due to the Queen mother passing) Thank you for a wonderful evening" },
                { author: "John", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2025-11-13", text: "Chaotic check-in and boarding process at Iconsiam, but once on board the boat the staff were very friendly and helpful, the buffet dinner outstanding and the moonlit views of Bangkok were breathtaking." },
                { author: "Ryan", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2025-02-02", text: "perfect !!! we booked rooftop !!!! wide selection of food and very good .. there was also sushi on 1st floor ..... water refill.for free .... and the singer and bank were amazing !!!!! thank you so much !!! this is the nicest boat there was in the river with open roof" },
                { author: "Sam", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2025-01-10", text: "Really good and I can’t wait to rebook with family" },
                { author: "bogdan", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2024-12-20", text: "The best way to spend a last night in Bangkok, love it! Great job, pro and friendly!!" }
            ]
        },
