                { author: "Morphing", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2025-11-26", text: "Suntaree has been a wonderful guide, explaining everything with passion and happiness, making the whole experience very interesting and light. The time spent in each part of the tour was enough to take photos and view the temples, the ride on the tuk rul was so thrilling and the walk in chinatown so immersive! Khop khun krap Suntaree!", photos: ["https://images.asiabylocals.com/asiabylocals/reviews/evening-tour-with-wat-arun-wat-pho-and-tuk-tuk-ride/4741494/1600.webp", "https://images.asiabylocals.com/asiabylocals/reviews/evening-tour-with-wat-arun-wat-pho-and-tuk-tuk-ride/4741495/1600.webp", "https://images.asiabylocals.com/asiabylocals/reviews/evening-tour-with-wat-arun-wat-pho-and-tuk-tuk-ride/4741496/1600.webp"] },
                { author: "He", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-07-21", text: "Umboon/Nancy was a great tour guide- very knowledgeable, lots to share- highly recommended!" },
                { author: "Punreet", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-04-04", text: "Eddy was my tour guide. Friendly and explained everything thoroughly. We weren’t rushed and went through everything in a nice way. Doing it in the evening helps beat the morning heat for sure and sunset views is a separate plus." },
                { author: "Brenda", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-03-31", text: "We had so much fun! Our guide was so knowledgeable about the temples, Bangkok and Chinatown. We saw things we never would’ve seen on our own." },
                { author: "Sharon", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-03-20", text: "The tour guide Bond was absolutely fantastic. Very informative, helpful and accommodating Sharon Rose" },
                { author: "Gemma", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-03-17", text: "Alice was an excellent guide! Fun, knowledgeable and kept a great eye on the group! Her ability to navigate us through Chinatown was second to none." },
                { author: "Sandhya", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2025-12-22", text: "Beer was knowledgeable & very accommodating. Will definitely recommend Beer to fellow travelers." },
                { author: "Andreas", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2025-11-29", text: "Sun was a fantastic tourguide. She contacted me the day before to give additional information. On the tour she explained everything very detailed. I strongly can reccommend her." },
                { author: "Ilaria", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2025-11-26", text: "Suntaree is an exceptional guide, with a radiant spirit and a joyful energy. She explained the tour with genuine passion, making every moment truly special. An unforgettable experience in every way❤️" },
                { author: "Jennifer", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2025-11-21", text: "The tour was amazing. Our guide Jack explained everything super great and gave us a lot of great information and we enjoyed it very much. It was really impressive, we had a lot of fun and I can really recommend to go on the Bangkok: Evening Tour with Wat Arun, Wat Pho & Tuk Tuk Ride." },
                { author: "Caroline", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2025-11-20", text: "Our guide Bonnie was the best! Very knowledgeable, interesting not to forget funny! She pours a lot into the tour and gives many extra information. Chinatown was a the cherry on the top of the tour. Very recommended!" }
