  'hop-on-hop-off-bus-with-24-48-or-72-hour-validity-in-bangkok': {
            averageRating: 4.02,
            totalReviews: 2181,
            guideRating: 3.98,
            valueRating: 3.96,
            reviews: [
                { author: "Lindsay", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-08-23", text: "A great way to get an overview of Bangkok from the roof of the bus. Traffic, people, architecture of new buildings. Great intro to the city. Modern and Chinatown .", photos: ["https://images.asiabylocals.com/asiabylocals/reviews/hop-on-hop-off-bus-with-24-48-or-72-hour-validity-in-bangkok/8312200/1600.webp", "https://images.asiabylocals.com/asiabylocals/reviews/hop-on-hop-off-bus-with-24-48-or-72-hour-validity-in-bangkok/8312202/1600.webp", "https://images.asiabylocals.com/asiabylocals/reviews/hop-on-hop-off-bus-with-24-48-or-72-hour-validity-in-bangkok/8312203/1600.webp"] },
                { author: "Hugh", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-05-19", text: "The Bangkok Hop-On Hop-Off Bus is a very easy and convenient way to see and experience many temples, museums, monuments and historical sites in different districts of Bangkok. We were able to get off at various sites to visit the Golden Buddha, the Grand Palace, Wat Po and Wat Arun sites. The ability to digitally track the buses to re- board the hop-on bus after visiting sites at various stops is great. Also the automated narration is very descriptive and provides quite a bit of good information as you go. We took the Sky Train to Siam Paragon Mall in the city center which is the starting poin", photos: ["https://images.asiabylocals.com/asiabylocals/reviews/hop-on-hop-off-bus-with-24-48-or-72-hour-validity-in-bangkok/6743479/1600.webp", "https://images.asiabylocals.com/asiabylocals/reviews/hop-on-hop-off-bus-with-24-48-or-72-hour-validity-in-bangkok/6743480/1600.webp", "https://images.asiabylocals.com/asiabylocals/reviews/hop-on-hop-off-bus-with-24-48-or-72-hour-validity-in-bangkok/6743481/1600.webp"] },
                { author: "leroy", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-09-05", text: "got on the bus at 1st stop driver really helpful sorting my ticket out fully aircon bus the stops are well spaced out and stop by quite a few of the main touristy parts of bangkok worth the money" },
                { author: "Hector", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-08-25", text: "Great activity to visit the city especially when you do not have much time to move around. The city is too vast and reaching the places can take lots of time. With this hop on hop off you can travel smoothless around" },
                { author: "Anjali", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-08-15", text: "Amazing experience and got to know so much about Thailand." },
                { author: "Brian", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-05-21", text: "all worked only issue length of tine between stops in that heat" },
                { author: "Samantha", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-05-19", text: "It was a good way of getting around, but you have to make sure you plan things well and research how long you need at each stop , in my opinion there’s no way you could do all of the stops and have sufficient time at each unless you were good at fast pace especially in the heat lol , also I would recommend just going to the places you most want to see first 😎" },
                { author: "Ashika", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-04-07", text: "Best way to get to the main spots! Recommend an early start though - to get the most out of it…" },
                { author: "Petina", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-03-09", text: "Great activity, the only little thing is that there are no sings at the bus stops for hop on hop off bus and it is kind of hard to understand where to wait for the bus. Maybe this could be improved." },
                { author: "Mohammad", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-01-18", text: "Great Bus Tour, many good places to visit, bus nice and cool" },
                { author: "Sandra", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2025-07-05", text: "A great way to get an overview of the city plus you can choose where to get on or off or just stay on board for the whole circuit." },
                { author: "Renee", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2025-06-28", text: "We enjoyed the hop on hop off the bus. Wish we could have visited more stops, but time didn’t permit. We love that it had earphones, so that we could listen to a tour in our own language. We didn’t have to worry About deep accents or having a concentrate on understanding the tour. We would definitely book a tour like this again." }
            ]
        },
