  'bangkok-night-tour-food-temple-and-tuk-tuk-by-local-operator': {
            averageRating: 4.75,
            totalReviews: 101,
            guideRating: 4.78,
            valueRating: 4.6,
            reviews: [
                { author: "Amy", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-09-20", text: "Noni our guide was amazing! So full of life and very fun experience overall. The food, and each stop she made so much fun and personable. Our tuk tuk driver was great as well. Highly recommend booking with Noni if you want to laugh and enjoy the tour." },
                { author: "Deborah", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-02-17", text: "We had a great time on tour. Kwan was a wonderful guide and was so knowledgeable about Bangkok and its history. She took us to a temple we would never have known to visit on our own as well as a delicious and authentic restaurant in Chinatown. She took many amazing pictures of us through the night." },
                { author: "Louise", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-02-02", text: "Mr.Nonni was fabulous!! From start to finish she was good fun and very passionate about Thailand and its culture.. we ate amazing food..the tuk tuk drive was great.. saw parts of the city we may have missed if not on the tour!!😊" },
                { author: "Laura", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2025-12-22", text: "Great tour! We were able to see so much of the city in one night. Lots of amazing food to try at the markets as well as visiting a lovely local restaurant. Highly recommend." },
                { author: "Carol", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2025-12-09", text: "Nina was a great guide and very passionate. she took great photos too. the driver too was lovely. we learnt a lot from Nina and tried lots of delicious street food. we now know how to prepare a lotus flower! the only thing I would change is the tuk tuk itself. it was very difficult to get into when you get past a certain age. the tuktuks in Cambodia have a small step and are far easier to deal with than the Thai ones. hence the 4 rather than 5 stats on transportation. all in all we thoroughly enjoyed ourselves. many thanks Nina!" },
                { author: "Ivan", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2025-10-26", text: "We had an amazing evening with our guide Fern! She was super friendly, helpful and took all the time to show and explain us everything! Thank you so much for this wonderful experience!" },
                { author: "Rachel2986@hotmail.com", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2025-08-21", text: "Our guide Fern was brilliant showing us all the sights in Bangkok and exploring food places off the beaten track. Incredible. A great way to explore Bangkok and ended in Chinatown trying delicious street food. Would 100% recommend when visiting Bangkok for the first time." },
                { author: "Angelica", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2025-08-07", text: "We had an unforgettable experience on our tuk tuk tour in Bangkok! From the very beginning, everything was perfectly organized. Our tuk tuk driver was incredibly kind and made us feel safe and comfortable throughout the ride. The real highlight of the tour, however, was our amazing guide, Natty. Natty was absolutely wonderful — not only was she extremely knowledgeable about Thai culture, history, and local life, but she was also incredibly patient and attentive. She took the time to answer all our questions, adapt the tour to our interests, and made sure we were enjoying every moment. Her warm" },
                { author: "Georgina", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2025-07-04", text: "The perfect way to finish off our 2 days in Bangkok. Nina was an excellent and knowledgeable guide. She let us know what we would be doing, checked our preferences, and helped us to experience Bangkok in a way we could not have by ourselves - from street food treats to a Riverside dinner. I particularly appreciated that she could share our wonder at the sparkling buildings! Thanks to Mon for driving us safely. Thanks so much for making our time memorable! Highly recommend" },
                { author: "Michaela", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2025-04-27", text: "Brilliant tour, great to see some hidden gems of the city. Kiwi our tour guide was excellent!!" },
                { author: "Neil", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2025-04-21", text: "Tour guide Nina was friendly, knowledgeable and her English was very good. The tour took us inside a temple, to a flower market, riverside restaurant and a vibrant China town. The Tuk Tuk ride was great fun and the driver was safe. We sampled a range of street food, all of which was delicious." },
                { author: "Ceri", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2025-04-09", text: "We were 2 adults and 2 children age 8&11. The tour was amazing, seeing Bangkok by Tuk Tuk was so much fun. Meet point and instructions were perfect. We ate so much food we have never tried before and were all so stuffed at the end we couldn’t have eaten another thing! Our guide was so friendly and great with the kids teaching us some Thai words. A great experience thanks" }
            ]
        },
