  'wonderful-pearl-cruise-with-private-hotel-transfer-in-bangkok': {
            averageRating: 4.72,
            totalReviews: 56,
            guideRating: 4.75,
            valueRating: 4.67,
            reviews: [
                { author: "Teresa", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-07-18", text: "We thoroughly enjoyed this boat cruise. The food was stunning and plenty of it. The boat was amazing and so clean. We sat on top deck and enjoyed the band that played the second half of their set on top deck. The views from the boat were fantastic at night. Brilliant atmosphere. Staff were also very attentive. Would highly recommend", photos: ["https://images.asiabylocals.com/asiabylocals/reviews/wonderful-pearl-cruise-with-private-hotel-transfer-in-bangkok/7627320/1600.webp", "https://images.asiabylocals.com/asiabylocals/reviews/wonderful-pearl-cruise-with-private-hotel-transfer-in-bangkok/7627326/1600.webp", "https://images.asiabylocals.com/asiabylocals/reviews/wonderful-pearl-cruise-with-private-hotel-transfer-in-bangkok/7627327/1600.webp"] },
                { author: "Robert", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-07-14", text: "very nice way to see the city by night from the river and have some fantastic food while listening to nice music. everything was perfect from the moment we went on the boat till arrival. the food was outstanding and the variety was great so for everyone enough to choose from. no need to rush for the buffet as they were continuously replenishing until arrival.", photos: ["https://images.asiabylocals.com/asiabylocals/reviews/wonderful-pearl-cruise-with-private-hotel-transfer-in-bangkok/7555365/1600.webp", "https://images.asiabylocals.com/asiabylocals/reviews/wonderful-pearl-cruise-with-private-hotel-transfer-in-bangkok/7555366/1600.webp", "https://images.asiabylocals.com/asiabylocals/reviews/wonderful-pearl-cruise-with-private-hotel-transfer-in-bangkok/7555367/1600.webp"] },
                { author: "Lucas", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2025-11-28", text: "The crowd that day was kinda old, so it wasn’t that much fun but the views, the food and the whole ship was beautiful", photos: ["https://images.asiabylocals.com/asiabylocals/reviews/wonderful-pearl-cruise-with-private-hotel-transfer-in-bangkok/4762850/1600.webp", "https://images.asiabylocals.com/asiabylocals/reviews/wonderful-pearl-cruise-with-private-hotel-transfer-in-bangkok/4762851/1600.webp", "https://images.asiabylocals.com/asiabylocals/reviews/wonderful-pearl-cruise-with-private-hotel-transfer-in-bangkok/4762852/1600.webp"] },
                { author: "Katrin", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-07-07", text: "Amazing experience highly recommended- great food, very friendly staff, super live music from two bands and Thai dancing. Best experience in Bangkok. We had no transfer from or to the hotel." },
                { author: "Christopher", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-04-23", text: "Me and my family had a fantastic time. Friendly staff, excellent food, great entertainment, and all the passengers acted in a civil manner. Sat on the top deck. Would recommend that if there is not rain in the forecast. The views on the river were spectacular. Don't let others tell you the food is subpar, it was not. There was variety and all was very delicious. The only problem is that there were so many options, my stomach wasn't big enough to try them all. Also, this tour left from Riverside, which is less chaotic than Icon Siam or Asiatique. My only complaint is that when reserving this to" },
                { author: "Traveller", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-08-30", text: "Très bon tour en bateau . Spectacle extérieur de danse et chanteur à l’intérieur . Très bon buffet et serveuse très professionnelle. Petit tour de 2 h sympathique et bon rapport qualité prix. Je recommande" },
                { author: "Traveller", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-08-02", text: "El crucero muy bonito. La tripulacion muy atenta. La cena muy rica, amplia y variada. La banda de musica muy buena." },
                { author: "Sandra", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 3, date: "2026-06-12", text: "It started well, the staff were wonderful and very attentive and the first band was fantastic!!!! But when the second band came on, they only did Mexican music for the Mexican group! There were several other nationalities on board too! Very disappointed and will not recommend! It should cater to everyone not just one specific group!" },
                { author: "Jeroen", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-04-24", text: "Sehr schöne Flussfahrt. Die Pearl Cruise war toll. Das Entertainment und die Band an Bord waren sehr gut. Das Essen war gut. Wir haben es genossen. Können wir sehr empfehlen." },
                { author: "Thomas", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-04-23", text: "Wir hatten den Ausflug mit Hotel Transfer gebucht, jedoch wurde uns kurzfristig mitgeteilt dass dieser nicht verfügbar wäre.- sonst war es wieder ein sehr schöner Abend auf dem River mit guter Musik und top Essen." },
                { author: "Nino", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2025-10-17", text: "The entertainment and the meal was amazing and definitely worth doing and it was a highlight of our holiday. The scenery on the river is incredible with many photo opportunities." },
                { author: "Laforge", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-07-16", text: "Une superbe expérience pour un anniversaire de rêve !!!! La cuisine est très bonne et le service impeccable Superbe ballade pour visiter de nuit les plus beaux temples Un gros ++++pour le wat arun le grand palais le krug ton brigde" }
            ]
        },
