                { author: "Trina", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-07-07", text: "This was a fabulous cruise! The food was top notch and offered my choices. It was fresh and plentiful. The staff were very courteous and prompt. The 3 performances were great with a traditional dance as well included. Live music was fun to dance to. Price was really really good value. Highly recommend. You will be glad you chose this cruise line." },
                { author: "Traveller", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-09-14", text: "It was wonderful. Will definately do it again!" },
                { author: "Sara", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 3, date: "2026-06-06", text: "Bello il giro in barca, puntuali. Spettacolo carino. Mangiare pessimo. I menù veg erano freddi, ma anche il buffet inaffrontabile" },
                { author: "Daniela", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-05-25", text: "Sehr schöner Abend. Die Live- Sängerinnen waren sehr gut und auch die Show Acts haben gut unterhalten. Üppige Essensauswahl - es hat an nichts gefehlt. Ein-zwei Mal etwas zu scharf für den europäischen Gaumen 🥵😂. Wasser wurde fleißig aufgefüllt- zusätzliche Getränke waren separat zu zahlen. Charmante Bedienungen schöne Atmosphäre an Board mit Blick auf die leuchtende Stadt und ein erwerbbares Erinnerungsbild haben den Abend abgerundet. Empfehlenswert" }
