  'ayutthaya-and-lopburi-monkey-temple-private-day-trip': {
            averageRating: 4.76,
            totalReviews: 205,
            guideRating: 4.87,
            valueRating: 4.44,
            reviews: [
                { author: "Kenny", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2025-11-17", text: "Trip felt like it was centered around us. Prompt pick up from our hotel at specified time by professional and polite driver. Guide was excellent proving useful and informative information on the temples and ares which we visited. Guide brought food for the monkeys and showed us the best spots to interact with them and feed them. An unforgettable experience provided by an excellent team who catered for our every need", photos: ["https://images.asiabylocals.com/asiabylocals/reviews/ayutthaya-and-lopburi-monkey-temple-private-day-trip/4650603/1600.webp", "https://images.asiabylocals.com/asiabylocals/reviews/ayutthaya-and-lopburi-monkey-temple-private-day-trip/4650604/1600.webp", "https://images.asiabylocals.com/asiabylocals/reviews/ayutthaya-and-lopburi-monkey-temple-private-day-trip/4650605/1600.webp"] },
                { author: "Stefania", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-08-12", text: "It was a very nice experience, our guide A and the driver Aing were excellent" },
                { author: "Rafah", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2025-11-22", text: "Here’s a polished review you can use: ⭐️⭐️⭐️⭐️⭐️ Excellent Experience! It was a great day! Our guide was incredibly knowledgeable, friendly, and so helpful throughout the entire tour. They made everything easy and enjoyable, and we learned so much along the way. Highly recommend!" },
                { author: "Homer", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2025-11-22", text: "This was an outstanding experience which I recommend 100%. I did the tour by myself, which was more expensive but definitely worth it to have the tour guide and vehicle to myself. My tour guide, Yo, was outstanding: Knowledgeable, friendly and patient with all my questions at Ayutthaya. She went above and beyond by adjusting the location to see the monkeys when the primary location had nearby construction which scared the monkeys off. The location to which she took me was completely full of monkeys with only us present! Wonderful experience. 100% recommend." },
                { author: "Made", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2025-09-30", text: "We had an amazing day of history and exploration with Jill who was a walking encylopia sharing her knowledge and wealth of information with us. It was a day very well spent. Highly recommended." },
                { author: "Julia", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2025-08-24", text: "Our tour guide Jill was the sweetest woman ever! You could tell she loved being a tour guide, and we learned so much about the history of Siam! She also took the cutest pictures of us, would 100% recommended." },
                { author: "Michal", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2025-07-08", text: "Great experience, the guide was really helpful and talkative, so you could get a hang of thai culture during long ride to the temples and lopburi. Overall we saw 3 temples in Ayutthaya and 2 in Lopburi (there were monkeys in one of these). A bit pricey but it was a private tour, just for the two of us. I can recommend it." },
                { author: "Victoria", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2025-06-12", text: "Spectacular experience. Our guide was accommodating to our schedule and very knowledgeable. Our driver was safe. They were able to adjust our itinerary to the heat, our family needs, etc. Lunch rec was spot on! Great day!" },
                { author: "Anna", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2025-06-04", text: "Amazing experience! Petra was very friendly and share all the info about the places we visited, on the top of that she takes great pictures and work so hard to give us the experience with the monkeys. I highly recommend this tour and the guide" },
                { author: "Carolin", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2025-05-25", text: "Our trip with Jill was phenomenal! She provided a lot of interesting information and took a lot of amazing photos of us! We really enjoyed our day and booking a private tour was definitely worth it." },
                { author: "Todd", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2025-03-17", text: "An amazing day and stellar tour! Our guide Noi was knowledgeable, humorous, well prepared and a joy to be around. We had the preferred food for the monkeys; and this was definitely a once in a lifetime experience feeding and interacting with them. Lunch was awesome and ruins in Ayutthaya were beyond expectation. Loved everything about this private tour!!" },
                { author: "Ronny", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2025-02-03", text: "Very friendly and nice tour guide. We were very satisfied. Our tour guide explained and showed us a lot about the temples and Thailand. We will definitely book again next time we stay. Thank you for this wonderful day." }
            ]
        },
