  'tuk-tuk-app-day-pass-and-chao-phraya-river-boat-in-bangkok': {
            averageRating: 4.27,
            totalReviews: 613,
            guideRating: 4.29,
            valueRating: 4.29,
            reviews: [
                { author: "Truc", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-08-27", text: "The most amazing service. Such lovely communication and such nice tram of drivers! We were collected hotel and spent the whole day sightseeing smoothly picked up many times to temples and iconsiam. Then we were on dinner cruise before collected and driven back by lovely kind driver to our hotel in Siam. This is my 4 time using this activity and it is the best!!! Please use and enjoy like we did from London", photos: ["https://images.asiabylocals.com/asiabylocals/reviews/tuk-tuk-app-day-pass-and-chao-phraya-river-boat-in-bangkok/8384486/1600.webp", "https://images.asiabylocals.com/asiabylocals/reviews/tuk-tuk-app-day-pass-and-chao-phraya-river-boat-in-bangkok/8384487/1600.webp", "https://images.asiabylocals.com/asiabylocals/reviews/tuk-tuk-app-day-pass-and-chao-phraya-river-boat-in-bangkok/8384488/1600.webp"] },
                { author: "Harry", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-04-09", text: "Was good, easy to use and if you use it well enough you can see so much!" },
                { author: "Romy", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2025-05-08", text: "Really good service, made Bangkok a breeze in the burning heat, recommend greatly" },
                { author: "Lorraine", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2025-02-07", text: "This is a great way to see the attractions and the areas of Bangkok you want to without worrying and wondering if you’re going to get fleeced. The app is easy to use once you get used to it and the Tuk tuks arrived in no more than a few mins.. a bit more in busy traffic. We were picked up from our hotel and returned to our hotel which was great. There was good communication with the agent via WhatsApp when we had a query. I recommend this great way of travelling around to your chosen locations." },
                { author: "Christian", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2024-09-22", text: "Flexibel Option for getting around the City. Great Experience!" },
                { author: "Jairus", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2024-09-05", text: "Very good. Pity they could not pick us from our hotel." },
                { author: "Philippa", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2024-09-04", text: "The team were so helpful and friendly and it was such an easy to use service." },
                { author: "Mark", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2024-07-20", text: "Great package, basically an Uber Tuk Tuk. Use the App, say where you want to go and it will then tell you where to meet the Tuk Tuk closest to you." },
                { author: "Nicola", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2024-06-05", text: "Anybody thinking of coming to Bangkok - GET THIS APP!! It’s quite literally the best mode of transport around the city, the Tuk Tuk’s are clean and all have seatbelts and it also includes a hop on hop off river boat to get over to Wat Arun. We have used this service since 8am this morning and would never have seen all the things in Bangkok that we wanted to without it. The price is fantastic and all the vehicles are electric. I can’t recommend this more highly 👌🏻 Fantastic service" },
                { author: "Lauren", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2024-05-25", text: "This was so much fun! Hotel pick up and drop off was a great option. The tuk tuks were modern and safe (even seatbelts!), the app and meeting points easy to use, waiting times minimal, etc. This is a great way to see the sights around Bangkok at your own choosing and time…and very affordable. Our fave part was actually the tuk tuk rides, more so than the sights! I would definitely recommend." },
                { author: "pınar", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2024-04-08", text: "They contact with me by whatsapp. You can access the staff easily. Perfect tour" },
                { author: "Roisin", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2024-04-01", text: "Activity was brilliant. Got to see so much of the city ( which is huge). we were shown how to use the app and how to call for next Tuk Tuk. Never waited for a pickup for more than a few minutes. The boat was also a handy way to get around. If there was anything negative to say it’s that the options to pick up from hotels were limited. I had originally booked a hotel near the pier but when I put it into the pick up locations it was rejected. I ended up booking a hotel much further away to get a pick up only to see that we passed the original hotel which was only around the corner from a pick up" }
            ]
        },
