  'yodsiam-sightseeing-cruise-with-snacks-and-unlimited-beer-in-bangkok': {
            averageRating: 4.57,
            totalReviews: 282,
            guideRating: 4.57,
            valueRating: 4.68,
            reviews: [
                { author: "Amy", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-04-18", text: "This was such a fun activity! It was very well organised, excellent instructions to find check in, very prompt and timely; and all staff (check in and on the boat) were so friendly. There was plenty of seating, great spots to see the views of the Bangkok riverside and watch the sunset. There were various types of drinks available, and plenty to be had. The food (which is described as snacks) was actually very generous, with a great range of dishes. I am vegetarian, and enjoyed the edamame, chips and fruit. The DJ was awesome, playing great songs that had the vibes high. There was a broad age r", photos: ["https://images.asiabylocals.com/asiabylocals/reviews/yodsiam-sightseeing-cruise-with-snacks-and-unlimited-beer-in-bangkok/6274235/1600.webp", "https://images.asiabylocals.com/asiabylocals/reviews/yodsiam-sightseeing-cruise-with-snacks-and-unlimited-beer-in-bangkok/6274236/1600.webp", "https://images.asiabylocals.com/asiabylocals/reviews/yodsiam-sightseeing-cruise-with-snacks-and-unlimited-beer-in-bangkok/6274237/1600.webp"] },
                { author: "leroy", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-03-10", text: "great 1hr journey up the river and back seeing Wat Po at sunset was great the staff on the trip were fantastic could do enough also got the whole upper deck dancing food and drink was only good great value for the money", photos: ["https://images.asiabylocals.com/asiabylocals/reviews/yodsiam-sightseeing-cruise-with-snacks-and-unlimited-beer-in-bangkok/5754401/1600.webp", "https://images.asiabylocals.com/asiabylocals/reviews/yodsiam-sightseeing-cruise-with-snacks-and-unlimited-beer-in-bangkok/5754403/1600.webp", "https://images.asiabylocals.com/asiabylocals/reviews/yodsiam-sightseeing-cruise-with-snacks-and-unlimited-beer-in-bangkok/5754407/1600.webp"] },
                { author: "Gabriella", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-04-25", text: "Great experience. Beautiful views and very nice crew. Lots of food." },
                { author: "Amelia", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-03-18", text: "We booked this last minute boat trip as a way to see the sights and we were pleasantly surprised!! As a cheaper option I wasn’t expecting much but it was great, with unlimited soft drink and food! Staff again were friendly and helpful, taking lots of pictures of us as we passed the sights. If you are looking for a smaller river cruise without the fancy dinner and huge boats, give this a go!" },
                { author: "James", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-01-29", text: "We enjoyed the boat ride along the Chao Phraya River, taking in some major sights which are lit up at night. We took some lovely photos. The food and beer were good." },
                { author: "Lori", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-01-24", text: "Lots of fun. Good music. Good food ( chicken was very tasty) unlimited beer. The scenery was unbelievable. We saw it all on land during the day but much prettier at night with a great party atmosphere" },
                { author: "Nadine", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2025-11-28", text: "Loved every minute of it the food was delicious also worth every penny and 1hour on the boat was enough to see everything! I highly recommend!" },
                { author: "Melisa", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2025-07-21", text: "great quick boat ride. you can see some good sites right from the boat. small by quality food buffet, the fried chicken was fresh and delicious. all of the staff were extremely friendly and kind" },
                { author: "Molly", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2025-06-05", text: "This was so much fun and would definitely recommend if you are looking for a river cruise! Vibes were good and there were employees dancing and helping to create a good atmosphere- very successfully! Everyone seemed happy and you could have as much beer as you wanted in 1 hour! They also had wine coolers that were pretty good. My one thing is we only were able to see Wat Arun although this might have been due to the rain! All age groups were welcome and having fun!" },
                { author: "Joey", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2025-05-06", text: "We could not have enjoyed this activity more! Definition of cheap and cheerful, but everyone was thrilled to be on the river cruise. The atmosphere looked unrivalled by every single boat we passed. Would 100% book this one again on our next visit!" },
                { author: "Sharon", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2025-04-20", text: "The Sunset cruise was just what we were looking for. Very friendly people." },
                { author: "Scott", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2025-04-07", text: "Enjoyed the snack and unlimited beer. Music wa great. Staff was fun and courteous. Great time to cut loose and have fun." }
            ]
        },
