  'bangkok-by-night-by-electric-scooter-and-or-bike-by-local-operator': {
            averageRating: 4.7,
            totalReviews: 43,
            guideRating: 4.62,
            valueRating: 4.42,
            reviews: [
                { author: "sarvesh", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2024-05-10", text: "It was value for money Nico & Jojo were awesome people we came across. It was indeed local guide tour . 2-2:30 hours of enjoyment.", photos: ["https://images.asiabylocals.com/asiabylocals/reviews/bangkok-by-night-by-electric-scooter-and-or-bike-by-local-operator/450254/1600.webp"] },
                { author: "Muhammad", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 4, date: "2025-01-04", text: "We love it. Tiring but worth it. Enjoy the ride very much. Love to see part of Bangkok at night. The tour guides, Jojo and Yok were very nice. Got to ride in the alleys and by the roadside. Pretty much safe since we are using ninebot kick scooters. The only downside, the scooters was poorly maintained and old, rattle here and there but usable.", photos: ["https://images.asiabylocals.com/asiabylocals/reviews/bangkok-by-night-by-electric-scooter-and-or-bike-by-local-operator/1741877/1600.webp"] },
                { author: "Joshua", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2025-04-24", text: "Absolutely awesome tour around Bangkok. got to see sites and places I'd suggest are rarely seen by tourists. Got to see many amazing sites in one evening. Guides were excellent- funny and had heaps of facts about the area. thank you!" },
                { author: "Lucas", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2024-05-08", text: "Great tour! Pretty cool how we took the alleys and backroads of Bangkok With each stop we got fun facts about the city and culture. I thought it was going to be a bit dangerous but it’s all the thrill with no real danger. Also I loved it was at night." },
                { author: "Florian", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2023-11-30", text: "Nico was a fantastic tour guide. We enjoyed the tour a lot! 100% recommendation" },
                { author: "Laura", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2023-07-20", text: "Best 2+ hours I spent in Bangkok! Amazing and fun way to see the city!! Great route to us to so many highlights and the evening breeze kept us cool!! John was an excellent guide and I’ve sheet recommended them to friends!! Awesome excursion and excellent photos and videos along the way!!" },
                { author: "Jane", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 4, date: "2025-07-04", text: "This was a fabulous way to see the old part of Bangkok by night. None of us had previously ridden an electric scooter but we soon got the hang of it. We stopped at all the key monuments and temples for photos, though it would have been good to have more photo ops in some of the quieter places on the tour." },
                { author: "Yiu", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-08-18", text: "很好的電動滑板車體驗，導遊帶領換車嘅遊名勝，講解以前不認識的歷史，加深對於泰國的文化歷史，比從前跟旅行團的認識更多深入，導遊生鬼風趣，非常照顧安全。值得再次體驗，未曾試過的強烈推薦！" },
                { author: "Janine", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-08-15", text: "Es war eine super interessante Tour durch Orte in Bangkok, die wir alleine nie gesehen hätten. Wir hatten zu Viert drei sehr nette Guides die immer sehr auf unsere Sicherheit im Straßenverkehr geachtet haben und uns viel über Bangkok/Thailand erzählen konnten! Gerade die Tour im Dunkeln hat sich für uns definitiv gelohnt! Ich kann sie jedem empfehlen!" },
                { author: "Traveller", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2025-07-25", text: "Une chouette manière de découvrir un partie de Bangkok de nuit. Les illuminations, les petites ruelles et les quartiers animés avec de nombreux arrêts photos. Une fois la balade terminée, n’hésitez pas à continuer la soirée dans le quartier animé à proximité." },
                { author: "Traveller", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2025-06-27", text: "plenty of sights to see and nice and safe and the 2 guides were excellent" },
                { author: "Traveller", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 3, date: "2025-03-13", text: "Felt like he didn’t want to be there , said to choose e scooter or e bike when we arrived at the shop thank god I didn’t choose e bike the experience would have been even worst it wouldn’t be possible to enjoy a bike on these narrow lanes and pathways . Some Views were breathtaking especially on the bridge . My son loved this tour but only because he was riding a scooter lol . The scooters were slow and I didn’t really feel comfortable, we went past the beautiful flower market that was amazing but we didn’t stop he just kept going , he rides everyday we don’t so stopping to see the locals work" }
            ]
        },
