  'customize-your-own-full-day-ayutthaya-tour': {
            averageRating: 4.65,
            totalReviews: 188,
            guideRating: 4.84,
            valueRating: 4.51,
            reviews: [
                { author: "Elvis", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-06-25", text: "It was a great experience ! Khun beer was very helpful and explained everything to us . The driver also was very courteous and helpful ! We enjoyed it very much !" },
                { author: "Amanda", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-04-22", text: "The personalized tour of Ayutthaya has been a highlight of my trip. Nancy was amazing and had such a wonderful demeanor. She shared history all along the way and had a passion for the temples that we visited. She offered personal touches like lunch, a river boat ride, and a blessing by a monk. This was an amazing experience. My driver Am was very polite and I felt safe at all times. I highly recommend this tour. So much gratitude for this experience." },
                { author: "Jeannine", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-04-22", text: "Our trip was fantastic! Pi Nok and our driver were very accommodating and even helped us getting the famous Roti Sai Mai! We very appreciated their help and guidance. Thank you!" },
                { author: "Noah", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-04-06", text: "We had a great time on the tour. It was nice to have control over our own schedules. There was a nice mix of cute fun activities like feeding fish and turtles in the palace, mixed into the larger tour which helped keep things interesting. We went in the hottest month, and the driver greeted us after each activity with a cold towel or drink. Responses were prompt. The day can wrap up a bit early depending on the activities you select so you may finish a bit earlier than expected" },
                { author: "Guy", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-02-17", text: "Jacky was amazing. We had the best day ever touring around Ayuthaya leisurely and at our own pace. Lots of information and time spent talking about the sights and history. The minibus was spacious and clean, and a cool retreat between historic locations. Thankyou Jacky for making beautiful memories for our family!" },
                { author: "Seok", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-01-02", text: "Our freelance guide Tum Tum was excellent: friendly, knowledgeable and a great sense of humour. She took pains to explain the history of the Thai dynasties and the historical context of every site we chose to visit. A word about this tour: you are allowed to choose the sites to visit which means you have to do some research on your own and submit your request at least 24 hrs before. There is little shelter at any of the sites so dress appropriately." },
                { author: "David", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2025-12-15", text: "Jack was a fantastic and knowledgeable guide. He helped educate us on the temples, hoistory, and culture/local customs - and we learned a lot! The tour itself was very enjoyable and we were glad to be able to choose our own destinations and go at our own pace. We were debating between a group tour, going on our own, and a private tour but were happy with our choice to go private. It is more expensive, but we got more out of the experience. Having transportation handled was very helpful and it was nice not to have to plan a complicated outing on our own." },
                { author: "Glenn", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2025-12-13", text: "The flexibility to create your own experience is excellent. The beauty and history of the location is powerful." },
                { author: "Ian", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2025-11-10", text: "Our trip was a self guided tour, with a driver to 4 seperate locations. Jai our driver arrived on time & was able to accommodate our request to add a destination along the way. Jai, highlighted areas of interest en route to each & we were easily reconnected after each stop. Jai's, spoken english is good leading to many conversations during our trip." },
                { author: "Karley", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2025-10-31", text: "The company itself had numerous reminders with what to be & where to meet. Our guide (Marut, also went by Michael) started contacting us a day before with his contact information, pictures of what we'd see and what he'd be wearing. The morning of pick up we received a message he was on his way. The driver (Roj) then got us along with the guide. We were only expecting a driver but having both was wonderful. We had picked out 4 wats in advance but our guide recommended we change one for another. Great choice. We had requested lunch on the river and stopping at a road side stall for roi soi. He t" },
                { author: "Chris", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2025-10-24", text: "Happy that we could customise this trip and choose our own start time. Eddy was an enthusiastic guide with lots of knowledge. We visited the beautiful Bang Pa In royal residence followed by 4 temples in Ayutthaya. Good reasonably priced lunch" },
                { author: "Michela", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2025-10-12", text: "The trip went very well, despite the heat. We saw beautiful historical sites at our pace. We were a group of 3 and being my 80 years old parents on the trip, having the opportunity to visit Ayutthaya like this was a real luxury. Our guide Jackie was more than one can ask from a guide! He was knowledgeable, funny, kind, sweet, and took care of me and my old parents. The driver was also great, very accommodating, always opening our doors and drove beautifully. Thank you both for giving us such an unforgettable experience! Utterly recommended!" }
            ]
        },
