                { author: "Alexander", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-03-12", text: "A magical experience taking a dinner cruise on the Chao Phraya River at night and seeing sites, such as Wat Arun. The buffet was generous, while the music was a bit loud, but still entertaining. The staff on the boat were friendly and the boat itself was more modern." },
                { author: "Ant", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-02-03", text: "Fantastic - the boat was top notch. The staff were very friendly and professional. Buffet was wonderful. The views and the cruise was great. Highly recommended." },
                { author: "Laima", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2025-11-14", text: "When all staff start to dancing and people follow it’s been great" },
                { author: "Yingjialang", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2025-09-14", text: "this cruise trip is highly recommended. worth the money." },
                { author: "Ashlee", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2025-08-01", text: "The boat was very populated and they did take a photo of you before boarding to attempt to sell it back to you which honestly it should have been included in the price. It was worth it to see the sights but that’s it" },
                { author: "Ron", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2025-07-30", text: "it was a great experience great food and great hospitality we were late and they call us and wait few minutes make sure you arrange the time, tge traffic is terrible" },
                { author: "Zoe", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2025-07-05", text: "Amazing choice of buffet and live music thoroughly enjoyed highly recommended" },
                { author: "Clair", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2025-06-25", text: "Beware of Bangkok traffic and leave with at least 30 mins to spare when you get there. It took us 90 mins in a grab taxi to travel 7km so was quite stressful to then find the meeting point which was an obscure stand tucked away in one of the many ‘warehouses’ literally along a very very long, busy pier with hundreds of people milling about. The boat was huge. Great seat on the top deck with great views, food and ents. Friendly staff, well organised and plenty of food choices. Hilarious (not) that the entire top deck had to get on the floor to go under 2 bridges due to high water levels! Worth" },
                { author: "Bernard", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2025-05-31", text: "Palin was a very nice guide with extensive knowledge about the Chiang Mai region and Thailand. History and culture. Gave great tips and excursions to do. 5 Star ⭐⭐⭐⭐⭐" },
                { author: "Priya", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2025-05-05", text: "Amazing experience. One of the best tours I’ve done" },
                { author: "Tzu", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2025-04-24", text: "It’s so great we are so lucky to be the front of the cruise. The view is amazing worth every penny" },
                { author: "Anthony", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2025-04-24", text: "absolutely fantastic trip. welll worth the money. the staff and organisation was secound to none..made us feell welcome.. no better way to see the fantastic sites especially in the evening..the on board entertainment was great we had. saxophonist and singers. food was plenty full. I couldn't fault anything. can't wait to try again.." }
