                { author: "Michel", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-07-16", text: "We had an amazing experience with Kelly! She did a fantastic job and made our tour of Ayutthaya truly memorable. She answered all of our questions with great knowledge and enthusiasm, and she kept the tour engaging and interesting—even for our kids, which is not an easy task! Kelly also took so many wonderful photos of our family throughout the tour. We really appreciated this. We now have beautiful memories to look back on. At the end of the tour, she recommended a lovely, cozy restaurant for lunch, and it was absolutely perfect. We 100% recommend Kelly to anyone visiting Ayutthaya. If you're" },
                { author: "Eli", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-06-21", text: "We spent the day with our guide, Kelly and it was amazing, she was very informative and had a clear passion for what she does. For history nerds like me it was great and for Thailand nerds like my partner even better. Having the ability to do either a morning or afternoon tour was great giving us the flexibility to take the morning slow and check out of our hotel rather than have to rush and was a big factor in us initially choosing the tour. 10/10 would recommend" }
