                { author: "Lisa", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-07-26", text: "It was a definite must if you are in Bangkok, very busy and lots of tourists- Lots to see and walk around -", photos: ["https://images.asiabylocals.com/asiabylocals/reviews/grand-palace-skip-the-line-entry-ticket/7782662/1600.webp"] },
                { author: "Natasha", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-03-16", text: "I had a great time visiting the elephant sanctuary and getting to feed, touch and bath such majestic animals. Lovely lunch and great guides explaining everything. I’d come back and recommend to everyone. Well done Jumbo and Handsome man for giving us a fantastic experience.", photos: ["https://images.asiabylocals.com/asiabylocals/reviews/grand-palace-skip-the-line-entry-ticket/5835160/1600.webp", "https://images.asiabylocals.com/asiabylocals/reviews/grand-palace-skip-the-line-entry-ticket/5835161/1600.webp"] },
                { author: "Marcus", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-03-06", text: "Glad we purchased tickets early so we did have to wait in the long line. Definitely worth it!" },
                { author: "Rosalind", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-02-26", text: "The Grand Palace was absolutely stunning and well worth visiting. A must see if you are in Bangkok." },
                { author: "Thomas", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-02-25", text: "Perfect service. Everything was a expected (and payed for). No waiting at the ticket booth, no waiting at the entrance. We really enjoyed the visit." },
                { author: "Rosalind", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-02-23", text: "The Grand Palace is an amazing place to visit and well worth the ticket price. The fast track ticket made it quick and easy to get in. You must be sure to wear the correct clothing or you will have to buy a ‘cover up’ at the entrance." },
                { author: "Dorota", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-02-07", text: "Great experience in wonderful palace. No queuing, straight to the entrance" },
                { author: "Mirjam", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2025-12-31", text: "The emerald Buddha was breath taking! Loved walking around and discovering the grounds. The palace is beautiful!" },
                { author: "Lisa", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2025-08-22", text: "Be aware of scammers trying to tell you it’s closed it’s not ! Also don’t forget to cover up but great trip" },
                { author: "Beverley", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-03-14", text: "Food was amazing, very good value for money. The views were amazing too." },
                { author: "Martin", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-01-20", text: "It was an amazing experience from the moment you walk in. The glandular of the buildings, the colours, designs, sculptures, everything was perfect. To be honest it's over powering but in a unique way. I book my ticket on the app as I always find it's so more simple then. You just scan the code on entry, no queuing. To me, the entrance fee was nothing compared to the experience you get. Be prepared to take lots of photos as so much beauty and colour. 100% recommend." }
