  'thai-dance-class-in-bangkok': {
            averageRating: 4.92,
            totalReviews: 31,
            guideRating: 5.0,
            valueRating: 4.85,
            reviews: [
                { author: "Madoka", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-03-23", text: "L440 R315 755 I had such a wonderful time at the Thai traditional dance lesson! It was an amazing experience to dress up in beautiful traditional costumes, and they even did my hair and styling for me. The teacher was very kind and explained Thai culture in a way that was easy to understand. Even though it was my first time trying Thai dance, she taught me step by step from the basics, making it fun and accessible. They also took a lot of photos for me, and we had plenty of time to enjoy the lesson until the very end. I truly had a great time throughout the whole experience. I highly recommend", photos: ["https://images.asiabylocals.com/asiabylocals/reviews/thai-dance-class-in-bangkok/5918613/1600.webp", "https://images.asiabylocals.com/asiabylocals/reviews/thai-dance-class-in-bangkok/5918614/1600.webp"] },
                { author: "Simone", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-01-02", text: "As a solo traveler, sometimes it’s difficult to book activities. THANK YOU so much to the instructors and organizers for Thai dance class for making this happen. It has absolutely been a highlight of my trip.", photos: ["https://images.asiabylocals.com/asiabylocals/reviews/thai-dance-class-in-bangkok/5083822/1600.webp", "https://images.asiabylocals.com/asiabylocals/reviews/thai-dance-class-in-bangkok/5083823/1600.webp", "https://images.asiabylocals.com/asiabylocals/reviews/thai-dance-class-in-bangkok/5083824/1600.webp"] },
                { author: "Adorján", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2025-12-07", text: "Amazing program! The dance class was very interesting and the costumes were authentic. Our guide was not only a great dance teacher, but a history teacher as well, so she introduced us to some of the fascinsting parts of Thailand's history and culture. Exceptionally helpful and kind, on the top. ☺️", photos: ["https://images.asiabylocals.com/asiabylocals/reviews/thai-dance-class-in-bangkok/4846296/1600.webp"] },
                { author: "Aiko", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-06-29", text: "Our Thai dance lesson with Gift was absolutely amazing! Gift actually teaches Southeast Asian culture at a university, and her deep knowledge made the entire experience so much more than just a dance class. She took the time to teach my friend and me the nuances of how to bow properly in different social situations, and explained the history and meaning behind the dances. Beyond the incredible learning experience, the hospitality was top-notch. We got to dress up in traditional attire, and they even styled our hair beautifully. They also took fantastic photos and videos for us to remember the" },
                { author: "Wafa", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-05-13", text: "I loved glaming up and doing the class in the attire. The teacher was very good and exercised high care in giving accurate information and explaining the dance and songs too." },
                { author: "Traveller", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-04-02", text: "Perfect blend of cultural education, fun and authenticity. Whether you are a seasoned dancer, who loves to explore different styles, or just a curious traveler wishing to dive a bit deeper into Thai old and modern traditions & ways, this workshop can be exciting adventure for you. Gift, the teacher, set a very welcoming and friendly tone from the start, greeting us with traditional Thai sweets and an introductory talk. She is incredibly knowledgeable and passionate about Thai dance and culture. She not only taught several choreos, but also shared the history and meaning behind the movements, a" },
                { author: "David", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-03-01", text: "One of the best experiences I have had in Thailand! Engaging, informative and fun!" },
                { author: "Jaclyn", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-02-10", text: "I was the only one signed up this particular class so I got a private lesson. The girl was very patient with me and gave gentle corrections. I had seen a play the night before so it was interesting to learn the movements they were doing." },
                { author: "Yolanda", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2025-12-08", text: "I had so much fun learning Thai dance in this class. The teacher is not only an excellent dancer but also incredibly nice and very knowledgeable in southeast Asian history 😊 I would recommend it for everyone who loves dancing!!" },
                { author: "Milja", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2025-03-01", text: "The studio was nice and had great airconditioning. The teacher knew a lot about thai culture and history. Fun and amazing experience!" },
                { author: "Sushanti", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2023-09-23", text: "I had a really lovely experience with the very knowledgeable and kind Jenny. We learnt about different regions and their dances and learned choreography for 3 types of dance. I would definitely recommend it to people wanting to learn basics of traditional Thai dance. It was a lot of fun!" },
                { author: "Térésa", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-05-27", text: "Excellente expérience ! On commence par être richement vêtue, ornée et coiffée de façon traditionnelle. Le cours avec Jannie était génial, elle est à la fois très sympa et a plein d'informations à transmettre. Je l'ai trouvé à l'écoute de mes questions et de mon niveau. Elle corrigeait avec douceur et précision mes gestes pour que j'apprenne correctement. Le cours est bien structuré, avec un aperçu des principaux styles de danse, l'apprentissage des gestes/pas de base, assez de répétitions avant de pratiquer \"pour de vrai\" (et se filmer ;-)). Les musiques et danses sont variées. Boissons et bi" }
            ]
        },
