            valueRating: 4.86,
            reviews: [
                { author: "Samantha", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-09-19", text: "mi mi was absolutely amazing!! was definitely a dream come true.. unfortunately because of the storm, we couldn't swim in the river with the waterfall but we got more time with the elephants which was bonus", photos: ["https://images.asiabylocals.com/asiabylocals/reviews/elephant-sanctuary-waterfall-and-bamboo-rafting-in-chiang-mai/8801180/1600.webp", "https://images.asiabylocals.com/asiabylocals/reviews/elephant-sanctuary-waterfall-and-bamboo-rafting-in-chiang-mai/8801181/1600.webp", "https://images.asiabylocals.com/asiabylocals/reviews/elephant-sanctuary-waterfall-and-bamboo-rafting-in-chiang-mai/8801182/1600.webp"] },
                { author: "Franziska", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-09-17", text: "It was such a fun activity and totally worth the money! The elephants were so sweet and friendly, and we had an amazing time today. 🐘❤️ Definitely a memorable experience!", photos: ["https://images.asiabylocals.com/asiabylocals/reviews/elephant-sanctuary-waterfall-and-bamboo-rafting-in-chiang-mai/8769244/1600.webp"] },
                { author: "David", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-09-14", text: "Aamm was a brilliant guide. He really made the day. He took us to all the best places, and was knowledgeable and incredibly funny through the day. I would really recommend this tour!", photos: ["https://images.asiabylocals.com/asiabylocals/reviews/elephant-sanctuary-waterfall-and-bamboo-rafting-in-chiang-mai/8721351/1600.webp", "https://images.asiabylocals.com/asiabylocals/reviews/elephant-sanctuary-waterfall-and-bamboo-rafting-in-chiang-mai/8721352/1600.webp", "https://images.asiabylocals.com/asiabylocals/reviews/elephant-sanctuary-waterfall-and-bamboo-rafting-in-chiang-mai/8721353/1600.webp"] },
                { author: "Sharmaine", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-09-20", text: "Special thanks for Nop our tour guide. He did great !" },
                { author: "Matías", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-09-19", text: "It was just great. Specially with Ya Ya running the excursion. She is the best! The elephants, learning about then, the walk through the jungle. Just a great experience." },
                { author: "Safiyah", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-09-19", text: "It was amazing!!!! exceeded our expectations and Yaya was an amaaaazing guide! She was so funny and very knowledgeable about everything and answered all our questions! The elephant sanctuary seemed very ethical and we had plenty of time with them and got to make their food and feed them lots! it was so so cute! the waterfall was amazing and we got to jump in and have a swim! the bamboo rafting was so fun too! could not recommend this enough as it was the best day ever!" },
                { author: "Isobelle", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-09-19", text: "Lovely day out! Jackie was amazing so enthusiastic, friendly and so helpful!" },
                { author: "Niclas", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-09-18", text: "We had thanks to our Tour Guide Paul an amazing day! Thank you Paul! #paulisthebest" },
                { author: "Roberto", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-09-17", text: "Nop has been a fantastic guide, very enthusiastic and prepared about the elephants, he helped everyone during the activities and Made fantastic photos, i really recommend him as a guide!" },
                { author: "Bhumika", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-09-17", text: "Nop is an amazing guide. He showed us all the best spots and took beautiful pictures. He made sure we enjoyed everything and didn’t get stuck in big groups. He is very knowledgeable and passionate about elephants. Absolutely worth the price and memorable experience." },
                { author: "Aimee", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-09-15", text: "Tutu is amazing guide. Loved every minute of it. Such a great experience would 100% recommend" },
                { author: "Dhruv", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-09-15", text: "very good experience with elephants, bamboo rafting and Waterfall visit..must do..if you are lucky you will get our guide Jimmy..he was fantastic and funny and entertaining...Team Jimmy" }
            ]
