                { author: "Eva", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-09-05", text: "We had a very nice day with our tour guide Katy! This daytrip is highly recommendable, we enjoy the itinerary with the different stops, especially the Mountain village with coffee/tea tasting and the walk at Doi Inthanon." },
                { author: "Massimo", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-09-03", text: "Good day with our guide Pranom. She was informative, and fun. A cool day in the mountains near Chiang Mai. We enjoyed it." },
                { author: "Ana", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-08-30", text: "Thank you so much Sunny for your wonderful tour! Sunny was so knowledgable and funny!! The tour was a wonderful pace and very interesting. Although it was raining and there wasn’t much visibility at the Pagodas, we still enjoyed it. Sunny took us to a delicious local food spot for lunch and helped us order. Also took us to the coffee village which was super fun! Got to walk through the rice fields and take photos. Thank you Sunny for making this day so special! From your guests from Canada :)" },
                { author: "Ashley", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-08-30", text: "Sunni & Pope were great! Made the tour enjoyable even on a slightly rainy day." },
                { author: "Mats", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-08-30", text: "Besides the awesome nature, Jacky did a great job. We couldn’t imagined a better guide for this tour." }
