  'chiangmai-to-chiangrai-3temples-hot-springs-and-lalitta-cafe-chiang-mai': {
            averageRating: 4.51,
            totalReviews: 2184,
            guideRating: 4.54,
            valueRating: 4.46,
            reviews: [
                { author: "Claudia", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-09-17", text: "it was a beautiful day and even though the pace was fast, we had time te see everything. My only negative point, and this has nothing to do with the guixe nor the organizer, but the majority of the group was disrespectful. The guide was trying to give us some explanation and they didn't even bother stop talking. They were loud and diyrespected the hospitality and the culture of thai people. I was glad when the day was over because I couldn't stand them for another hour and I felt so sorry for our guide. She was very patient and didn't say anything to avoid further discussions", photos: ["https://images.asiabylocals.com/asiabylocals/reviews/chiangmai-to-chiangrai-3temples-hot-springs-and-lalitta-cafe-chiang-mai/8770211/1600.webp", "https://images.asiabylocals.com/asiabylocals/reviews/chiangmai-to-chiangrai-3temples-hot-springs-and-lalitta-cafe-chiang-mai/8770212/1600.webp", "https://images.asiabylocals.com/asiabylocals/reviews/chiangmai-to-chiangrai-3temples-hot-springs-and-lalitta-cafe-chiang-mai/8770213/1600.webp"] },
                { author: "Alysa", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-09-08", text: "This day trip was AMAZING! we got to see a lot of things, but unfortunately we had a very strict time table to see each temple/cafè. But overall you still had the time to see properly everything. Our tour guide Kwan was amazing and very funny :) i really recommend booking this tour!", photos: ["https://images.asiabylocals.com/asiabylocals/reviews/chiangmai-to-chiangrai-3temples-hot-springs-and-lalitta-cafe-chiang-mai/8596313/1600.webp", "https://images.asiabylocals.com/asiabylocals/reviews/chiangmai-to-chiangrai-3temples-hot-springs-and-lalitta-cafe-chiang-mai/8596314/1600.webp", "https://images.asiabylocals.com/asiabylocals/reviews/chiangmai-to-chiangrai-3temples-hot-springs-and-lalitta-cafe-chiang-mai/8596315/1600.webp"] },
                { author: "Alicia", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-08-23", text: "This tour is sensational! Our guide, May, and our driver, Mr A, were both so lovely. May was very knowledgeable and funny, and she really made the day so much fun. Make sure you choose all the options - its a long day but absolutely worth it, and it doesn't feel as though you're rushed or trying to squeeze everything in. The hot spring is not for swimming so dont bother taking swimwear. This tour is an absolute must!", photos: ["https://images.asiabylocals.com/asiabylocals/reviews/chiangmai-to-chiangrai-3temples-hot-springs-and-lalitta-cafe-chiang-mai/8317852/1600.webp", "https://images.asiabylocals.com/asiabylocals/reviews/chiangmai-to-chiangrai-3temples-hot-springs-and-lalitta-cafe-chiang-mai/8317853/1600.webp", "https://images.asiabylocals.com/asiabylocals/reviews/chiangmai-to-chiangrai-3temples-hot-springs-and-lalitta-cafe-chiang-mai/8317854/1600.webp"] },
                { author: "Parminder", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-08-19", text: "Had a great experience with Daniel the tour guy lovely person helpful knowledgeable and very friendly didn’t feel like met him first time he was just amazing went to so many places and he was looking after everyone and taking care of all in the group. Just a problem the van was little tight specially if you are sitting at the back but otherwise book it don’t think twice its a great experience" },
                { author: "Alessandra", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-08-19", text: "Everything was amazing! Spectacular places and an excellent guide!" },
                { author: "Aaron", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-08-17", text: "Great Tour and awesome Guide! Just be aware, that this includes a long ride to the attractions. So pack your headphones and maybe some Snacks (The Van does stop for snacks tho). We had an absolute blast! Sure, maybe not every attraction was to my specific taste, but they were fun nevertheless. The temples are gorgeous and the Food was a particular Highlight for me. Our Guide was very friendly and kindly answered all of my questions. 10/10 would go again!" },
                { author: "Gayatri", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-07-25", text: "Chiang Rai was one of the highlights of our Thailand trip. The White, Blue and Red Temples are absolutely stunning, each with its own unique style and atmosphere. The White Temple is breathtaking with its intricate artwork and sparkling details, the Blue Temple is vibrant and peaceful with its striking blue and gold interiors, and the Red Temple offers beautiful panoramic views and an impressive big statue. Together, they make Chiang Rai so special. A special thanks to our guide, Kwan, who was friendly, knowledgeable and made the journey both informative and enjoyable. Highly recommended!" },
                { author: "Rayne", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-07-23", text: "Great communication from Kwan (our tour guide) pick up was prompt. 2 hour drive went quickly. Hot springs were boiling! Long neck tribe was educational. White temple was stunning! Buffet lunch was great - something for everyone. Blue temple was stunning! Lalitta cafe was picture perfect. Red Temple was stunning! There was 45mins at each temple, 30 mins at Lalitta and 20 mins at the hot springs. This was plenty of time for each activity. Bring a pillow for the drive so you can sleep and bring cash. Only cash accepted at the shops. Kwan was the best tour guide and made the day really enjoyable!" },
                { author: "Anna", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-07-09", text: "It was an excellent day out. We visited many places and had plenty of time to explore each one. The guide was friendly, helpful, and made the experience even more enjoyable." },
                { author: "Mariarita", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-07-08", text: "We had a truly wonderful day. Our guide, Kwan, was incredibly friendly, warm, and easygoing. She accompanied us throughout the tour, giving us plenty of free time to admire the temples at our own pace. The journey was comfortable and relaxing, and our driver was also an exceptionally kind and lovely person. I highly recommend this unique experience to everyone." },
                { author: "Katie", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-08-11", text: "Kwan was such a great guide! Funny, knowledgeable and friendly. She made sure everyone knew what to do and where to be at the right time and gave us the history of the temples. There is a lot of driving so be prepared for that! But it’s worth it; the temples are stunning inside and out. Highly recommend :)" },
                { author: "Julie", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-07-30", text: "This is a jam-packed day, covering all three temples and Lalitta Cafe. It’s a long bus journey but well worth it and the best way to cover all landmarks. The tour guide, Daniel, is friendly, informative and very entertaining and will even ensure you get a good photo at every opportunity. The buffet lunch across from the white temple was just perfect and the whole-day trip was really good value for money. Top tip: take your travel pillow for the journey! 😂" }
            ]
        },
