                { author: "Dor", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-09-01", text: "We had the best tour in our trip! Interesting, beautiful views, and great company:) We have to also recommend our tour guide- Ari! She was just wonderful, she sees the needs of the group, she cares and she’s very funny. ❤️", photos: ["https://images.asiabylocals.com/asiabylocals/reviews/doi-inthanon-trip-with-pha-dok-siew-guided-trek/8473642/1600.webp", "https://images.asiabylocals.com/asiabylocals/reviews/doi-inthanon-trip-with-pha-dok-siew-guided-trek/8473658/1600.webp", "https://images.asiabylocals.com/asiabylocals/reviews/doi-inthanon-trip-with-pha-dok-siew-guided-trek/8473659/1600.webp"] },
                { author: "Deddy", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-08-16", text: "Aree was my tourguide and she was very kind, informative, explaining all the details. I highly recommend this!", photos: ["https://images.asiabylocals.com/asiabylocals/reviews/doi-inthanon-trip-with-pha-dok-siew-guided-trek/8187759/1600.webp"] },
                { author: "Sahalie", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-09-05", text: "Are was our tour guide and she was wonderful. The waterfall and the hike was my favorite part. It was the rainy season so we didn’t have great views from the King and Queen pagoda but we never stayed too long at one place which I like. Communication for pick up and drop off was easy and it is a good value for a full day trip (7am-6pm)" },
                { author: "warren", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-09-04", text: "amazing scenery with an amazing guide. the guide was informative while being funny and entertaining at the same time" },
                { author: "Amanda", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-08-30", text: "Our guide Aree was amazing! She was very knowledgeable, caring and made sure that even though the weather wasn't optimal, everyone on the tour had a great time. I would definitely recommend this tour with her as a guide!" },
                { author: "Mitchel", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-08-29", text: "Best guided trekking you could do in Chiang Mai. The guide was amazing!!" },
                { author: "Kimberly", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-08-15", text: "Amazing tour guide! I wish to have Aree as my tour guide again in my next visit to Thailand!" },
                { author: "Valeria", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-08-10", text: "10/10 activity, strongly recommended! Our tour guide Aree was extremely sweet and fun!" },
                { author: "Caleb", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-08-13", text: "shiang was an excellent bubbly tour guide for the day, providing in depth knowledge and expertise about doi Inthanon and the wider region. we spend the perfect amount of time at each place, with shiang and vjs driver keeping us moving efficiently. THANKS!" },
                { author: "Antong", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-08-05", text: "We had an amazing day! Our guide Aree made sure we had a great time, was incredibly funny and full of energy throughout. The scenery was wonderful and it was definitely one of my highlights of my Thailand trip. Highly recommend! :)" },
                { author: "Gudrun", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-08-04", text: "What I liked the most was the experience in nature. The waterfalls and the hiking was marvellous. Johnny is a very nice guide and he made the trip much better. And the driver 10/10. Being with tribu guides able to speak to them it is so incredible experience. It is a little bit complicated to understand them but they were so friendly, helpful and fun. We enjoyed the day a lot! 100% recommendable. The lunch was excellent and nice service." }
