  'elephant-eco-park-and-atv-raft-waterfall-option-zipline-tribe-in-chiang-mai': {
            averageRating: 4.91,
            totalReviews: 133,
            guideRating: 4.97,
            valueRating: 4.89,
            reviews: [
                { author: "Marshall", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-08-23", text: "This trip was amazing. Honestly life changing. The ATV ride was so fun, the waterfall was beautiful, I felt like I was Indiana Jones doing both of those activities, the lunch was amazing, seeing the elephants was magnificent. Especially being from America and not being able to experience anything like that. The raft ride at the end was also a great way to end the trip and my group saw a baby elephant! It was a 10 star trip. What really made this trip though was our guide Mr Kim. He was so fun to talk to, so kind, so energetic, and honestly a real G. Our whole group loved him so much and he mad", photos: ["https://images.asiabylocals.com/asiabylocals/reviews/elephant-eco-park-and-atv-raft-waterfall-option-zipline-tribe-in-chiang-mai/8322063/1600.webp", "https://images.asiabylocals.com/asiabylocals/reviews/elephant-eco-park-and-atv-raft-waterfall-option-zipline-tribe-in-chiang-mai/8322064/1600.webp", "https://images.asiabylocals.com/asiabylocals/reviews/elephant-eco-park-and-atv-raft-waterfall-option-zipline-tribe-in-chiang-mai/8322065/1600.webp"] },
                { author: "Khadija", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-07-23", text: "I had a great time on this tour! Koh was an amazing tour guide very friendly, entertaining, and made the whole experience enjoyable. He also took lots of great pictures for us, which made the trip even more memorable. I really appreciated his positive attitude and energy. I would definitely recommend this tour, especially if you get Koh as your guide!", photos: ["https://images.asiabylocals.com/asiabylocals/reviews/elephant-eco-park-and-atv-raft-waterfall-option-zipline-tribe-in-chiang-mai/7716154/1600.webp", "https://images.asiabylocals.com/asiabylocals/reviews/elephant-eco-park-and-atv-raft-waterfall-option-zipline-tribe-in-chiang-mai/7716161/1600.webp", "https://images.asiabylocals.com/asiabylocals/reviews/elephant-eco-park-and-atv-raft-waterfall-option-zipline-tribe-in-chiang-mai/7716162/1600.webp"] },
                { author: "Caleb", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-07-13", text: "You absolutely have to do this, if you are in Chiang Mai, or even in Thailand for that matter. Dodo was our main guide and he’s hilarious, his personality added so much to the experience. We spent 15 days in Thailand and this was the most fun experience we had. We thoroughly enjoyed island hopping in Krabi and we decided we enjoyed this even more. It’s the most value for your money you could get anywhere in the world. We were on ATV’s through the Thai Forrest’s for over an hour, zip lined over beautiful rice fields and a river, ate home cooked northern region lunch, fed elephants, and took a b", photos: ["https://images.asiabylocals.com/asiabylocals/reviews/elephant-eco-park-and-atv-raft-waterfall-option-zipline-tribe-in-chiang-mai/7551088/1600.webp", "https://images.asiabylocals.com/asiabylocals/reviews/elephant-eco-park-and-atv-raft-waterfall-option-zipline-tribe-in-chiang-mai/7551089/1600.webp", "https://images.asiabylocals.com/asiabylocals/reviews/elephant-eco-park-and-atv-raft-waterfall-option-zipline-tribe-in-chiang-mai/7551090/1600.webp"] },
                { author: "Anush", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-09-02", text: "Very fun, very patient, kind, good food and great hospitality and photos. Thank you, Koh" },
                { author: "Lea", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-08-28", text: "The day was absolutely amazing and intense! Everything was so well organized, and the guide was fantastic. It was such a meaningful and inspiring experience. I really loved it!" },
                { author: "Chiel", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-08-10", text: "Mr Kim is the most friendly and amazing guide we have seen in a while. He is very energetic and amazing with adults and kids. The atv tour was amazing, the elephants were unforgettable and the bamboo rafting is a once in a lifetime experience. Again a big big thank you to Kim for his effort during this day!" },
                { author: "Argyroula", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-08-07", text: "I would put 6 stars if it was possible. Amazing activities, brings you in real touch with nature. Our guide Koh was an absolute lovely guy, I strongly suggest you book the tour with him!" },
                { author: "Yaree", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-07-29", text: "Our guides were funny help full and did everything to make it fun for us and teach us new things! Everything lined up perfectly and the length of the activities was perfect!" },
                { author: "Elena", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-07-13", text: "Koh was a great guide, we did many fun activities. I loved the rafting and the Elephants visit! Definitely recommend it!" },
                { author: "Yasmeen", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-07-06", text: "Dodo was an excellent guide with his team. They really worked hard in to making the day fun. We started with the ATV, which was nice - I did 1 hour and felt this was long enough. The waterfall was nice too briefly - don’t expect clear water! Then we went to eat lunch and feed the elephants. I eat had the vegetarian option which they accommodated and this was egg fried rice, which was good. Non veggies had Khao Soi. The best was definitely saved til last! The bamboo rafting was a great end! Very relaxing and beautiful sights! I would recommend booking for this alone. Thank you so much DoDo and" },
                { author: "Michelle", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-07-06", text: "This was an epic day and the activities were really enjoyable and Koh our guide was friendly and informative. Highlights were bamboo rafting past elephants swimming, the waterfall and actually feeding a family of elephants. Low light was how many times we had to stop during ATV riding for late stragglers who’d never ridden before - maybe a guide at the rear is a good idea? The muddy track at the end made up for it for the speed demons in our family. All up highly recommend" },
                { author: "Charlie", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-06-25", text: "We did this activity today, ATV's, Feeding elephants, Lunch, Bamboo rafting and going to a tribe village and learning their handmade ways. we have Koh as our guide and hes so friendly and made the experience really great!" }
            ]
        },
