            reviews: [
                { author: "Bárbara", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-05-10", text: "vale muito a pena, adoramos!!", photos: ["https://images.asiabylocals.com/asiabylocals/reviews/jungle-jumbo-elephant-sanctuary-with-waterfall-in-chiang-mai/6600200/1600.webp", "https://images.asiabylocals.com/asiabylocals/reviews/jungle-jumbo-elephant-sanctuary-with-waterfall-in-chiang-mai/6600205/1600.webp", "https://images.asiabylocals.com/asiabylocals/reviews/jungle-jumbo-elephant-sanctuary-with-waterfall-in-chiang-mai/6600215/1600.webp"] },
                { author: "Sophie", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-03-13", text: "Génial ! Merci à Sit pour les explications et l’expédition à travers le village local, la cascade et le sanctuaire d’éléphants ! La visite était très complète. Tout était super. La prise en charge à l’hôtel était très bien organisée. Le sanctuaire est magnifique, et on voit que les éléphants sont très bien traités. J’ai adoré cette expérience !", photos: ["https://images.asiabylocals.com/asiabylocals/reviews/jungle-jumbo-elephant-sanctuary-with-waterfall-in-chiang-mai/5792797/1600.webp", "https://images.asiabylocals.com/asiabylocals/reviews/jungle-jumbo-elephant-sanctuary-with-waterfall-in-chiang-mai/5792798/1600.webp", "https://images.asiabylocals.com/asiabylocals/reviews/jungle-jumbo-elephant-sanctuary-with-waterfall-in-chiang-mai/5792799/1600.webp"] },
                { author: "Maria", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-03-08", text: "Un día muy entrañable. Nuestro guía lo hizo divertido y entretenido. El ratito con los elefantes fue tal y como lo esperábamos, tranquilo y respetuoso, aunque el baño fue de todo menos relajante😂. En resumen, no nos decepcionó en absoluto.", photos: ["https://images.asiabylocals.com/asiabylocals/reviews/jungle-jumbo-elephant-sanctuary-with-waterfall-in-chiang-mai/5737381/1600.webp", "https://images.asiabylocals.com/asiabylocals/reviews/jungle-jumbo-elephant-sanctuary-with-waterfall-in-chiang-mai/5737382/1600.webp", "https://images.asiabylocals.com/asiabylocals/reviews/jungle-jumbo-elephant-sanctuary-with-waterfall-in-chiang-mai/5737383/1600.webp"] },
                { author: "Miranda", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2025-11-20", text: "Myself and my daughter and her boyfriend spent 19/11/25 on this event. A very friendly and informative guide (Tanan) led us and looked after us and it was fabulous. We saw waterfalls, forest, pigs, goats and we got to feel and bathe elephants. We had an authentic Thai meal at the end of the trip and nothing was too much trouble. We were collected and dropped back at our hotel and it was all very easy. A very memorable day thanks to Tanan." },
                { author: "Manuel", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2025-08-26", text: "The excursion met all our expectations, including the very attentive guide who informed us very well about everything at the sanctuary and during the excursion. We also thought everything was very good, very correct, the animals were very well cared for. They were very attentive to us at all times, and we can't think of anything that could be improved, because it was a wonderful experience that I recommend to every visitor!" },
                { author: "Andrés", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2025-08-18", text: "absolutely amazing, incredible staff, Love the connection with the elephants." },
                { author: "Andrea", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2025-07-18", text: "I had a wonderful walk though the wilderness before meeting the elephants. My guide was so knowledgeable and friendly. The elephants were beautiful and so docile. A wonderful experience. The hospitality was great!" },
                { author: "A", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2025-06-11", text: "Wonderful experience with a friendly guide and lovely elephants. We enjoyed every moment!" },
                { author: "Traveller", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-02-05", text: "The interaction with the elephants was amazing ! Dale was a wonderful guide , the falls were nice but you cannot swim in dry season , because the lagoon is not full and you will not go to the rapids / river to do so Overall great experience and close to Chiang Mai :)" },
                { author: "Raphaël", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2025-12-26", text: "Excellente organisation et balade très intéressante. Nous avions pris le tour l’après-midi. Le point culminant est la rencontre avec les éléphants en fin de journée." },
                { author: "Cindy", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-03-07", text: "Notre guide a ete formidable accueillant chaleureux et rempli d humour les éléphants sont bien Notre riding je recommande" },
                { author: "Mélanie", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 3, date: "2026-02-06", text: "It was hard to chose with all the different offers. I wouldn't recommend that one. Organisation They didn't send us the pick up time. The 2 girls that were with us in the van had book for the morning but they forget them.so they had to do the evening. Village It's not a walk in the village, you walk 40m to go to the family of the guide where he spend 10 min trying to sell you souvenir Waterfall Beautiful place, but the guide told us we had 10 min. No time to swim Guide No information at all about the elephants in general or about the one we saw. I tryied to ask some question about where the el" }
            ]
