  'rainforest-guided-mountain-biking-tour-in-chiang-mai': {
            averageRating: 4.57,
            totalReviews: 5,
            guideRating: 4.57,
            valueRating: 4.57,
            reviews: [
                { author: "Sam", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 4, date: "2023-09-16", text: "Guide was excellent and personable. Second half of the trip was excellent and easy riding. However, the first part through the rainforest trail was extremely difficult and definitely not for a beginner-even the guide admitted was difficult for him and he is an experienced cyclist. Third party providers online for these trips need to be honest about what they are selling and not putting misleading pictures on their advertisements, like pictures of 9 year olds and families. There is no way they would have been able to complete the rainforest trail section at the start. Having said that the guide" },
                { author: "Jos", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 3, date: "2023-07-18", text: "Activiteit was niet onaardig, maar niet wat ik had geboekt. Ik heb geboekt en betaald voor een 4 uur durende mountainbike tocht maar ter plekke kreeg ik te horen dat ik de enige was voor die activiteit en dus de keuze had om mee te gaan met een (2-uur durende) hike en een (2-uur durende) biketocht. Kwam op mij over als “slikken of stikken” en door het gebrekkige niveau Engels van de (overigens uiterst vriendelijke) reisbegeleiding, viel er over geen enkele koriting of iets dergelijks ter paten." }
            ]
        },
  'chiangrai-full-day-popular-7-locations-with-thai-buffet-in-chiang-mai': {
            averageRating: 4.86,
            totalReviews: 17,
            guideRating: 4.67,
            valueRating: 4.33,
            reviews: [
                { author: "Madina", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2025-11-01", text: "J'ai passé un tres bon moment. l'excursion était top on a pu visiter les hot spot en 1 journée ! Merci a notre guide/photographe/ gentleman Addy ainsi qu'au chauffeur Peng ! je recommence a 100% (ps: La nourriture était excellente!)", photos: ["https://images.asiabylocals.com/asiabylocals/reviews/chiangrai-full-day-popular-7-locations-with-thai-buffet-in-chiang-mai/4468835/1600.webp", "https://images.asiabylocals.com/asiabylocals/reviews/chiangrai-full-day-popular-7-locations-with-thai-buffet-in-chiang-mai/4468836/1600.webp", "https://images.asiabylocals.com/asiabylocals/reviews/chiangrai-full-day-popular-7-locations-with-thai-buffet-in-chiang-mai/4468837/1600.webp"] },
                { author: "Michael", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-04-05", text: "The guide/driver was fantastic as she knew the best route to visit all 7 tourist attractions and to have sufficient time to see the tourist attractions. She explained the entry fees and did not force participants to go into any tourist attractions. The White temple is the highlight (and unfinished) since it was started in 1997 and the main temple, lake, art gallery and above ground cave are completed. The triple border (Thailand, Myanmar and Laos) is clearly visible." },
                { author: "Maria", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2025-11-05", text: "The tour started strong with the White Temple – it was stunning and exceeded expectations. Our guide's detailed explanations about the artist, history, and symbolism were excellent. Next were the beautiful Blue Temple and the unique Black House, which reminded us of Norwegian stave churches. The guide shared interesting facts about both artists/designers. The Long Neck Karen village stop was super interesting, where we learned about the local tribes. Our guide's English was very understandable, the included lunch was delicious, and the constant water supply in the car was greatly appreciated i" },
                { author: "Traveller", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-01-28", text: "it was great highly recommended the guide was funny and caring but please take away the long neck Karen it's disrespectful for the girls they seemed they had no option and didn't enjoy posing .." },
                { author: "Elodie", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2025-11-13", text: "Très bonne excursion ! Merci à notre guide de nous avoir accompagné et expliqué bcp de choses c’était très instructif. Nous avons passé un très bon moment." },
                { author: "Traveller", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 3, date: "2025-11-10", text: "Si bien nuestra guía fue amable, simpatiquísima y disponible, echamos mucho de menos un mínimo de explicaciones y contextualización de los sitios a los que fuimos. Está excursión vale para llegar, hacerte la foto y salir pitando al siguiente sitio casi sin tiempo de ver lo mínimo. Si te quieres ahorrar negociar con los taxis es perfecta, pero si de verdad quieres conocer los sitios está no es tu excursión." },
                { author: "Traveller", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2025-10-31", text: "Sympa. Guide à l’écoute, disponible. Des temps morts pour bien se reposer. Une immersion culinaire authentique avec les locaux." },
                { author: "Jakub", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2025-04-12", text: "Bardzo dobrze zorganizowana wycieczka. Wat był świetnym przewodnikiem. Opowiadał ciekawostki oraz żarciki. Przez całą wycieczkę czuliśmy się zaopiekowani. Zaletą tej wycieczki jest to, że odwiedzamy Białą Świątynię przed innymi więc nie ma większych tłumów." },
                { author: "Cecile", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2025-02-19", text: "Guide très intéressant ! Les 7 sites sont à voir absolument et l'interaction avec notre guide nous permet de bien comprendre les sites et leurs histoires." },
                { author: "Maximilian", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2025-02-15", text: "Alles super kann es nur weiter empfehlen !" },
                { author: "Cuellar", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2024-11-05", text: "Parn est un très bon guide, plein d'humour et qui donne des explications claires. Il est à l'écoute des gens. On a envie de le suivre. Je recommande fortement." }
            ]
        },
