                { author: "Maria", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-08-30", text: "Amazing Tour with Bright !!! He knows so much about the Lanna culture, extremely polite and friendly! Thank you so much, we had an amazing experience" },
                { author: "Elise", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-08-23", text: "Everything was great. Our tourguide Jane was lovely and super educational. We learned a lot about the history of the temple and Chiang Mai, as well as buddhism and the thai way of living. Definitely recommend!" },
                { author: "Quentin", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-08-18", text: "Booked a grouped tour but I was by myself, which it was great. My guide Emy was very knowledgeable and she thought me a lot about history of Doi Suthep as well as some introductions on Buddhism basics. I recommend you take an early tour so there is not many people and you can take nice pictures everywhere. Great overall" },
                { author: "Angela", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-08-04", text: "Amy was a super guide - very communicative with good English. She was very happy to answer all questions we had and offered to take lots of photos of us. I’ve been to many temples but this was the first time a guide explained how we could shake the bamboo sticks and receive a monk’s blessing." }
