                { author: "Rocio", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2025-03-24", text: "Es muy entretenido! Fuimos temprano a las 9:00 de la mañana y estábamos solos, lo que nos daba tiempo para disfrutar y repetir las fotos. Super recomendado", photos: ["https://images.asiabylocals.com/asiabylocals/reviews/art-in-paradise-illusion-museum-entry-ticket-in-chiang-mai/2201819/1600.webp"] },
                { author: "Nigel", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2024-01-10", text: "We went at 9am when it opened and had the place to ourselves giving us the chance to be a bit silly 😜. our 4 year old lost interest half way round but it's still good fun. Nice coffee shop at the end. Staff were fantastic" },
                { author: "Karolin", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2019-02-28", text: "It was so fun. Worth to go. Price ok. We did the funniest pictures ever." },
                { author: "Yan", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2018-05-23", text: "Enjoyed the experience very much we went early before any crowds and had it almost to ourselves the only criticism would be the app that you could download for free and created special effects was hard to load and very intermittent in its functioning. Thoroughly enjoyed the gallery and came out with excellent photos and videos which we will enjoy in the future." },
                { author: "Carol", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2018-03-02", text: "My husband and I visited the 3D Museum in Bangkok Ostende,Belgium and now in Chiang Mai and I would highly recommend it to anyone that is into photography and loves to have great photos it's a lot of fun it's in the air conditioning and in chiangmai it was something different than seeing all the temples we really enjoyed our afternoon we spent over 3 hours there and we'll have some great photos to remember it all by" },
                { author: "Traveller", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-08-24", text: "I have a wonderful time. Staff very helpful" },
                { author: "Traveller", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 1, date: "2025-11-15", text: "we were unable to use our voucher and had to pay again." },
                { author: "Traveller", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 3, date: "2025-07-24", text: "It’s not ideal if you are a solo traveler without anyone to help take photos of you there" },
                { author: "Sylvie", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2025-01-24", text: "Magnifique on s est beaucoup amusé 😜" },
                { author: "Josephine", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2024-11-11", text: "Het was geweldig. ze hebben het erg leuk opgezet. in de tijd dat wij er zijn geweest in begin november waren er niet veel mensen, dus je had alle tijd om alles te bekijken. Betekent dat je gewoon een kaartje aan de balie kon kopen, want dat zou ons 2/3 van de prijs hebben gescheeld. Je krijgt namelijk korting als 60-plusser en dat is via een ticket organisatie niet te zien online. Leuk café in het gebouw, wanneer je klaar bent met de tentoonstelling. Het museum is wel ver vd stad gelegen." },
                { author: "Karlijn", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2024-08-02", text: "We waren er om 9u in de ochtend en daarom hadden we het hele museum voor onszelf. Echt alle tijd om gave foto's te maken en niemand die er per ongeluk doorheen loopt." },
                { author: "Traveller", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2024-07-30", text: "A very pleasant and original do-museum to visit with kids. It was calm and enjoyable. We took very nice and memorable pictures. Nice chocolate cake in the cafe afterwards." }
