            valueRating: 1.6,
            reviews: [
                { author: "Deborah", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2023-12-21", text: "Totally awesome!! I have a fear of heights, but I was strapped in well. The guides were absolutely awesome and they had really awesome senses of humor too! Would have loved to have done some more. Delicious lunch as well. The location is absolutely beautiful- so peaceful, well looked after and just gorgeous 😍 absolutely wonderful day!" },
                { author: "Carlos", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 1, date: "2026-08-15", text: "Very bad. I was waiting before the scheduled time and no one ask me if I was there to the activity. The hotel has two entrances, they were in just one and didn’t bother to go to the reception to look for me or to ask where I was. I was literally by the main road of the hotel waiting. Then they left without me and no money back, I don’t consider this a proper way to do business, don’t recommend at all." },
                { author: "Traveller", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 1, date: "2025-04-12", text: "het moest allemaal heel rap gaan het was heel snel gedaan, de eerste platformen waren saai totaal geen voldaan gevoel in België al spectaculairdere zipline kunnen doen" },
                { author: "Traveller", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2024-02-08", text: "Very good guides were very helpful and happy" },
                { author: "Justus", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 1, date: "2024-01-18", text: "10 minutes of ziplining in total is defenitely not worth it. we paid way too much for that tour. Was a kindergarden tour. not recommended!!!!" },
                { author: "Charlie", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 2, date: "2023-11-12", text: "I’ll start off by saying that the zip-lining was very fun. However it only lasted 10 minutes… you spend more time eating lunch than doing the actual activity. You don’t get good money for the price unfortunately." }
            ]
