  'wat-phra-that-doi-suthep-and-wat-pha-lat-evening-guided-tour-chiang-mai': {
            averageRating: 4.57,
            totalReviews: 94,
            guideRating: 4.53,
            valueRating: 4.38,
            reviews: [
                { author: "Jane", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2025-02-17", text: "We were able to get two spaces on this tour last minute as we were leaving the following day and hadn’t managed to get up the mountain to the temples. The bus driver and especially Danny, our guide, were terrific in accommodating us for the pickup and together with a small group of people, we all took the ride up the winding road to the jungle temple (Wat Pha Lat). It was stunning and so serene! Danny explained many interesting things about it and took some wonderful pictures for everyone. We then went further up the mountain to Wat Phra Doi Suthep. You will be given the choice of walking 306", photos: ["https://images.asiabylocals.com/asiabylocals/reviews/wat-phra-that-doi-suthep-and-wat-pha-lat-evening-guided-tour-chiang-mai/1972427/1600.webp", "https://images.asiabylocals.com/asiabylocals/reviews/wat-phra-that-doi-suthep-and-wat-pha-lat-evening-guided-tour-chiang-mai/1972428/1600.webp", "https://images.asiabylocals.com/asiabylocals/reviews/wat-phra-that-doi-suthep-and-wat-pha-lat-evening-guided-tour-chiang-mai/1972429/1600.webp"] },
                { author: "Janice", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2025-01-25", text: "Our guide Tommy was very professional & informative. He explained a lot about the Buddhist way of life & the architecture & history of Chiang Mai & its temples. It was nice to visit the temple by night & admire the view of the city. Well organized & worthwhile !", photos: ["https://images.asiabylocals.com/asiabylocals/reviews/wat-phra-that-doi-suthep-and-wat-pha-lat-evening-guided-tour-chiang-mai/1850455/1600.webp", "https://images.asiabylocals.com/asiabylocals/reviews/wat-phra-that-doi-suthep-and-wat-pha-lat-evening-guided-tour-chiang-mai/1850457/1600.webp", "https://images.asiabylocals.com/asiabylocals/reviews/wat-phra-that-doi-suthep-and-wat-pha-lat-evening-guided-tour-chiang-mai/1850458/1600.webp"] },
                { author: "Anthony", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2024-11-27", text: "Nice little tour. The tour was very well timed and the guide was very polite and knowledgeable. Pickup and drop off was easy within Chiang Mai city centre. Nice to do if you’re in Chiang mai with a free evening! The temples look absolutely incredible at night 😊😊😊", photos: ["https://images.asiabylocals.com/asiabylocals/reviews/wat-phra-that-doi-suthep-and-wat-pha-lat-evening-guided-tour-chiang-mai/1550160/1600.webp", "https://images.asiabylocals.com/asiabylocals/reviews/wat-phra-that-doi-suthep-and-wat-pha-lat-evening-guided-tour-chiang-mai/1550161/1600.webp", "https://images.asiabylocals.com/asiabylocals/reviews/wat-phra-that-doi-suthep-and-wat-pha-lat-evening-guided-tour-chiang-mai/1550162/1600.webp"] },
                { author: "Emma", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-08-08", text: "The half-day tour to Wat Phra That Doi Suthep and Wat Pha Lat turned out to be a wonderful discovery. Yyong is very well-prepared and professional, but also sweet, fun, and friendly. She explained everything with passion, shared lots of interesting facts and little curiosities, and happily answered all our questions. We really enjoyed our tour with her and would highly recommend this experience, as well as Yyong as a guide!" },
                { author: "Jane", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-07-10", text: "Evening tour was a good option, able to observe the monks chanting, a unique experience Both locations were beautiful and lovely to explore, guide was very informative and showed all areas on interest and customs that we could also take part in. We have stunning photos of our experience, would highly recommend." },
                { author: "Tetsuko", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2025-11-02", text: "Danny was great. Very helpful to take good pictures and always smiling." },
                { author: "Tajbinder", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2025-05-22", text: "I had a fantastic experience on the tour, Our tour guide was incredibly friendly, helpful, and knowledgeable. He made everyone feel welcome and ensured we had a great time while sharing interesting insights throughout the trip. Highly recommended" },
                { author: "Suzanne", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2025-04-23", text: "A very helpful and informative guide. Good transport." },
                { author: "Jonathan", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2025-03-26", text: "Our guide was great. The tour included all the highlights I hoped to see." },
                { author: "Wendy", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2025-03-04", text: "Amazing temples with a view and Pan was able to provide insight about them." },
                { author: "Andrew", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2025-02-24", text: "tour guide was very friendly and informative, answered all our questions." },
                { author: "Diana", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2025-02-13", text: "We're very happy we decided to make a stop at Chiang Mai, the temples in the mountains are imersed in the forest, which gives them an extra beauty. Our guide was great, gave us a lot of info" }
            ]
        },
