  '2-day-overnight-adventure-off-road-scooter-tour-amaz-views-in-chiang-mai': {
            averageRating: 5.0,
            totalReviews: 10,
            guideRating: 5.0,
            valueRating: 5.0,
            reviews: [
                { author: "Benjamin", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-06-13", text: "Had an amazing time with Golf/Tommy. Everything will be taken care of. You will get enough food and drinks. Stop for local coffee and drink tea in a rural village. We stopped halfway to relax in a natural hotspring. You will see some amazing scenery. We even cooked a local dish together. This was the best activities I did in Chiang Mai.", photos: ["https://images.asiabylocals.com/asiabylocals/reviews/2-day-overnight-adventure-off-road-scooter-tour-amaz-views-in-chiang-mai/7135075/1600.webp", "https://images.asiabylocals.com/asiabylocals/reviews/2-day-overnight-adventure-off-road-scooter-tour-amaz-views-in-chiang-mai/7135078/1600.webp", "https://images.asiabylocals.com/asiabylocals/reviews/2-day-overnight-adventure-off-road-scooter-tour-amaz-views-in-chiang-mai/7135082/1600.webp"] },
                { author: "Hadiya", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-07-11", text: "What an absolutely incredible 2-day motorbike tour! From start to finish, everything was so well organised, making the whole experience completely stress-free and enjoyable. The bike was in great condition and a pleasure to ride, and my guide, Tommy, was simply awesome. Friendly, knowledgeable, and great fun to spend two days with, he made the trip even more memorable. Even though we had a lot of rain (it is rainy season!), it didn’t stop us from having a fantastic time—it just added to the adventure! The food and drinks along the way were absolutely delicious, and there were countless stunnin" },
                { author: "Peter", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-03-26", text: "I had a great 2 days with my fantastic guide Jay! I have limited experience on two wheels but Jay let me train appropriately and then led me safely trough the experience. We stayed at a lovely homestay next to a river and had a brilliant Tubing trip and evening meal. All in all I would absolutely recommend this trip and Jay as a Guide. Thank you" },
                { author: "Gediminas", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2025-04-30", text: "It was an amazing experience with Jay. Not only is this a memorable trip, but also eye-opening to chat and listen about Thailand local life. Evening BBQ hot pot was delicious. I went with zero scooter experience, however, at least a little bit is recommended because the road is steep and curvy. I recommend to bring gloves, ankle and knee protection for your own safety. In this trip you will level up your scooter skills from novice to intermediate per 24 hours ;)" },
                { author: "Stefan", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-01-10", text: "Wir waren zu viert unterwegs und restlos begeistert – vom Erlebnis ebenso wie vom Reiseleiter. Der Trip hat unsere Erwartungen sogar übertroffen. Oft werden solche Touren spektakulärer beworben, als sie am Ende sind: Man fährt kaum ins Gelände und die Highlights bleiben aus. Hier war es genau umgekehrt. Wir fuhren durch steiles Gelände, überquerten den Fluss mehrfach und sogar über eine Hängebrücke. Mit den perfekt geeigneten Motorrädern war das ein riesiger Spass. Der Reiseleiter war grossartig: immer gut gelaunt, mit viel Humor und voll darauf bedacht, dass wir maximalen Spass hatten. Selbst" },
                { author: "Marius", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2024-12-29", text: "Die Tour war super, kann man nichts falsch machen. Auf Nachfrage werden auch individuelle Bedürfnisse erfüllt! gerne wieder" },
                { author: "Traveller", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2024-12-24", text: "Die Tour hat mir sehr gut gefallen." }
            ]
        },
