  'full-day-ethical-elephant-sanctuary-and-waterfall-in-chiang-mai': {
            averageRating: 4.78,
            totalReviews: 16,
            guideRating: 5.0,
            valueRating: 4.83,
            reviews: [
                { author: "Jessica", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 4, date: "2025-07-18", text: "This new ethical sanctuary is fantastic. Respect for the elephants is important; they are not mistreated and domesticated to satisfy tourist’s expectations, such as being able to touch them, swim with them, sit on their backs, etc. I was able to feed them, and we walked alongside them in the jungle, while respecting the necessary distances. They roam freely on 44 acres of land. I don't think a full day is necessary; the after-dinner activity didn't add much to this wonderful excursion. In the end, I would have preferred to pay only for the morning excursion.", photos: ["https://images.asiabylocals.com/asiabylocals/reviews/full-day-ethical-elephant-sanctuary-and-waterfall-in-chiang-mai/3123582/1600.webp", "https://images.asiabylocals.com/asiabylocals/reviews/full-day-ethical-elephant-sanctuary-and-waterfall-in-chiang-mai/3123583/1600.webp", "https://images.asiabylocals.com/asiabylocals/reviews/full-day-ethical-elephant-sanctuary-and-waterfall-in-chiang-mai/3123584/1600.webp"] },
                { author: "Andrea", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-07-18", text: "Me gusto muchísimo la experiencia, pude estar de cerca con los elefantes, caminar con ellos, alimentarlos y aprender sobre ellos. Me gustó que el día fue relajado y sin apuros. El guia estaba muy bien preparado y era muy amable asi como todos en el santuario. Realmente recomiendo esta experiencia.", photos: ["https://images.asiabylocals.com/asiabylocals/reviews/full-day-ethical-elephant-sanctuary-and-waterfall-in-chiang-mai/7636851/1600.webp", "https://images.asiabylocals.com/asiabylocals/reviews/full-day-ethical-elephant-sanctuary-and-waterfall-in-chiang-mai/7636852/1600.webp", "https://images.asiabylocals.com/asiabylocals/reviews/full-day-ethical-elephant-sanctuary-and-waterfall-in-chiang-mai/7636853/1600.webp"] },
                { author: "Caroline", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2025-10-28", text: "Transfer hat super geklappt. Nette Guides. Spaziergang mit den Elefanten war toll, konnten beim Schlammbaden beobachtet werden. War super, sie so frei beobachten zu können. Tolles Essen. Würde es sofort wieder machen.", photos: ["https://images.asiabylocals.com/asiabylocals/reviews/full-day-ethical-elephant-sanctuary-and-waterfall-in-chiang-mai/4415999/1600.webp", "https://images.asiabylocals.com/asiabylocals/reviews/full-day-ethical-elephant-sanctuary-and-waterfall-in-chiang-mai/4416000/1600.webp"] },
                { author: "Traveller", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-02-22", text: "Hermosa experiencia en todos los sentidos =) El camino tiene muchas curvas. Lo único que recomendaría a este proveedor es que sus conductores manejen con mayor precaución, más lento y no rebasen coches en carriles de doble sentido." },
                { author: "Traveller", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-02-15", text: "An amazing day we absolutely loved it! Best day in Chiang Mai!" },
                { author: "Traveller", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 4, date: "2026-01-05", text: "I couldn’t go on this trip as I was poorly, but my friend did and said it was lovely, up close with the elephants but only feeding them. They made some breathing inhaler which we’d nearly bought in a shop the day before, so she was happy about that. She said the day was cut short due to a shorter lunch, which wasn’t very much, good job she’d taken snacks too." },
                { author: "Traveller", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-01-04", text: "The information on how to take care of the elephants, the making of medicine balls to feed the elephants was great The individuals taking care of the elephants are very caring" },
                { author: "Traveller", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2025-11-13", text: "Staff great. Transfer on time. Very ethical So fun" },
                { author: "Floriane", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2025-02-09", text: "C’est un sanctuaire très récent qui a ouvert il y a moins d’un an et qui est est réellement « éthique ». La plupart des autres sanctuaires laissent les touristes interagir avec les éléphants, les toucher, se baigner avec eux, ce qui est très mauvais pour eux. Même domestiqués, les seuls interactions qui ne sont pas nocives pour eux sont celles avec ceux qui s’occupent d’eux, qui sont avec eux tous les jours. Une relation de confiance doit s’établir avant tout, comme dans toute relation… C’est pourquoi je recommande vraiment la visite de ce sanctuaire. On est quand même amenés à les nourrir et" }
            ]
        },
