                { author: "Gerrit", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-02-09", text: "Geweldig mooie dag! Wat prachtig om door de jungle te lopen. Veel klimmen en klauteren. De gids kwam zelf uit het Karen dorp en liet onderweg aantal bijzonderheden zien. De heerlijke lunch hebben we gegeten in het Karen dorp. Na de wandeling gingen we bamboe raften. Een leuke ervaring en onderweg zagen we olifanten de rivier oversteken. Heel veel dank aan Gino en de chauffeur. We leerden veel van hen en hadden heel fijn contact. Deze tour raden we aan om te gaan doen.", photos: ["https://images.asiabylocals.com/asiabylocals/reviews/excusive-trekking-eco-trails-2-3days-atvs-feeding-and-raft-trip-in-chiang-mai/5431836/1600.webp", "https://images.asiabylocals.com/asiabylocals/reviews/excusive-trekking-eco-trails-2-3days-atvs-feeding-and-raft-trip-in-chiang-mai/5431837/1600.webp", "https://images.asiabylocals.com/asiabylocals/reviews/excusive-trekking-eco-trails-2-3days-atvs-feeding-and-raft-trip-in-chiang-mai/5431838/1600.webp"] },
                { author: "Traveller", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-06-12", text: "We booked 2 Days 1 night trek, it was absolutely wonderful day, we treked throughout the jungle, hill, valley, waterfall, cooked, and rafting. Many cool experiences. Highly recommend 🥰🥰🥰" },
                { author: "Traveller", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-06-12", text: "It's was amazing hiking into beautiful natural jungle, visit hill tribe village, stay overnight, exchange experiences. Many thanks 🥰🥰" },
                { author: "Traveller", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2025-12-15", text: "🥰 We did trekking 1 day with friendly guide, the jungle was so beautiful, Karen Village was so interesting and we really enjoyed bamboo rafting 🥰🥰 Highly recommend !!" }
