                { author: "Traveller", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2025-10-31", text: "Good Guide/driver, came with us to the Sticky Waterfall and took pictures. ATV riding was also fun and save, Even for beginners. The stop at the Café is Not really outstanding, there better Theme-Cafés in Chiang Mai, better book a tour with another Option." }
