  'elephant-sanctuary-visit-with-mud-spa-and-workshop-in-chiang-mai': {
            averageRating: 4.59,
            totalReviews: 7,
            guideRating: 4.59,
            valueRating: 4.59,
            reviews: [
                { author: "Alissa", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-02-28", text: "It was a great day. The elephants seemed very relaxed and happy. It was an elephant family. The guides were very friendly and gave clear instructions on how to feed them, approach them and to make food. A great experience to walk alongside the big creatures. For the pictures it was nice that they offered local clothes, very cool. Also, enough space to change your clothes later and wash. The transfer was on point and comfortable. I would really recommend this tour! We had great fun!" },
                { author: "Angelica", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2025-12-22", text: "it was so fun and the guide was extremely knowledgeable. I would do this experience again!" },
                { author: "Traveller", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-04-10", text: "Guide was great and very informative, interacting with the elephants was the best experience would one hundred percent do again." },
                { author: "Traveller", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 3, date: "2026-03-02", text: "Grundsätzlich war diese Tour empfehlenswert. Wir haben essen für die Elefanten hergestellt, konnten sie füttern, sind anschließend mit 2 von ihnen durch den Dschungel gelaufen und zum Schluss ging es weiter mit einem Schlammbad und einer Dusche. Danach gab es noch etwas zu essen. Das ansich war es wert. Nur hatten wir extra diese Tour gebucht, da sie auf deutsch angeboten wurde, aber kein einziger Mitarbeiter spricht ansatzweise deutsch... unser Guide hat sich aber Mühe gegeben mit Händen und Füßen uns etwas zu erklären. Sehr schade und daher die Abzüge der Sterne." }
            ]
        },
