                { author: "Anouk", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-08-29", text: "Super kind woman with a sense of humor. You can choose which food you want to make, choosing of a list of options. Really nice experience, a must do!", photos: ["https://images.asiabylocals.com/asiabylocals/reviews/traditional-thai-cooking-class-with-local-chef-in-krabi/8421482/1600.webp", "https://images.asiabylocals.com/asiabylocals/reviews/traditional-thai-cooking-class-with-local-chef-in-krabi/8421483/1600.webp", "https://images.asiabylocals.com/asiabylocals/reviews/traditional-thai-cooking-class-with-local-chef-in-krabi/8421484/1600.webp"] },
                { author: "Alice", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-08-24", text: "Very good and knowledgeable chef. I got picked up and dropped off from my hotel. Lots of food to try once you have cooked it. Even managed to take some away in containers to enjoy later. Would recommend if you enjoy cooking.", photos: ["https://images.asiabylocals.com/asiabylocals/reviews/traditional-thai-cooking-class-with-local-chef-in-krabi/8330367/1600.webp", "https://images.asiabylocals.com/asiabylocals/reviews/traditional-thai-cooking-class-with-local-chef-in-krabi/8330369/1600.webp"] },
                { author: "Justina", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-09-01", text: "Had an amazing time cooking with Chef Thiwa. He was so patient and enthusiastic and made the class really enjoyable. A would definitely recommend going" },
                { author: "Villada", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-08-28", text: "Excellent class, a ton of food, great price and chef was great! would recommend this." },
                { author: "Belinda", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-07-19", text: "It was a great activity, the chef was lovely and so was our group! We were able make all different things too which was nice becuase all our spicy levels differed! We even took home a cook book with so many more recipes than what we were tight! Would highly recommend!" },
                { author: "Natalie", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-07-16", text: "Great activity, learnt so much in the time we spent with our wonderful Thai chef and made some delicious food that I can’t wait to try again when I’m back in the UK. Super value for money." },
                { author: "Nir", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-07-14", text: "Good food/education how to cook. Very funny and entertaining" },
                { author: "Claire", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-08-15", text: "Fantastic cooking class with a great chef. Easy to follow demonstrations with a cook book to try the recipes at home afterwards. Great choice of dishes and they tasted amazing. Everything was well prepared and plenty of time to sit down and enjoy the dishes. Would definitely recommend" },
                { author: "Hannah", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-07-31", text: "The activity was great, the Thiwa was a great guide and very knowledgeable! The food we cooked was great and I really enjoyed the fact we had a choice of what we could make! Lovely evening, thank you!" },
                { author: "Lilly-ann", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-07-29", text: "Our drive + instructor was amazing. If there is two of you, you can pay for 1 ticket and share the experience as it is a lot of food. They are super kind and helpful. Lots of drinking water available, veggie options and they are careful with allergies. They took lots of pics of us and we made pals with the people from our group. Lovely experience:)" },
                { author: "Sherise", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-07-23", text: "I had a wonderful experience with this Thai cooking class. The instructor was excellent. She explained every step clearly and made the class easy to follow. She had most of the ingredients prepared in advance, while still allowing us to chop and prepare some ingredients ourselves, which made the experience feel hands-on and authentic without being overwhelming. The cooking process was straightforward, and I was pleasantly surprised by how quickly the dishes came together. Most importantly, the food was absolutely delicious! Throughout the class, the instructor regularly checked whether we want" }
