  '2-day-khao-sok-jungle-safari-with-overnight-stay-in-krabi': {
            averageRating: 4.13,
            totalReviews: 6,
            guideRating: 4.13,
            valueRating: 4.13,
            reviews: [
                { author: "Annabella", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2025-01-26", text: "We were not able to do the hike planned because there was a incident with wild elephants. Our main guide Pradet offered us various different activities or to take us to a cave. It was an amazing hike and Pradet was very knowledgeable, friendly and funny. He made our trip unforgettable. The food was all delicious and we had large servings. Fresh fruit and homemade Thai food. The accommodations were lovely. 10/10 would recommend this trip to anyone!", photos: ["https://images.asiabylocals.com/asiabylocals/reviews/2-day-khao-sok-jungle-safari-with-overnight-stay-in-krabi/1853691/1600.webp", "https://images.asiabylocals.com/asiabylocals/reviews/2-day-khao-sok-jungle-safari-with-overnight-stay-in-krabi/1853692/1600.webp", "https://images.asiabylocals.com/asiabylocals/reviews/2-day-khao-sok-jungle-safari-with-overnight-stay-in-krabi/1853693/1600.webp"] },
                { author: "Sophie", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 4, date: "2026-02-17", text: "We got picked up at 7:30 AM and then had to pick up some other people who were doing a different activity. On the way we made some unnecessary stops for example at a pineapple farm and then we had to drop the others of before going to the tree house. By the time we arrived there it was already 15:30. Once we got there everything was nice! The tree house is a lovely place to stay. It is cosy and there is a hot shower, airco and wifi! After settling we went for the three hour hike which was amazing because our guide knew so much about the jungle and animals. The next day we did bamboo rafting wh", photos: ["https://images.asiabylocals.com/asiabylocals/reviews/2-day-khao-sok-jungle-safari-with-overnight-stay-in-krabi/5520666/1600.webp", "https://images.asiabylocals.com/asiabylocals/reviews/2-day-khao-sok-jungle-safari-with-overnight-stay-in-krabi/5520667/1600.webp", "https://images.asiabylocals.com/asiabylocals/reviews/2-day-khao-sok-jungle-safari-with-overnight-stay-in-krabi/5520668/1600.webp"] },
                { author: "Mikkel", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-01-23", text: "Fantastisk tur med rigtig sød guide. Rigtig fine bungalows og super hyggeligt stemning. Alt i alt en rigtig god tur, som klart kan anbefales!" },
                { author: "Adele", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 1, date: "2025-02-27", text: "Nous sommes très déçus de cette expérience. Le programme n'a pas été respecté, et plusieurs éléments manquaient (le cours de cuisine, la balade en bateau bamboo (nous avons eu des canoës en plastique), nous avons seulement aperçu le lac quelques minutes, de loin, alors que ce lac était notre objectif principal), et les éléments ajoutés non prévus sur le programme (visite d'une production d'ananas, de papayes, le temps, nourrir les poissons...) étaient soit gratuits, soit très peu chers. Ces derniers nous ont donné la sensation qu'il fallait \"combler\" la matinée. Et le logement, bien que charma" }
            ]
        },
