                { author: "Lena", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-05-29", text: "I enjoyed the snorkeling activities and island stops were you could walk around or swim and explore the caves a bit.", photos: ["https://images.asiabylocals.com/asiabylocals/reviews/iconic-4-islands-day-tour-by-longtail-boat-with-lunch/6896112/1600.webp", "https://images.asiabylocals.com/asiabylocals/reviews/iconic-4-islands-day-tour-by-longtail-boat-with-lunch/6896113/1600.webp", "https://images.asiabylocals.com/asiabylocals/reviews/iconic-4-islands-day-tour-by-longtail-boat-with-lunch/6896114/1600.webp"] },
                { author: "Ivane", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 3, date: "2026-08-10", text: "Malheureusement la mer était agitée, selon les avancées météorologiques, les sorties bateaux étaient dangereuses et déconseillées ! Nous y sommes allées mais impossible de faire du snorkeling ni de baignade et un retour sur l’île a 14h…" }
