  'white-water-rafting-and-zipline-adventure-in-krabi': {
            averageRating: 4.05,
            totalReviews: 13,
            guideRating: 4.2,
            valueRating: 3.8,
            reviews: [
                { author: "Alicja", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-07-18", text: "We had a fabulous time on our trip. The guides were amazing and made sure we had a great time, we appreciated that the 3 of us were on our own raft." },
                { author: "Alan", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2019-11-27", text: "Water shoes are essential The access to the inflatable was positively dangerous and my holiday companion fell on the rocks and had bleeding knees Can’t be too much trouble and expense to build a suitable causeway ! Additionally when we arrived were told it was 20 mins for the mild rapids and there was a further cost to do the medium and fast rapids - having travelled 2 hours by mini van we opted to do the whole rapids for an additional 1600 Bhts and although we were told it would be for one hour it was only 50 mins !" },
                { author: "Traveller", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 4, date: "2026-03-03", text: "Der Anfang mit der Fahrt war etwas schade bei uns stand start 8.30 und plötzlich um 7.39 war der Fahrer bei uns wir haben keine Info bekommen. Dann hiess es 7.45 gehe ich. Wir haben es geschafft der Fahrer war sehr nett auch der Guide. Das Rafting hat uns gefallen wir haben jedoch mehr Action erwartet. Es kostete alles noch zusätzlich recht viel wennan mehhr erleben woll. Am Schluss gingen wir zum Monkey Tempel , dass war das absolute Highlight. Wir konnten Agfen Füttern." },
                { author: "Traveller", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 4, date: "2025-06-25", text: "It’s a good activity- ignore the other reviews. Picked up on time, 1-2 hour drive to the location from Ao Nang, with a stop break. Staff were super professional, communicative, and friendly. Because it was low season there were very few of us, and since I was the only one not doing ATVs they asked if it was okay if I waited for the others to come back so we could do the rafting and ziplines together- which is perfectly understandable. In the meantime, they let me have some free ice cream and I got to relax with a view of the river. Safety was taken seriously, and they communicated well what to" },
                { author: "Ferretti", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 4, date: "2025-03-16", text: "l'organizzazione è stata un po' carente sin dall'inizio. oltre a ciò nessuno ha informato che il viaggio sarebbe stato così lungo. Ultimo alla zip line perché avevo proseguito il rafting a 7 km come proposto, non sapevo dove andare." },
                { author: "Patricia", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 2, date: "2024-12-23", text: "- Geprobeerd om deze activiteit te verplaatsen via nummer van gids maar deze reageert niet, uiteindelijk zelf geregeld. - er wordt een grote massa bootjes de stroom versnelling op gestuurd waardoor het in geen enkel opzicht een rafting meer is. Zo massaal is het opgezet. Wij schatten dat er zeker 50 bootjes achter elkaar of naast elkaar de versnelling af gingen. De moeite niet waard om deze activiteit te boeken" },
                { author: "Traveller", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 3, date: "2024-02-11", text: "Also der Part mit dem Rafting ist wirklich spannend und abenteuerlich danach ist Rafting im Freizeitpark ein Witz dafür gibt es 3 Sterne. Der Rest ist absolute Katastrophe, Vorort wird aufeinmal einem erzählt das man warten muss das andere noch andere Aktivitäten haben. Man wartet dann 30-60 Minuten an einem Ort mir einer komplett verschmutzen Toilette." },
                { author: "Traveller", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 3, date: "2024-01-30", text: "Det var fedt at sejler i gummibåd med de super friske og opmærksomme fyre, der havde en god energi og god humør. 👍👍👍 Vores guide gav desværre ingen info til os på hele turen. Vi kom ikke op i Monkey Cave, hvilket vi først blev informeret om da vi skulle i bussen og hjem ad. Der var bestilt afhentning og afsætning på hotellet… men bureauet ringede udenom os til vores hotel og spurgte om de kunne sørge for transport til den nærmeste 7 - eleven. Vores hotel syntes det var mærkeligt og vi stod i den situation at skulle booke en taxi. Ligeledes ville de heller ikke sætte os af ved hotellet, men ved" },
                { author: "Desiree", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 1, date: "2019-12-07", text: "Total langweilige Tour und fernab von der „blumigen“ Beschreibung" },
                { author: "Ralf", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 3, date: "2019-11-30", text: "Nachdem andere noch zusätzliche Aktivitäten wie z.B. Quadfahren gebucht hatten, waren für uns Wartezeiten gegeben. Der Verlauf des Ausflugs entsprach nicht dem angebotenen Programm, eine Dschungelwanderung gab es nicht und die Zeit für den Affentempel ist zu kurz." }
            ]
        },
