  'krabi-private-escape-emerald-pool-hot-springs-and-tiger-cave-by-local-operator': {
            averageRating: 4.53,
            totalReviews: 20,
            guideRating: 5.0,
            valueRating: 4.17,
            reviews: [
                { author: "Marta", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2025-12-25", text: "Really happy with the trip, it was exactly as we expected. We had selected the earliest time possible for this trip and that helped a lot with climbing up to the temple as it would have been more difficult in the afternoon heat. Great views from the top of the temple, enjoyed the walk in nature at the emerald pools and the dip in the hot springs at the end was amazing!" },
                { author: "Kim", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2025-11-19", text: "Really enjoyed it and it was the Cattery service that picked us up straight from the hotel with no rush at the destinations we had gone too. We had a private x2 person and it was super chilled with no problems at all. Would use again" },
                { author: "Traveller", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 3, date: "2026-01-27", text: "was not a guided trip. only had a driver that dropped us off at each location" },
                { author: "Courtney", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 3, date: "2026-01-24", text: "The hot springs were okay, the Emerald pool was nothing to see very boring we walked all the way with is 2km to the top pool and it was not worth it at all. The tiger cave was a hard walk to the top but we did it for an amazing view. If I was doing again I’d just get a taxi to tiger cave and not bother with the rest." },
                { author: "Peter", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 4, date: "2025-11-16", text: "Alles in orde , mooie van vriendelijke en gedienstige chauffeur" },
                { author: "Simona", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2025-09-01", text: "Tutto perfetto. L’autista è stato gentile e ci ha aspettato. Il van è pulitissimo e molto confortevole! Ha esaudito tutte le nostre richieste." },
                { author: "Traveller", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 1, date: "2025-05-05", text: "They were supposed to pick us up at 7am and came an hour later, no communication from their side as to what happened. Had to call multiple times and were told different stories: driver got lost, car broke down and then the driver said they only messaged him at 7:41am to pick us up. Because of the late start we got to the hot springs and emerald pool when it was super busy, we then wanted to skip the tiger cave and just be dropped off at a beach and even then they said can’t happen because it’s not on the itinerary. Overall the experience of having to deal with this agency made it really horrib" },
                { author: "Barbara", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2025-03-26", text: "Es war eine perfekt organisierte Reise mit einem Fahrer namens \"Jo\". Er war bereits 15 Min vor Reisebeginn beim Hotel. Mit dem Google Translater haben wir uns verständigt, aber er hat auch ein bisschen englisch gesprochen. Wir konnten zu Beginn wählen wo wir starten wollen - wir haben um 7 Uhr Früh mit der Tigerhöhle gestartet (es ist wirklich empfehlenswert dort so früh wie möglich rauf zu gehen aufgrund der Hitze). Danach ging es zu den Emerald Pools und zu den Hot Springs. Er hat uns immer bis zum Eingang begleitet und Fotos von uns gemacht :) er hat sogar ein Pflaster für meinen Sohn organ" },
                { author: "Elise", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2025-02-27", text: "Le chauffeur nous a laissé le choix du commencement des activités… du coup on a commencé par la grotte du tigre, ensuite la piscine d’émeraude puis les sources d’eau chaude. C’était super car nous avons évité du coup la foule qui commencent par les piscines… nous avons été à notre rythme ! Je recommande !" },
                { author: "Michael", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2025-01-03", text: "Die Tour hat gut geklappt. Alle Beschreibungen wurden eingehalten. Der Fahrer sprach zwar kein Englisch, aber dafür ließ sich alles per whats App mit einer Kontaktperson der Agentur regeln. Die haben dann dem Fahrer die passenden Anweisungen gegeben. Wir konnten zudem die Reihenfolge und die Dauer nach unseren Wünschen festlegen. Der Fahrer war freundlich und das Fahrzeug eher sehr großzügig (Van). Wir können diese Tour jedem empfehlen, der nicht mühevoll auf teuren Taxiservice warten will (die Preise hätten sich zudem kaum unterschieden)." },
                { author: "Traveller", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2024-11-25", text: "The tour with our private driver, Mr. Wut, was excellent. We had plenty of time to explore everything at our own pace. Highly recommended!" }
            ]
        },
