  'klang-cave-bangtong-temple-with-bor-thor-kayaking-in-krabi': {
            averageRating: 4.77,
            totalReviews: 15,
            guideRating: 4.7,
            valueRating: 4.5,
            reviews: [
                { author: "Traveller", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2020-02-06", text: "This trip was an amazing experience! We were lucky to be the only two on the tour. The places we visited were quiet and beautiful. Well organised tour with a very knowledgeable guide (named Hon) His English was very good and his knowledge of the places we visited was second to none. He was very interesting especially about the local nature. Would highly recommend!!" },
                { author: "Genesis", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2019-11-27", text: "It was amazing! If you want to see something different than beaches for a day. The tour guide was also super sweet and helped me all day! Had a really nice time!" },
                { author: "Daniele", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2024-03-23", text: "The whole trip was amazing." },
                { author: "Selissa", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2022-11-04", text: "Super tur idag! Varierande aktiviteter, miljöer och historia. Vi hade en super trevlig guide vid namn av Bee, engelskan kan förbättras men överlag var hon hur bra som helst. Eftersom vi kom efter en regnperiod blev det mycket vatten i grottan samt lerigt. Kan vara bra att inte ta med ömtåliga skor. Kan även tipsa om att ta med strumpor till palatset. Man måste ta av skorna och stenarna är varma att gå på. Kajaken var grymt bra. Säg både apor samt sällsynta fåglar. Hade en helt otroligt duktig guide vid namn av Maan. Duktig på engelska samt bra fakta. Lunchen som han och hans familj bjöd på var" },
                { author: "Peggy", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2020-03-10", text: "Einfach mega! Wir hatten einen unglaublich schönen Tag. Da zur Zeit sehr wenig los ist ( Corona) hatten wir das Glück allein zu sein. Wir haben uns wie VIPs gefühlt. Unser Guide Hen (Henry) war sehr freundlich, sprach gut englisch und hatte viel Ahnung. Die Flosstour, war sehr interessant, um diese geniessen zu können einfach ruhig sein, man hört so viele unterschiedliche Geräusche, so dass man sich wie im Dschungel fühlt, wir könnten sogar eine Schlange sehen. Als es zum Kajak fahren ging, sind wir abseits der Route gewesen und unser Guide hat uns eine Lagune gezeigt, der Weg dahin, amazing," },
                { author: "Traveller", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 4, date: "2020-02-21", text: "Fajna przygoda, przyroda cudowna, Splyw tratwami za krótki, kajakami za długi :). Jedzenie bardzo dobre." },
                { author: "Kennet", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 4, date: "2020-01-21", text: "Mycket bra aktiviteter, helst kajak paddlingen med mycket god mat efteråt och väl tilltagen lunch, och väldigt vackert tempel, ta med strumpor till templet då stengolven bitvis kan vara väldigt heta att gå på utomhus. Guiden skulle behöva tala och förstå engelska bättre, annars en jättebra utflykt för en liten summa." },
                { author: "Patrick", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 3, date: "2020-01-15", text: "Rafting trop court rien vu comme animal sauvage ( en même temps les rameurs ont discutés très fort tous le temps donc si animal ......) aucune orchidée . L’eau turquoise est jonché de détritus et vidée de cocotier magnifique. La guide a Faut de son mieux en anglais car Nous concernant notre anglais est basique" },
                { author: "Andreas", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2020-01-02", text: "We got picked up right on time by the very kind team. It was about 50 min drive to the first activity which was bamboo raft. We had the pleasure to be all alone for this activity and therefore had the river to ourselves. At the end of the river the driver was ready to take us to the bigger river where we would kayak for a while. Again only me and my wife, the guide and her kayak “driver”. First stop was great skull cave, amazing limerock formation and also cave paintings. I would reccommend a flashlight so to better see the paintings :) then we paddled further to another amazing cave, which we" },
                { author: "Cléa", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 4, date: "2019-12-13", text: "Très bonne excursion. Super coin pour faire du kayak. Balade en bambou super agréable. Très bonne organisation et bon repas le midi. Guides très gentils. Malheureusement nous n'avons pas pu voir le temple prévu (temple apparemment fermé car jour de l'anniversaire du roi). Mais nous avons quand même eu l'occasion de voir un autre temple (malheureusement en construction) avec une superbe vue." },
                { author: "Jørgen", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2019-12-04", text: "We were only the two of us on this tour this day. No rush going from place to place. Our guides were very nice, welcoming, and good at informing. We really recommend this if you want to do something different, and enjoy being in nature. Our guides also took lots of photos which they sent to us on email afterwards. We first went to the temple, because early there are few people there, which was good. Had the temple almost to ourselves. It was beautiful. After this we went for the bamboo rafting. The water was not very clear due to heavy rain the day before. It can be so clear that you can see t" }
            ]
        },
