                { author: "Traveller", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-06-17", text: "The shuttle was on time, the staff were friendly, and breakfast was served in the morning. I enjoyed this trip; I got to snorkel and the guide explained everything thoroughly." },
                { author: "Traveller", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-06-16", text: "It was a truly wonderful trip! The service was excellent, and the guides were very lovely. Plus the lunch buffet was fantastic with plenty of menu options to choose from. Today weather was absolutely perfect, and the views of the islands were breathtaking. I personally liked Koh Poda the most because of its beautiful beach and Koh Tang Ming standing prominently right in front. I really made the right choice choosing this tour company. Highly recommended!" },
                { author: "Kanyanat", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-06-16", text: "สนุกมากไกด์ก็ดูเเลดีมาก เป็นกันเอง อาหารอร่อยมากสะอาด ถือว่าเป็นทริปที่ดีมาก" },
                { author: "Traveller", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 4, date: "2026-04-10", text: "War an sich gut, wurden nur leider viel früher als die anderen abgeholt und mussten deshalb fast 2 stunden warten. Rest war super :)" },
                { author: "Traveller", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 3, date: "2026-03-29", text: "The four islands tour was nice but time went too fast and I felt like it wasn’t enough time to enjoy each island. Our favorite was Koh Poda as it was easier to snorkel there. The food provided was surprisingly good and great options, they fed the group well. I only gave three stars because the tour company was very unorganized, lots of miscommunication and after multiple conversations, they still managed to pick us up 40 minutes late and kept asking for the name of our hotel. They had forgotten us and still had to go back to pick us up. Then when we got to the check in area, they had us booked" },
                { author: "Traveller", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 3, date: "2026-03-23", text: "Instead of 7 island 7 hr trip, was taken on a crowded 4 island boat for about 4 hrs. Not sure why as no one cared to explain even after asking multiple times." }
