                { author: "Traveller", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-08-26", text: "This was a trip I was very impressed with. I come to Krabi every year because I love it. This time I traveled with JJ Company. The pick-up was on time, the staff were friendly, and the place was incredibly beautiful. All the boat staff were lovely and helpful. The guide provided complete information about every place. I highly recommend traveling with this company; you will be impressed." }
