  'ziplining-with-abseiling-and-rock-climbing-options-in-krabi': {
            averageRating: 4.94,
            totalReviews: 189,
            guideRating: 4.95,
            valueRating: 4.83,
            reviews: [
                { author: "Andrew", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-04-16", text: "We did zones A and B, our guides were really helpful and made sure we were secure at all times. You start with a few smaller ziplines to get used to it then slowly get higher and higher. The abseiling was the best part I would say, definitely do it if you wanna push your comfort zone. They also have monkeys as well hanging around which you can see in between ziplines.", photos: ["https://images.asiabylocals.com/asiabylocals/reviews/ziplining-with-abseiling-and-rock-climbing-options-in-krabi/6246737/1600.webp", "https://images.asiabylocals.com/asiabylocals/reviews/ziplining-with-abseiling-and-rock-climbing-options-in-krabi/6246738/1600.webp", "https://images.asiabylocals.com/asiabylocals/reviews/ziplining-with-abseiling-and-rock-climbing-options-in-krabi/6246739/1600.webp"] },
                { author: "Alexandra", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-02-27", text: "We had the most amazing zipline experience in Krabi today! From start to finish everything was perfectly organized and so much fun. Huge thank you to our guides, Annie and Sammy – they were absolutely incredible! So friendly, helpful, professional and super fun. They made us feel safe the whole time, encouraged us, and kept the energy high throughout the entire activity. The whole experience was exciting, smooth and full of laughter. You can tell they really love what they do. 1000% recommend this activity if you’re in Krabi – and if you can, ask for Annie and Sammy! 🙌🔥", photos: ["https://images.asiabylocals.com/asiabylocals/reviews/ziplining-with-abseiling-and-rock-climbing-options-in-krabi/5636520/1600.webp", "https://images.asiabylocals.com/asiabylocals/reviews/ziplining-with-abseiling-and-rock-climbing-options-in-krabi/5636521/1600.webp", "https://images.asiabylocals.com/asiabylocals/reviews/ziplining-with-abseiling-and-rock-climbing-options-in-krabi/5636522/1600.webp"] },
                { author: "Richard", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-02-08", text: "Had the best day and what an experience. The guides were so friendly 2 of them were brothers. They made the activities more fun.", photos: ["https://images.asiabylocals.com/asiabylocals/reviews/ziplining-with-abseiling-and-rock-climbing-options-in-krabi/5420429/1600.webp", "https://images.asiabylocals.com/asiabylocals/reviews/ziplining-with-abseiling-and-rock-climbing-options-in-krabi/5420430/1600.webp", "https://images.asiabylocals.com/asiabylocals/reviews/ziplining-with-abseiling-and-rock-climbing-options-in-krabi/5420431/1600.webp"] },
                { author: "Eli", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-05-28", text: "Totally fun activity! The staff were super nice and funny, I felt safe when ziplining, absailing as well as rock climbing. They're all super friendly, helpful and supportive. The ziplining offers epic jungle views and the limestone that you can go climbing on is beautiful, although it requires a little forearm strength. A 5/5 Stars experience, definitely reccomend to do this." },
                { author: "Jana", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-04-29", text: "It was an amazing experience and definitely worth it ! It was just us two with two guides. The guides where very nice and explained everything" },
                { author: "Kathrine", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-03-31", text: "The zipline experience was great and our guides were so amazing and fun to be around!" },
                { author: "Jancy", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-03-12", text: "This vendor (Tripstore) got into contact with me as soon as I booked, giving clear instructions and reminders on how to proceed. Their prompt response on WhatsApp was also very assuring. On the activity day, pick-up from my hotel in Krabi Town was smooth. The Thai'd Up crew was the best. They were very experienced and the team worked together seamlessly to ensure the safety of all participants doing the ziplines. Instructions were clear and they took really good photos and videos. I took a full-day tour. Abseiling was fun and easy. No pressure, just follow Papa Bear! I want to especially thank" },
                { author: "Ellie", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-02-08", text: "A great afternoon out! We did the Zone A and Zone B Zip Line and Abseiling and really enjoyed! Our guides were great! Super helpful and really funny. Always happy to take photos for us too! Would highly recommend this trip 😊" },
                { author: "Megan", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-02-02", text: "Our tour guide was A for the 2 hour zip lining. Him and the other staff were amazing and really helped to ease any nerves we had. They are very particular about safety and checked my harness multiple times to make sure it was okay. We had refreshments after which were lovely. I had a really great time and would highly recommend." },
                { author: "Yousef", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-01-19", text: "It was an amazing experience especially rock climbing" },
                { author: "Blanca", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-01-10", text: "Everything was according to the information provided by the app. The instructors were amazing, welcoming, polite, kind and very very very fun. Dan and Alex made our day definitely better. We will always remember them" },
                { author: "Olga", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-01-27", text: "I loved it. I have never done it before, but the guys were patient and explained everything to me. I definitely recommend this activity!!" }
            ]
        },
