                { author: "Ben", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-07-01", text: "myself and my son had a brilliant time on this trip. we started off with a very chilled kayak trip around the lake, surrounded by stunning scenery, we then moved onto an exciting quad bike ride through various tracks. we had a great time and would definitely recommend it", photos: ["https://images.asiabylocals.com/asiabylocals/reviews/atv-ride-crystal-kayaking-and-swimming-tour-in-krabi/7411772/1600.webp", "https://images.asiabylocals.com/asiabylocals/reviews/atv-ride-crystal-kayaking-and-swimming-tour-in-krabi/7411774/1600.webp"] },
                { author: "Amina", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-06-19", text: "Amazing experience. The atv track was very rocky which made it more fun and staff were really friendly. As for the kayaking 10/10 experience, swimming in the lake was the highlight and our guide was amazing. Would recommend this activity to others." },
                { author: "Traveller", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-07-22", text: "It was very well planned. I was alone for the ATV as there was no group, the guide took a longer ATV ride and took some amazing pictures and videos as well. Kayaking was out of this world. The spot is where scenes from Jurassic World Rebirth were shot. I would 10/10 recommend this!" }
