  'hong-islands-day-trip-by-speedboat-with-lunch': {
            averageRating: 4.5,
            totalReviews: 33,
            guideRating: 4.8,
            valueRating: 4.4,
            reviews: [
                { author: "Dóra", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-06-26", text: "The day was lovely! Our tour guide Noon was amazing, she joked a lot which made the day more fun. We visited nice islands and had enough time to explore everything. I can definitely recommend this tour!" },
                { author: "Alexandra", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-02-28", text: "An amazing day, the team was absolutely great, we had a motor issue to the boat and they needed to change boats. We haven’t felt any hassle, we were disembarked on Bamboo Island from one boat and after 1 hour of enjoying the pristine water, embarked on a different boat that arrived meanwhile. koh Phi Phi Lee is a gem, and Maya Bay probably the most beautiful beach/bay in the world. We livede every moment. Thank you!" },
                { author: "Boryana", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2025-03-19", text: "The trip was fun and we had one great day around the island but most of all we would like to thank our guide who was an amazing person!" },
                { author: "Traveller", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 3, date: "2026-07-23", text: "Los sitios que fuimos a ver son preciosos, el guía super atento, pero la comida pésima. Este punto habría que mejorarlo sustancialmente. Como siempre la actitud del personal es lo mas valorable." },
                { author: "Sofía", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 3, date: "2026-02-19", text: "En el traslado de ida eramos 20 personas en una van, rodilla con rodilla. La camioneta no tenía el nombre del proveedor del tour (oh hoo) sino Nang An Group Co., Ltd En el puerto estuvimos esperando 45 minutos a que saliera el barco. Nos devolvieron a nuestro hotel a las 16, dos horas más tarde de lo previsto. El guía Coke genial, habla muy bien inglés y es muy atento." },
                { author: "Nico", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 4, date: "2025-02-10", text: "Die Tour ist an sich schön. Leider sind die Stopps nicht wie in der Buchung beschrieben. Der längere Aufenthalt der Tour (1:40h) sollte am Anfang stattfinden und nicht am Ende da sonst die Mittagshitze auf der Insel einzug hält. Die Tourguides benötigen DRINGEND ein Walkie Talkie / Funkgerät um mit dem Captain zu kommunzieren wenn die Gäste bereits auf dem Steg stehen. Wir warteten immer länger auf den Stegen als andere Gäste bei anderen unternehmen da die Abstimmung schwierig war. Beim Essen sollte man bereits bei der Buchung die Option Vegetarisch hinzufügen damit später keiner leer ausgeht." },
                { author: "Eric", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2025-02-06", text: "Ce que j'ai préféré, c'est d'avoir le temps de bien profiter sur chaque île (prendre des photos, se baigner et explorer le lieu." },
                { author: "Traveller", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 4, date: "2024-11-15", text: "Es lo prometido, aunque no es grato ir con todo el malón... Muy buena onda la tripulación" },
                { author: "Traveller", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 3, date: "2024-11-06", text: "Me recogieron 1h tarde, y la comida y atención regular." },
                { author: "Silvia", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 4, date: "2024-10-29", text: "Escursione bella piacevole esaustiva, sicuramente per vedere le Hong island in mezza giornata ideale, relax e tempo libero abbondante solo all’ultima tappa, pranzo buono tipico e viene offerta frutta fresca al ritorno." },
                { author: "Niki", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2024-05-13", text: "Very polite people and nice activities" }
            ]
        },
