                { author: "Traveller", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2024-12-09", text: "Reiseleiter sehr nett und gut organisiert. Gutes Essen, jederzeit kühle Getränke" },
                { author: "Traveller", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2024-11-27", text: "Bee guide and crew was fantastic. I am 77 years young. They kept me safe during the whole activity. There was a mistake made by me. I listed hotel name wrong ( Holiday AoNang but should have been Holiday Inn Resort). Your Staff made sure I was not left behind and made special efforts to find and pick me up. They gave me special attention. I will come back again and use your activities. Give Bee my regards." }
