  'freediving-and-snorkeling-at-yawasam-and-talu-island-in-krabi': {
            averageRating: 3.96,
            totalReviews: 39,
            guideRating: 4.56,
            valueRating: 4.27,
            reviews: [
                { author: "Olivia", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2025-01-23", text: "Really enjoyed this trip. The guide was great, very friendly and kind. The snorkelling spots were beautiful with lots of different fish and corals, and there were absolutely no crowds!" },
                { author: "Emily", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2025-01-20", text: "This was an absolutely amazing experience! Our guide took us to some amazing places with lots of fish and sea life - the pick up from hotel and boat ride was smooth and efficient - would highly recommend! They provided flippers and snorkels" },
                { author: "Jennifer", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2024-01-09", text: "The guide was very nice and friendly, they brought us to very cool snorkeling spots. He went with us in the water to show us some cool fish. We saw a lot of cool fish and he the guide made us feel safe. They go in groups of maximum 10 people, we were with 6 people. Overall veru good and fun expierence would definetely reccomand if you want to go snorkeling and free diving." },
                { author: "garry", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2023-09-19", text: "great spots to snorkel the guide was very informative lunch was basic but good pick up was on time and clean" },
                { author: "Janne", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2023-08-24", text: "The Host is super nice and fun to talk to. He shows you around Yawasam Island and you see beautiful corals, in our opinion the prettiest we yet saw. You go to a second Island and go around again. While snorkeling the host points out sea creatures to look at. You can see everything from tropical fish to baby sharks, puffer fish and squid. You end the tour with a home cooked lunch on the beach and can climb up through a little cave to have a great view of the lagoon. Definitely worth doing! We would definitely recommend this tour as it was our favorite." },
                { author: "Iveta", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 4, date: "2025-03-13", text: "We liked the snorkeling trip. We stopped at two islands, one of them was more like a huge rock. We liked it, there were many different fish and corals. Visibility was worse because there was a lot of plankton, but that's nature. We stopped for lunch at the beautiful hidden beach of Ko Poda Nai, there were only 2 boats there👍. We were very satisfied with the trip, it had only one small flaw. We were promised snorkeling footage that the guide documented, so far we haven't got it😏" },
                { author: "Mette", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 4, date: "2024-01-26", text: "Overall it was a nice trip. Due to wind and High sea the trip did not include any beaches or Cave snorkeling. We had a nice snorkling spot with lots of different fish and clear water. Lunch was good and fresh fruit after snorkling was very nice. The guide was in water with us and took lots of nice pictures of everyone. We were 9 people for this trip, so it was not crowded on the boat. Due to the weather everyone got quite wet on the way to the first stop- waterproof bag is a good thing to bring, as the description says. We would book this trip again, if we come back to Ao Nang, hopefully on a" },
                { author: "Traveller", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 4, date: "2026-04-11", text: "It was ok, visibility wasn’t great but that was out of the control of the guide. The equipment was ok. Food wasn’t to my liking but you cannot please everyone. The main disappointment was the photos/ videos, not the best and few and far between, if these had have been a paid extra it would have been very poor. All said for the price and a day out was good value for money but not sure how it would have been with more than the 6 on our trip, 7 out of 10 for my experience." },
                { author: "Traveller", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 4, date: "2026-02-11", text: "Vegetarisch bestellt, war jedoch nicht vorhanden. das Schnorchel war super." },
                { author: "Ana", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 3, date: "2025-11-13", text: "Nunca fiz outra, mas o barco era velho, avariou, tiveram que chamar outro, claro que se resolveu, mas vimos barcos bem melhores, o guia mergulhava e ia embora, quem conseguia acompanhar otimo, quem nao conseguia, ficava por ali" },
                { author: "Caterina", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2025-05-05", text: "Bella attività, abbiamo visto tanti pesci anche nemo! Eravamo in 7 persone e siamo stati seguiti, pranzo al sacco con del riso e pollo buono, pranzato in una bellissima spiaggia bianca" },
                { author: "Tuva", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 4, date: "2025-04-05", text: "Jätterolig aktivitet, dock hade vi otur med väder på våran tur. Vi såg massor med fiskar, korallrev och även en reaf shark!!!! Hade önskat mer snorkling om vi hade vädret med oss, guiden filmade och tog bilder under vattnet gratis också. Turen var på 5h, kortare än vi trott. Vi fick även se en annan sida av Poda Island, en gömd strand där vi bara var ca 3 båtar och den var så fin!! Jättenöjd" }
            ]
        },
