                { author: "Katie", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-04-14", text: "We had a wonderful time! We learnt so much and cooked a lot of great Thai food! Our host Annie was so fun and we enjoyed our time so much. Definitely recommend this was our favourite activity in Thailand!" },
                { author: "Katie", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-03-25", text: "Annie hosted a wonderful cooking class; fun and educational. The pick up was perfect and she adapted perfectly to my vegetarian diet. Eating together was fun too. Can fully recommend!" },
                { author: "Margaret", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-03-17", text: "Excellent activity, great food Very clean cooking area Good instructor" },
                { author: "Casey", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-03-02", text: "This was amazing. So well done, fun, and absolutely delicious! Very excited about the pdf of recipes provided to try and recreate the magic when I get home." },
                { author: "Louisa", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-02-26", text: "I’m so glad I booked this class! Our guide Gataii was amazing and really made it a class to remember! We made so much yummy food too! 10/10 recommend and would definitely come back if in Thailand again! Thanks again for a great night. The transport to and from the hotel was a great extra too!" },
                { author: "Vivek", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-01-21", text: "My wife and I had an incredible time at this Thai cooking class! From start to finish, the experience was smooth and perfectly organized. Our instructor was extremely professional and had a great way of making us feel confident and welcome in the kitchen. We absolutely loved the recipes we made—they were authentic and delicious. It was a truly memorable experience and one of the highlight of our trip." },
                { author: "Scott", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2025-11-18", text: "What a great activity! Had an amazing time food was great and a good laugh" },
                { author: "Laurent", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2025-11-27", text: "Interesting experience... there are always options to choose. Spring Rolls ir Papaya Salad Green or Yellow Curry or another one which name I have forgotten Thai soup or other soups Cashews plate, Pad Thai or a third option plus Mango Sticky Rice You see there is always an option for everyone... super easy to make, even for me who can't cook. My wife and I split the menues so we could taste a bit of everything. Really good... well organised and Poppy our chief cook was helpful and patient. Well done." }
