  'half-day-rock-climbing-introduction-at-railay-beach': {
            averageRating: 4.83,
            totalReviews: 172,
            guideRating: 4.8,
            valueRating: 4.7,
            reviews: [
                { author: "Krystian", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-02-15", text: "Amazing experience. Tried climbing for the first time, it was very hard but very satisfying. The instructor were helping a lot (giving instructions, tips, used pointer to show where to put your hand/leg so you can climb). Once again AMAZING!!!" },
                { author: "Josipa", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-01-25", text: "King climbers company is the king!!! Li is the best!!!" },
                { author: "Jana", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-01-18", text: "This was a great half day activity. The instructors very nice and helpful. I am glad we chose half day, we got to go up about 4 different routes which was enough for me as I’m not on the best shape. The guides do offer variety of routes so you can just ask for easier or harder as your abilities allow you. Overall great experience." },
                { author: "Tania", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-01-04", text: "Exciting day with a great team! Thanks for all the support and cheering everyone up, it was fun and relaxing, really enjoyed the day❤️" },
                { author: "Katarzyna", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-01-03", text: "Everything was perfectly organised, the intructors were very helpful and fun. I would love to repeat that 😀" },
                { author: "Taiqiong", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2025-11-24", text: "Even though it was rainy weather, we still managed climbed on the rock. The guide LI is patient and experienced, I was give up twice in a route, but he encouraged me to finished it!! It’s nice if you have top rope climbing experience already so you can belay with your partner there." },
                { author: "Marina", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2025-11-15", text: "It was great, they gave us all the equipment we needed and the staff was so nice and Professional they explained us everything. It was fun!" },
                { author: "Leonard", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2025-11-04", text: "It was an amazing day. The routes are as challenging as you like it, the people were amazing and the location beautiful." },
                { author: "Laura", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2025-11-03", text: "Met some really nice people. Guides were very friendly, gave good tips and were really helpful in general" },
                { author: "Elizabeth", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2025-10-20", text: "This was a great tour. There are routes for all skill levels and they break of the group. As a solo traveler I got my own guide and Tom was amazing. He’s so good at giving beta i was able to climb higher grades than I’ve ever managed before and the climbing spot is absolutely beautiful. If you get tired early which I did because I’m out of shape you can return your gear and explore the really cute area. I would definitely recommend this trip" },
                { author: "Fukushima", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2025-09-01", text: "Perfect activity and a lot of fun Nothing complains I recommend you to join this tour" },
                { author: "Winston", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2025-06-17", text: "Excellent! Guide was helpful to verbally guide you up, and trust me natural rockclimbing is very different from indoor climbing! Overall a great experience with instant transportation." }
            ]
        },
