  'phi-phi-and-4-islands-sunset-tour-plus-bioluminescent-plankton-krabi': {
            averageRating: 4.43,
            totalReviews: 66,
            guideRating: 4.58,
            valueRating: 4.13,
            reviews: [
                { author: "Carina", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2025-03-03", text: "It was great. Maya Bay is very busy and always is with these types of tours but it’s amazing. Worth it. You just need to find an empty spot for a quick photo. We also found fossils on Ko Poda in the water. Amazing views on all of the islands. If you want to combine both Phi Phi and Tub Islands, this is the best tour. And at night, we went snorkeling in the water to see bioluminescent plankton. They looked like sparkles. It’s a bit hard to sport them without water glasses but it’s possible. 100/100 recommend", photos: ["https://images.asiabylocals.com/asiabylocals/reviews/phi-phi-and-4-islands-sunset-tour-plus-bioluminescent-plankton-krabi/2063399/1600.webp", "https://images.asiabylocals.com/asiabylocals/reviews/phi-phi-and-4-islands-sunset-tour-plus-bioluminescent-plankton-krabi/2063400/1600.webp", "https://images.asiabylocals.com/asiabylocals/reviews/phi-phi-and-4-islands-sunset-tour-plus-bioluminescent-plankton-krabi/2063401/1600.webp"] },
                { author: "Alicia", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 4, date: "2025-11-30", text: "Beautiful water and scenery. Our English speaking tour guide was great, the staff manned the boat well. The boat was broken, we were scheduled at 11, didn’t get off till 12:00, was picked up at 10:30. Overbooked, cramped, very little time at locations. Didn’t go to all sites mentioned due to leaving late. Locations are packed, so much litter and the coral is destroyed. With many places to go it’s sad the same places are used by thousands a day and not respected. Pack in snd pack out! Over all worth the money…going to book private next time!", photos: ["https://images.asiabylocals.com/asiabylocals/reviews/phi-phi-and-4-islands-sunset-tour-plus-bioluminescent-plankton-krabi/4775854/1600.webp", "https://images.asiabylocals.com/asiabylocals/reviews/phi-phi-and-4-islands-sunset-tour-plus-bioluminescent-plankton-krabi/4775856/1600.webp", "https://images.asiabylocals.com/asiabylocals/reviews/phi-phi-and-4-islands-sunset-tour-plus-bioluminescent-plankton-krabi/4775857/1600.webp"] },
                { author: "Aneta", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2025-11-30", text: "if was great, the staff was amazing!", photos: ["https://images.asiabylocals.com/asiabylocals/reviews/phi-phi-and-4-islands-sunset-tour-plus-bioluminescent-plankton-krabi/4783628/1600.webp"] },
                { author: "Mark", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-03-13", text: "really great day, lots to see and the the snorkeling was amazing" },
                { author: "Sven", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2025-08-16", text: "It was a great day. The service was stunning- we could postpone the acticity with a 30 min notice. This was a great overall experience." },
                { author: "Maryna", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2025-03-28", text: "The sunset was beautiful in the sea. But our favorite was the luminescent plankton - it’s definitely life time experience. Separate thanks to our guide! He made the journey enjoyable and fun" },
                { author: "Dylan", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2024-08-17", text: "Awesome! The crew was great and the entire tour is worth every penny." },
                { author: "Harriet", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2024-07-23", text: "Very friendly host who was passionate and made the experience what it was. BBQ was great with vegetarian options. Unfortunately we didn't get to see the plankton as it wasn't fully dark when we came back but that's not really something they can control!" },
                { author: "Ernst", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2024-06-26", text: "It didn't start so well, for a couple of reasons: (1) I was under the false impression entrance fee to the parks were included, which it turned out was wrong, and I had to pay extra; (2) all the food they gave had egg in it, and I am allergic to egg. After I told the tour guide, he went and he got other food without egg, but yes, the money problem was according to me the fact that it wasn't clearly stated that entrance fees were excluded. The trip itself, even though in the rainy season, was brilliant. Maybe spending 20 or so more minutes at Maya bay would have been great. The best most likely" },
                { author: "Becky", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 4, date: "2026-08-18", text: "The trip was great and the the staff were brilliant on the boat. We went in August and the season was a little rough can't be helped. The islands ware good to visit especially Poda Island which was a highlight of ours. Food was good but could have been better. The bioluminescent plankton was a little bit disappointing but the staff were good at demonstrating it on the boat for those that did not want to go in the water in the dark." },
                { author: "Monica", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 1, date: "2026-01-08", text: "EPOPEA ALLE PHI PHI Il tour non vale il prezzo! abbiamo trascorso la maggior parte del tempo sulla barca per i vari trasferimenti. Diciamo che il vento non ha giocato a nostro favore e pertanto Maya Bay non è stata fatta, un paio di snorkeling di appena 30 min in cui abbiamo visto pochissimi pesci, la descrizione riporta cena al tramonto ma in realtà non è stato così. un semplice buffet sulla spiaggia e poi tramonto in barca. bioluminescenza...il nulla. e poi...troppe troppe barche ovunque. da non rifare assolutamente" },
                { author: "Traveller", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 1, date: "2026-01-03", text: "Trip wasn’t great. Paid a lot of money to be squished on an overcrowded boat. The boat didn’t have a bathroom and didn’t feel safe - it broke down in the middle of the sea in which some tourists asked to be taken back to shore for safety reasons. We didn’t get to leave the boat to experience the islands. We only actually got to step foot onto two beaches with the remainder of the time just looking at the islands from the boat. Would not recommend this tour if you actually want to experience the islands." }
            ]
        },
