  '4-island-day-tour-by-premium-speedboat-with-lunch-in-krabi': {
            averageRating: 4.45,
            totalReviews: 107,
            guideRating: 4.81,
            valueRating: 4.37,
            reviews: [
                { author: "Jamie", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2024-09-04", text: "Had Peachy as a guide and had an amazing time seeing all the islands, it made me wish I booked the longer tour! Peachy made it so fun!", photos: ["https://images.asiabylocals.com/asiabylocals/reviews/4-island-day-tour-by-premium-speedboat-with-lunch-in-krabi/1005214/1600.webp", "https://images.asiabylocals.com/asiabylocals/reviews/4-island-day-tour-by-premium-speedboat-with-lunch-in-krabi/1005215/1600.webp", "https://images.asiabylocals.com/asiabylocals/reviews/4-island-day-tour-by-premium-speedboat-with-lunch-in-krabi/1005216/1600.webp"] },
                { author: "Emma", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-01-05", text: "Ce tour était vraiment parfait et très bien organisé, le van est passé nous chercher à l heure et nous a déposé au port ou un petit déjeuné nous attendez , ensuite nous avons visité les 4 îles pour finir a Koh Poda avec une super box avec le repas , je me suis vraiment régalé, en arrivant au port , nous avons eu des glaces , tout l équipage etaiet super et les explications très bien faite . je fecommande ce tour", photos: ["https://images.asiabylocals.com/asiabylocals/reviews/4-island-day-tour-by-premium-speedboat-with-lunch-in-krabi/5120903/1600.webp", "https://images.asiabylocals.com/asiabylocals/reviews/4-island-day-tour-by-premium-speedboat-with-lunch-in-krabi/5120905/1600.webp", "https://images.asiabylocals.com/asiabylocals/reviews/4-island-day-tour-by-premium-speedboat-with-lunch-in-krabi/5120906/1600.webp"] },
                { author: "Marco", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2025-01-15", text: "Great trip from start to finished, you were looked after and the tour guide was always helpful. Lovely trip visiting the islands and we took the speedboat option which I think was better and more comfortable. Fully recommend the trip if you are looking to explore and enjoy some time swimming off the boat." },
                { author: "Filippa", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2025-01-08", text: "very nice tour, however we would rather if it lasted 1 hour more in total to enjoy more the snorkeling and the lunch break." },
                { author: "Cezary", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2025-01-01", text: "The trip was good, we had enough time to spend on the islands. We had snorkeling and we saw a fish from „Finding Nemo”. Lunch was tasty - both vegetarian and normal. Pickup from the hotel was smoothless." },
                { author: "Anita", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2024-12-22", text: "Pissy (or Pischy) was our tour guide who has a perfect vibe for this trip, funny, informative with good english and also helpful. The car was a bit late to pick us up, but the boat started in time so we had time to soend time on the amazing islands. If you want perfect photo shots, you should visit every islands you can. I really recommend them, we had amazing time. Thank you" },
                { author: "Ian", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2024-12-11", text: "Maya was a brilliant host and very helpful and informative. The trip itself was really good and not too long but would have liked a bit more time at Railay beach. unfortunately as we were staying in Krabi town we had to wait 40 minutes until one of the other tours came back to fill our taxi. Apart from that it was superb." },
                { author: "O", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2024-03-29", text: "Johny and his crew were very nice and helpful. You never felt rushed or pressured for time. The trip was very relaxing and well-organized. I can only recommend." },
                { author: "Carly", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2024-03-09", text: "Well organised and good communication. Highly recommend" },
                { author: "Ramona", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2024-01-02", text: "We liked the fact that it was not rushed and you were given ample time for each stop. The whole experience from booking to being dropped off back at hotel was stress free everything was organised brilliantly from start to finish. Communication from the minute I booked was excellent! Well done staff and crew - I normally find something to moan about but not this time. Thank you for a great day Lee & Ramona" },
                { author: "Traveller", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2025-04-09", text: "guia super simpático, almoço completo servido na praia, água e sumos à disposição. adoramos!" },
                { author: "Traveller", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 3, date: "2025-03-18", text: "Zu viele Touristen überall, zu wenig Zeit. Tourguide war sehr gut" }
            ]
        },
