                { author: "Indi-yana", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-04-22", text: "BEST DAY EVER. I had never driven a manual bike before but Ratt had a practice run with me and we were having a laugh buy the end! He made it really easy and fun! Best activity i have done! What an experiance for a first timer, its not easy but its not rocket science.. 1000% recommend.", photos: ["https://images.asiabylocals.com/asiabylocals/reviews/dirt-bike-ride-to-khlong-nam-sai-2-hrs-in-krabi/6336125/1600.webp", "https://images.asiabylocals.com/asiabylocals/reviews/dirt-bike-ride-to-khlong-nam-sai-2-hrs-in-krabi/6336133/1600.webp", "https://images.asiabylocals.com/asiabylocals/reviews/dirt-bike-ride-to-khlong-nam-sai-2-hrs-in-krabi/6336134/1600.webp"] }
