  'private-luxury-boat-to-hong-islands-sunrise-and-picnic': {
            averageRating: 4.33,
            totalReviews: 17,
            guideRating: 5.0,
            valueRating: 5.0,
            reviews: [
                { author: "Patrick", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-04-11", text: "Fantastic excursion!! Everything smooth and professional. Stayed ahead of the crowds. Great food. Amazing guide. HIGHLY Recommend!!!" },
                { author: "Phoebe", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-04-06", text: "the best day ever! 100% recommend this trip, from the beginning pickup right through to the end the guides were so helpful and fun and spoke great english! we had such a great time and our guide made it even better by suggesting the best things to do and setting up breakfast and lunch, definitely recommend doing this tour!" },
                { author: "Samantha", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2025-12-02", text: "Our Hong Islands Sunrise Tour was absolutely magical. The early wake-up was completely worth it for the breathtaking views and peaceful atmosphere. Our guide, Leen, was exceptional. He was friendly, patient, and incredibly attentive. He took beautiful photos for us, made sure we were always comfortable, and gave us space whenever we needed it. His warmth and professionalism truly elevated the entire experience. The Hong Islands are stunning, and this tour is one we'll never forget. Highly recommend, especially with Leen as your guide!" },
                { author: "Joanna", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2025-11-27", text: "We were treated so well. Leen was amazing as were the other two crew. Lovely food and drinks. Lots of local interesting information. A great start to our time in Thailand. Thank you." },
                { author: "Andrius", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2025-11-11", text: "Everything was perfect. Our guide Linn was very friendly and helpful 10 stars for him." },
                { author: "Nicola", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2023-11-10", text: "The private tour was perfect. It is an insider tip to go to Hong Island in the early morning, we had the whole beach for ourselves. The crew was very nice and friendly. They prepared everything perfectly, including a nice breakfast at the beach. They also provided delicious fruits and soft drinks the whole tour. All the places we visited were beautiful and with very few other tourists as we went in the morning. We were also very flexible and could decide what to do and how long. Very much recommended activity, would do it again surely." },
                { author: "Fabrice", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-02-21", text: "Super journée sur les îles avec Jess une guide dynamique, souriante et professionnelle. Nous avons adoré l'organisation et l'arrivée au petit matin sur une plage quasi déserte. Je recommande" },
                { author: "Traveller", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2025-12-17", text: "we had Lin as our Guide, excellent host and spoke good english. had a great conversation with him about our cultures and even found out he was learning some Spanish which so happens to be one of our native languages. without a doubt the service here was great, we did the sunrise and got it all to ourselves. Breakfast and fruit provided was amazing! very much recommend this tour and ask for Lin!" },
                { author: "Niklas", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2025-12-05", text: "Ein Muss wenn man die Möglichkeit dazu hat. Es hat alles super geklappt, vom Transfer, über Verpflegung und Kulisse. Der schönste Stopp war mit Abstand die Hong Insel. Nehmt euch dort alle Zeit. Der Strand ist früh am Morgen null überlaufen. Total weicher Sand, kaum Müll und eine Bar und Restaurant direkt am Strand. Zusammen mit der Aussichtsplattform ein perfektes Ausflugsziel für 2-3h. Unser Guide Peter hat uns geschichtlich ein paar Facts gegeben. Er hat sich super um uns gesorgt. Immer eine Decke dabei, genügend Getränke und immer ein Auge auf uns. Zudem hat er sich immer angeboten Bilder" },
                { author: "Ray", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 3, date: "2025-11-17", text: "The boat broke so the sunrise agenda where we got out to the isleans before everyone else didnt happen, but our guide Peter did his best to save the day. We really only wanted to snorkel, and we explained this to the guide in advance of the tour. unfortunalty, the tour company only provided child size snorkeling mask. we also didn't get to the good snorkeling spot till the end of the trip, so this was frustrating. I wouldn't recommend this tour. Save your money and go with a less expensive option." },
                { author: "Laura", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2025-05-11", text: "Ein unvergesslicher Trip – absolut empfehlenswert! Wir wurden früh am Morgen abgeholt und starteten den Tag mit einem traumhaften Frühstück während des Sonnenaufgangs – mitten auf dem Meer, auf einem wunderschönen Boot. Zwischendurch gab es frisches Obst, und die gesamte Crew war unglaublich herzlich. Unser Guide war sehr kompetent und hat den Tag perfekt begleitet. Trotz etwas Regen war es ein einmaliges Erlebnis. Die Inseln waren atemberaubend schön und nahezu menschenleer – wir hatten sie fast ganz für uns alleine. Es war wirklich wie im Paradies. Ich würde die Tour jederzeit wieder buchen" },
                { author: "Traveller", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2023-12-07", text: "Wollten Inseln, Strand, und Schnorcheln unbedingt mal ohne Tourimassen erleben. (Am Mayabeach fühlte ich mich wie eine Ameise im Kollektiv) Unser Guide Bee sprach sehr gut Englisch, war sehr hilfsbereit und aufmerksam. Der Kapitän und Bee‘s Kollege taten alles um die Fahrt für uns so angenehm wie erlebnisreich zu machen - vielen Dank nochmal! War ein Highlight für mich und meine Tochter. An Bord gibt es Snacks , Früchte, Softdrinks , am Strand Hong Lagoon Kaffee und Sandwich. Wir haben in der Morgendämmerung Haie gesehen, die menschenleere Lagune mit Sonnenaufgang und der 360 Grad Aussichtspun" }
            ]
        },
