                { author: "Charles", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2025-02-17", text: "Had the best time with Pin and Miry. Pin was very patient knowledgeable and made everything so easy. Can’t wait to go home and reproduce these food creations. Great activity.", photos: ["https://images.asiabylocals.com/asiabylocals/reviews/traditional-thai-cooking-class-in-krabi/1972821/1600.webp"] },
                { author: "James", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2025-11-25", text: "A great experience that me and my partner both thoroughly enjoyed. 10/10 would recommend!" },
                { author: "Amy", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2025-05-26", text: "We absolutely loved our cooking class!! We learnt all our fave dishes, the teacher and aide were both charming, authentic, thoughtful and super well organized. It honestly was a big highlight of our trip. Highly recommend." },
                { author: "Ashley", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2025-05-25", text: "if you're looking for a cooking class, I would highly recommend this one! We had such an incredible time at this cooking class! The experience was fun, engaging, and delicious from start to finish. The guide was fantastic—super friendly, knowledgeable, and made sure we understood every step along the way. each participant chooses 6 dishes each to cook, so between the two of us, we ended up making 12 different dishes. Cooking over individual gas-fired woks made it feel really authentic, and the setup was very well organized. Every single dish we made was delicious. The portions were generous, a" },
                { author: "Mitch", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2025-03-31", text: "Very informative about Thai ingredients and cooking" },
                { author: "Erika", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2025-01-01", text: "Such a fun day with a great instructor! Food was delicious and I can’t wait to try these dishes at home." },
                { author: "Kristina", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2024-11-23", text: "Absolutely amazing cooking workshop and worth the money! Everything was delicious and the teacher was so kind! We cooked in total 6 different dishes. Nice that you can pick your own dishes. Glad that we chose this cooking workshop out of many options provided in Ao Nang." },
                { author: "Savannah", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2024-08-04", text: "Brilliant activity - learn how to make 6 Thai dishes and you even take home the cookbook with additional recipes inside. The ingredients are fresh and flavoursome. The amount of food you cook and eat in the time is more than worth the money." },
                { author: "Keisha", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2024-04-17", text: "This experience was great. There was a lovely group of us, not too many people. The two ladies that helped us cook were great. One of them even collected us and dropped us off despite her busy schedule. A cooking class is a must if you like Thai food." },
                { author: "Harriette", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2024-05-13", text: "We had an amazing time, our teacher was very friendly and helpful and the dishes were delicious we were very full!" }
