  'phi-phi-islands-shark-snorkeling-phuket': {
            averageRating: 5.0,
            totalReviews: 6,
            guideRating: 5.0,
            valueRating: 5.0,
            reviews: [
                { author: "Bailey", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-09-12", text: "MUST BOOK WITH THIS TOUR GUIDE This is a new business so there aren’t many reviews but I guarantee this is the tour to book if you want the best snorkelling experience. NewYear was nothing but accomodating, helping us sort our transport to and from Krabi/Phi Phi. NewYear helped us find the hidden gems and was very knowledgeable about marine life and the island. We saw plenty of sharks, clownfish, and everything else in between. NewYear is also an excellent photographer and videographer and she took shots and videos of us all day as well as underwater filming which she sends to you. Fruit, wate" },
                { author: "Danny", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-07-28", text: "NewYear was a great guide. She helped us with organising Transfer from Krabi to Phi Phi. During the tour she explained about marine life & the islands. She brought us to the best spots for snorkeling where we saw sharks, fish, starfish and many other marine animal. It was a fantastic day 🙏🏻 We also had a videographer included in the package, so that we can keep these memories forever! Thank you a lot! We‘d recommend this tour to anybody!" },
                { author: "Eleatha", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-04-29", text: "The guide was absolutely beautiful. I organised trip without knowing how far we had to go to be at the meeting point. she quickly organised transportation for us at a reduced cost. During snorkelling she (and the amazing boat captain) took us to the most beautiful spots and most were quite peaceful without the normal overwhelming crowds you expect for these things. she was attentive and really cares for the marine life which is a huge plus for me. I would 100% do this again when coming back. Thank you so much!" },
                { author: "Elisabeth", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-08-19", text: "La actividad de snorkel ha sido genial, recomendable al 100%. Ves tiburones de punta negra , baby shark y mucha variedad de especies de peces. Estás bastante tiempo en el mar, los sitios son preciosos y la guía New Year es muy amable." },
                { author: "sabina", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-08-17", text: "Fue una experiencia increíble, la monitora New Year estuvo en todo momento vigilante de que viéramos el mayor número de pequeños tiburones, anémonas y peces exóticos. Además visitamos la isla de los monos y varios enclaves de agua increíble. 4 horas fabilosss" },
                { author: "Traveller", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-08-15", text: "Het was prachtig de instructeur was hartstikke gezellig ze legde alles goed uit en maakten van iedereen mooie foto’s en filmpjes onder water een echte aanrader!!" }
            ]
        },
  'koh-phi-phi-early-morning-maya-bay-bamboo-speedboat-tour-phuket': {
            averageRating: 4.37,
            totalReviews: 10,
            guideRating: 4.37,
            valueRating: 4.37,
            reviews: [
                { author: "Laura", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-04-01", text: "Journée parfaite. Les guides ont été très gentils par contre prévoir d'emmener son gilet de sauvetage pour se baigner sur l'ile car sinon c'est interdit il aurait été bon que les guides le précise." },
                { author: "Maria", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 3, date: "2026-02-27", text: "Buona organizzazione, il tempo disponibile presso le isole poteva essere maggiore, rispetto ad altri tour fatti cibo scarso e frugale. Rientro alle 14:30. Bravo il capitano per lo snorkeling" },
                { author: "Michel", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 4, date: "2026-02-23", text: "Belle excursion Nous avons vraiment les premiers à Maya Bay le matin. Pas très achalandé même à notre départ (avons été présent de 7h à 8h) Ensuite arrêt de plongée en apnée. Très agréable Suivi du lagon où il y avait malheureusement beaucoup trop de monde pour peu d’espace. La plage de l’île bambou est exceptionnelle. Nous avions aucunement l’impression d’être empilés. La plage est très grande. Plage des singes : ok Petit bémol il y avait beaucoup de gens sur le bateau. Mais somme toute. Ce fut une très belle excursion" },
                { author: "Kevin", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 4, date: "2026-02-18", text: "Ich empfehle dringend die Maya Bay so früh morgens wie möglich anzuschauen. Wir waren von ca. 7-8 Uhr dort und als wir gingen, bildete sich schon eine Schlange auf dem Weg zum Strand. Meine Highlights waren die Pileh-Lagoon und Bamboo-Island (nur beim Ganztages-Trip). Der Guide war sehr streng und unfreundlich, wurde gegen Ende der Tour etwas lockerer. Vielleicht lag es daran, dass beim Maya Bay ein reibungsloser Ablauf sehr wichtig scheint, da hier massenweise Touristen durchgeschleust werden. Auf Bamboo-Island haben wir noch ein kleines Mittagessen bekommen." },
                { author: "Eva", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-01-04", text: "Es war alles so schön und wir hatten auch echt immer genügend Zeit & der Guide war super ;) Lohnt sich definitiv" },
                { author: "Traveller", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 4, date: "2025-12-02", text: "Organized. Decent lunch. Early morning tour still had a lot of tourists." }
            ]
        },
