                { author: "Jette", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-09-08", text: "We had such a great time! The Islands are beautiful and totally worth a visit! Our Guide Peter was absolutely amazing and handled everything well for us!! Same for the boat crew, we had great time on board, they gave us Water and Orange Juice and even served fruits on the way back ^^ Can absolutely recommend this tour!!" }
