            reviews: [
                { author: "Adari", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-09-09", text: "Tony and his crew gave us the most amazing experience, from pickup , explaining the adventures, hosting lunch and refreshments, assisting us with photos and prioritising safety and maintaining hygiene all the way to drop off it was a magical experience worth every penny I highly recommend everyone to try it.", photos: ["https://images.asiabylocals.com/asiabylocals/reviews/james-bond-island-by-big-boat-with-sea-cave-canoeing/8620111/1600.webp", "https://images.asiabylocals.com/asiabylocals/reviews/james-bond-island-by-big-boat-with-sea-cave-canoeing/8620113/1600.webp", "https://images.asiabylocals.com/asiabylocals/reviews/james-bond-island-by-big-boat-with-sea-cave-canoeing/8620114/1600.webp"] },
                { author: "Marriam", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-08-22", text: "Honestly the best excursion we had whilst at Thailand. Dino and the rest of staff couldn’t be more hospitable. So much fun and the food was amazing . The fact they had snacks and tea coffee/cold drinks as well was just so useful as it gets hot and with it being half a day you do get peckish. Dino and his staff checked on all the guests and the atmosphere on the boat was so lovely . Now to get onto the islands just wow!!! The views we saw were just breathtaking. This was a fab ending to our trip .", photos: ["https://images.asiabylocals.com/asiabylocals/reviews/james-bond-island-by-big-boat-with-sea-cave-canoeing/8293899/1600.webp", "https://images.asiabylocals.com/asiabylocals/reviews/james-bond-island-by-big-boat-with-sea-cave-canoeing/8293904/1600.webp", "https://images.asiabylocals.com/asiabylocals/reviews/james-bond-island-by-big-boat-with-sea-cave-canoeing/8293907/1600.webp"] },
                { author: "Ronda", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-09-17", text: "Wonderful trip, Tommy was a great guide. He was fun, friendly and knowledgeable. Clean boat and the food was yummy. Recommend." },
                { author: "Colin", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-09-16", text: "Tony and the crew were excellent - an amazing trip with life long memories. Do not miss this experience. This is well worth doing. Thank you to Tony, the crew and my Kayak guide Mohammed for showing us things we would have normally missed. Food was really great and games on board really enjoyable." },
                { author: "Carla", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-09-16", text: "The most amazing experience. Toni was amazing, so helpful and kind .The food was lovely and had a game of bingo at end which made time go over a little bit quicker !! The canoeing through the caves is just breath taking , such an experience! Defo recommend" },
                { author: "Sam", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-09-13", text: "Pick up was easy and fast! The caves were awesome (even with the higher tide in September) and all the spots were amazing. Food was very good. Our kayak guide was super cool and took lots of pictures for us" },
                { author: "Tammy", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-09-04", text: "Tommy was very nice And an excellent photographer Everything amazing" },
                { author: "Dara", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-08-07", text: "Tony and his team where fab. It was a great day, our canoe guide T was very knowledgeable and really friendly. The food was delicious and a massive spread was put out by the ladies. Would highly recommend as great day out. The caves where amazing" },
                { author: "Nicole", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-08-04", text: "So much fun on this trip. I was solo and the guides, especially Tommy and Adam, did such a good job taking care of me and making sure I got all the pictures I wanted. Also, this boat was so much better than the one to phi phi, i didn’t even need to take dramamine. Lunch was amazing. Highly recommend!!!" },
                { author: "Ertan", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-07-30", text: "Tony was very nice and fun, ı was so happy to with them. Thanks guys." },
                { author: "tal", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-07-27", text: "the whole trip was amazing, Tony and the crew made everything to make us happy and amused, we enjoyed it so much, the children were thrilled" },
                { author: "Sara", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-07-02", text: "Tony and the crew were amazing! Exceeded expectations! We’ve done many boat cruises but this was the best food on a boat I’ve ever had. What a cool experience!" }
            ]
