            reviews: [
                { author: "Ivars", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-05-07", text: "I had an unforgettable day at the Similan Islands with Fantastic Similan on Boat 9. Our tour guide was outstanding — very professional, kind, and always making sure everyone was safe and enjoying the trip. The Boat 9 team worked together perfectly, from the crew to the snorkeling staff. I was excited from the beginning until the end. The islands were even more beautiful than I expected. Truly a fantastic experience!", photos: ["https://images.asiabylocals.com/asiabylocals/reviews/similan-full-day-trip-by-speedboat/6563916/1600.webp", "https://images.asiabylocals.com/asiabylocals/reviews/similan-full-day-trip-by-speedboat/6563917/1600.webp", "https://images.asiabylocals.com/asiabylocals/reviews/similan-full-day-trip-by-speedboat/6563918/1600.webp"] },
                { author: "Lilou", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-04-22", text: "It was amazing !!! our guide Leo and Siri were amazing !!!! Leo spoke really good French which was amazing. You get an amazing lunch and a good time with everyone :) The similan island is really worth it honestly i’ve never seen a clearer water !!!! Also not too crowded which was really nice", photos: ["https://images.asiabylocals.com/asiabylocals/reviews/similan-full-day-trip-by-speedboat/6338178/1600.webp", "https://images.asiabylocals.com/asiabylocals/reviews/similan-full-day-trip-by-speedboat/6338179/1600.webp", "https://images.asiabylocals.com/asiabylocals/reviews/similan-full-day-trip-by-speedboat/6338180/1600.webp"] },
                { author: "Jesper", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-03-22", text: "Mass turisme and lots of people - but we knew that. So well organised, fantastic staff. Great snorkling with turtles.", photos: ["https://images.asiabylocals.com/asiabylocals/reviews/similan-full-day-trip-by-speedboat/5897483/1600.webp"] },
                { author: "Debbie", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-04-25", text: "Most amazing excursion, guides where brilliant and sooo funny. Was one of the best excursions we had been on. Thankyou for making our day one of the best." },
                { author: "Ankit", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-04-03", text: "The crew members were absolutely amazing! They went above and beyond to make us comfortable and helped us enjoy our trip. What really stood out was their attentiveness - they kept checking in on us, offering drinks and food, and even offered to take pictures for us! 😊\" Nina, Siri, and two other girls I dont remember name but were taking very good care of all guests." },
                { author: "Freya", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-03-30", text: "We were taken care of at every step, the guides are AMAZING, so so much fun. Everything was run and communicated perfectly and we felt the time in each place was spot on. Everything was included that we could have needed and we were fed loads too! Cannot recommend highly enough." },
                { author: "Elizabeth", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-02-26", text: "The driver was nice and a smooth ride to and from our hotel. We like the beach bag that was supplied (towels, snorkel etc.). Ample food, drinks and snacks throughout the day. Good amount of time in each spot, didn't feel rushed. Nancy and the crew on the boat were just fabulous! I would highly recommend. Good value for money." },
                { author: "cerys", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-02-18", text: "Wow! What an experience this tour was amazing so magical and well organised! I would highly recommend xx" },
                { author: "Angelika", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-02-10", text: "Had an amazing day exploring the Similan Islands! The entire team at Fantastic Similan Travel was enthusiastic and professional. Our guide was hilarious and kept us entertained while ensuring everyone felt safe and comfortable. The little touches, like the beach bag with a towel and mat, made the day so much easier. Highly recommend if you want a well-organized trip." },
                { author: "Klomer", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-03-17", text: "Everything was excellent, the tour guide, the tour it self was amazing" },
                { author: "Karin", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-03-16", text: "The trip was amazing, the beaches were beautiful, and the organization of the tour was excellent. Nancy was a great guide. We have nothing to complain about—everything was perfect. The journey takes quite a long time, but it’s definitely worth it." },
                { author: "Darry", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-02-08", text: "Everything was very good organized. Guides were awesome. The views are wow. We even saw a turtle while swimming. Just have in mind Similan islands are full or crowds, just like the it. Is in Phi Phi." }
            ]
