  'james-bond-island-sea-canoeing-by-speedboat-2-meals': {
            averageRating: 4.81,
            totalReviews: 950,
            guideRating: 4.89,
            valueRating: 4.73,
            reviews: [
                { author: "Elton", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-09-15", text: "Ocean Seals - Selina Team was exception. Right from the pickup to drop off. The experience was surreal. All planned activities had ample of time to experience and explore. Highly recommend. A must do in Phuket. Cheers.", photos: ["https://images.asiabylocals.com/asiabylocals/reviews/james-bond-island-sea-canoeing-by-speedboat-2-meals/8734452/1600.webp"] },
                { author: "Hakan", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-09-06", text: "Trip was good and our guide Sin was very informative and helpful. I strongly recommend that trip. There should be a waiting limit for hotel guests to pickup from their hotel. If the service waits too long for one guest everyone before and after that late one have to wait too and it’s an annoying situation just before the trip. A 5-10 minute waiting limit is more than enough. Sea canoeing on locals boats is included in this trip. You don’t have to pay anything but reality is different than that. Be ready to pay at least 50baht and more. Otherwise you can make your local boat owner angry. Our al", photos: ["https://images.asiabylocals.com/asiabylocals/reviews/james-bond-island-sea-canoeing-by-speedboat-2-meals/8556414/1600.webp", "https://images.asiabylocals.com/asiabylocals/reviews/james-bond-island-sea-canoeing-by-speedboat-2-meals/8556415/1600.webp", "https://images.asiabylocals.com/asiabylocals/reviews/james-bond-island-sea-canoeing-by-speedboat-2-meals/8556416/1600.webp"] },
                { author: "Chris", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-09-04", text: "What an experience! Thank you to the team from our boat driver to deck hands and our tour guide 10/10 Everything went smoothly and on time and I was kept informed through out the day. The food at the floating village was amazing!!! Once again thank you!!!!", photos: ["https://images.asiabylocals.com/asiabylocals/reviews/james-bond-island-sea-canoeing-by-speedboat-2-meals/8527021/1600.webp", "https://images.asiabylocals.com/asiabylocals/reviews/james-bond-island-sea-canoeing-by-speedboat-2-meals/8527022/1600.webp"] },
                { author: "Karen", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-09-02", text: "Such an amazing day! Paced well, not too busy, our guide was great. Only feedback would be the last island was a bit of a money trap." },
                { author: "Alina", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-09-01", text: "Nice and welcoming people. The experience, overall, was incredibile." },
                { author: "Karam", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-08-16", text: "WOWW IT WAS AMAZING TRULY AND REALLY ADVENTURES I CANNOT BELIEVE THAT I LITERALLY LIKED THE CANNOINING AND MUSLIM VILLAGE MORE THAN JAMES BOND I SWEAR TO GOD THE FOOD IN THE MUSLIM VILLAGE WAS GREAT AND EVEYRTHING WAS AMAZING EVEN THE GUIDES AND CREW WAS NICE AND HELPFUL AND VERY CARING" },
                { author: "ANIL", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-07-31", text: "It was with one word amazing, our guide Lilly was great explained everything clearly. Must try boat tour !" },
                { author: "Jannis", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-07-10", text: "Was an amazing day and i can highly recommondent this activity. U get all U need, like food and drinks. Captain Jack Sparrow and his crew were so nice and u can ask them all u want. Just book it!!" },
                { author: "colin", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-06-04", text: "Great trip, apart from the rain showers. Sindy was a great guide. Would defo recommend this tour if your in Phuket." },
                { author: "Sarah", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-08-31", text: "Dreammy was the best tour guide! The boat crew + captain were amazing. 1. Hotel pickup, then we headed over to the port breakfast and itinerary rundown. We then headed to the islands. the floating Muslim village was memorable! So was the beach club where you got to do ATV’s and jet skis (extra cost)! The view was just impeccable! As awesome as James Bond island was , it wasn’t even the best. The cave exploration was amazing there were crabs, tadpoles, walking fish, monkeys… we did canoeing on another island. I wish I could post pics every body of water was 10/10. The food was good, the best bu" },
                { author: "Oscar", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-08-06", text: "Amazing crew and wonderful day out. I could have done it again! The team was quite entertaining and gave us quite a few tips. Most of the sites were amazing, worth doing as it does more than just “James Bond Island” as this island is probably the most touristy but it is quite small and quite frankly crowded. I found there was something to do in all places and had time to swim in a paradise island, get a cocktail and relax, shop and get breathtaking photos Overall a great activity worth the money. Thank you Lily!" },
                { author: "Roger", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-06-24", text: "It was an awesome, action-packed day, and the food was amazing." }
            ]
        },
