                { author: "Janya", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-09-06", text: "amazing activity, we had wun as our guide who looked after us so much. if you have dietary requirements let them know before but otherwise the tour was so good even though it rained at the end of it. we also had a small group which was great too." },
                { author: "Shravani", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-08-25", text: "We had fun, it wasn’t crowded, Amy is beautiful inside out and helped everyone on the cruise" },
                { author: "Sachin", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-08-11", text: "We had an amazing experience aboard the Amari catamaran in Phuket. Our trip began with a visit to Coral Beach, followed by enjoyable snorkelling and a delicious dinner on catamaran. The boat also had fun water slide a direct slide into the sea, which made the experience even more exciting. The sunset later in the evening was absolutely magical. We were treated to champagne and fresh fruits, which added a special touch to the journey. A very special thanks to **Wun**, who was extremely friendly, helpful, and welcoming that enhanced the overall experience. This is definitely an experience everyo" },
                { author: "Meijing", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-08-09", text: "Eva and Mina is so good guide also all the other stuff. Enjoy this trip so much." },
                { author: "Toni", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-07-25", text: "Amazing trip! Everything was well organized, the staff was very friendly, and the experience was unforgettable. Great value for money, and I would definitely recommend it to anyone visiting Phuket. Thank you!" },
                { author: "Simon", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-07-22", text: "Great cateraman Helpful guide and crew Stopped at Coral island and got off for an hour and a half for a drink and snorkell Plenty of fish to see Stopped again for swim and food which was good. Finished trip with sunset and sparkling wine" },
                { author: "Jeff", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-07-22", text: "Excellent day out, very nice day that was well organised and enjoyed by whole family." },
                { author: "S.", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-07-20", text: "The tour was very nice and organised. We had a lot of time in the water and the food was good." },
                { author: "Paula", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-07-20", text: "The activity was nice, nice environment andOur guide was so amazing and very caring" }
