                { author: "Charles", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2025-05-18", text: "Aum was very attentive, knowledgeable, and pointed out all the interesting marine animals, especially nudibranchs, eels, and sharks, etc. The ship Mandarin Queen was spacious and well equipped, and the deck hands were helpful. The meals and snacks were also delicious. The itinerary was well planned, and I would come back again. Highly recommended.", photos: ["https://images.asiabylocals.com/asiabylocals/reviews/3-dive-koh-phi-phi-shark-point-scuba-diving-day-trip/2621179/1600.webp", "https://images.asiabylocals.com/asiabylocals/reviews/3-dive-koh-phi-phi-shark-point-scuba-diving-day-trip/2621180/1600.webp", "https://images.asiabylocals.com/asiabylocals/reviews/3-dive-koh-phi-phi-shark-point-scuba-diving-day-trip/2621181/1600.webp"] },
                { author: "Sara", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-05-11", text: "It was an awesome diving day trip. Everything was really well-organized and the dive sites chosen were great. The boat was comfortable and clean, and although I can be prone to seasickness at times, I felt good the whole trip (it‘s a relatively stable large ship with nice free food and drinks). Nigel, my diving guide, was great to talk to and made the trip even more fun. Could not recommend this experience more, especially if Nigel is your dive guide." },
                { author: "eendira", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2025-10-24", text: "Nigel’s care, patience, and wise advice made me feel completely at ease! Thank you so much for everything." },
                { author: "Michal", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2024-09-15", text: "We enjoyed very much diving with Nigel from Aum Scuba. He is a real professional who gave us everything we needed and took care on us" }
