                { author: "Traveller", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 4, date: "2026-08-09", text: "De plekken die je bezoekt zijn mooi maar inmiddels véél te druk. Overal liggen enorm veel boten en dat er zelfs een McDonalds, Burger King en Taco Bell op Phi Phi zitten, naast talloze andere restaurantjes en winkels maakte voor ons dat we dit niet zullen aanbevelen aan anderen. De gids was geweldig en zorgde ervoor dat er, ondanks de flinke golven en een paar zeezieke medereizigers, een gezellige sfeerwaan boord was." },
                { author: "Paethongtarn", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-06-02", text: "I recently joined a Phi Phi Island tour with this company,and it was an absolutely unforgettable experience.From start to finish The tour guide was friendly,and made the trip enjoyable with helpful information about each location. Overall,I highly recommend this tour company." },
                { author: "Autapol", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-06-01", text: "This was an amazing program I ever seen. The crew is very helpful, Tour guide is so funny and so kind. The program is incredible they take me to Pileh Lagoon for swim, Maya Bay the famous place from The Beach Movie then staff is help me to take a photo. Food is delicious. This company is highly recommended for everyone.❤️" },
                { author: "Waridtha", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-05-26", text: "Amazing Phi Phi Island trip.🩵🌊 The whole experience was excellent from start to finish. The staff were friendly and professional, the guide was caring and fun, and the service throughout the trip was outstanding. The boat was beautiful, clean, and very comfortable. The food was also surprisingly delicious with plenty of snacks and drinks provided during the tour. Every was well organized and we truly enjoyed every stop around Phi Phi Islands. highly recommended for anyone looking for a premium island tour in Phuket.🏝️🏝️" }
