                { author: "Olivia", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-06-26", text: "Hudson and Aeri are the BEST TOUR GUIDES. 10/10 🙌🏻🤍🙌🏻🤍" },
                { author: "Kira", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-05-06", text: "Hudson was brilliant I loved my experience with him, my birthday was so special with him there" },
                { author: "Johanna", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-05-06", text: "My absolute favorite thing about this pub crawl was the host. She is so friendly and bubbly and you can just tell she is a fun time and genuine person. We had fun running around town w her. The clubs are great, we especially loved the Hip Hop club called Sugar. Absolutely amazing vibes and music. At the end of the night and even the next morning, the host checked on us to see if we had made it back to our hotel safely. I will miss hanging w her!" },
                { author: "Robert", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-04-25", text: "Unforgettable Night with Nika on Bangla Road! Had an absolutely fantastic bar hopping tour in Patong! If you want to experience the best nightlife on Bangla Road, this is it. Nika was an energetic and professional guide, ensuring smooth entry to clubs, great vibes, and a safe environment. Highly recommended for an unforgettable night!" },
                { author: "Diana", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-04-23", text: "Nights like Saturday, April 18th, 2026 is why some people call Phuket the Asian Las Vegas. The after-dark energy of Bangla Road took a daring turn with a GoGo bar and club crawl that blurred the lines between nightlife and pure spectacle. Led by the beautiful Nika, this experience was both personal and wildly immersive. Armed with endless free shots and a magnetic presence, she guided us through a provocative circuit including Madame Wong, Suzy Wong, The Devil’s Playground, H.O Club Phuket, BOA Club Phuket, Sugar Club Phuket, and an unexpectedly entertaining male strip club that added a playfu" },
                { author: "Windie", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-04-20", text: "I had a wonderful time from start to finish. The schedule was perfectly organized, and from the very beginning, each activity kept us on our toes with excitement. Every item on the itinerary flowed seamlessly into the next, creating a sense of anticipation and engagement throughout the entire event. It was a truly memorable experience that I would gladly recommend to anyone looking for a well-planned and enjoyable day." },
                { author: "Yanessa", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-04-19", text: "The tour was so great. She took us to the best places she made sure everyone in the group was OK and she even made sure everyone got home OK afterwards very nice and sweet person. The place was packed and the place was full of people having fun and it was just a good time." },
                { author: "Leonhard", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-04-18", text: "It was a really good I enjoyed it very much. Nika is a very good guide who looked after us the whole time. I would highly recommend it." }
