  'phuket-3-khai-islands-hop-and-snorkel-tour-half-full-day-by-local-operator': {
            averageRating: 4.16,
            totalReviews: 515,
            guideRating: 4.64,
            valueRating: 4.18,
            reviews: [
                { author: "Dan", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2025-12-31", text: "From start to finish it was faultless. Transport arrived on time, the welcome greeting and free snack and drinks were a nice touch. Our host Honey and her staff were easily approachable. Very informative. I highly recommend the full day as the first two stops are a little short but ok. When on the third island only a handful of people had booked and it felt like we had the whole island to ourselves. We were also given a nice lunch. Deckchairs are reasonably priced, but if you buy, you get them for free. Highly recommended", photos: ["https://images.asiabylocals.com/asiabylocals/reviews/phuket-3-khai-islands-hop-and-snorkel-tour-half-full-day-by-local-operator/5056779/1600.webp", "https://images.asiabylocals.com/asiabylocals/reviews/phuket-3-khai-islands-hop-and-snorkel-tour-half-full-day-by-local-operator/5056781/1600.webp", "https://images.asiabylocals.com/asiabylocals/reviews/phuket-3-khai-islands-hop-and-snorkel-tour-half-full-day-by-local-operator/5056788/1600.webp"] },
                { author: "Margaret", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2025-12-17", text: "Jo and his team were brilliant! The full day option is highly recommended as there's plenty of time to snorkel after a very enjoyable lunch Khai Nai.", photos: ["https://images.asiabylocals.com/asiabylocals/reviews/phuket-3-khai-islands-hop-and-snorkel-tour-half-full-day-by-local-operator/4926497/1600.webp", "https://images.asiabylocals.com/asiabylocals/reviews/phuket-3-khai-islands-hop-and-snorkel-tour-half-full-day-by-local-operator/4926498/1600.webp", "https://images.asiabylocals.com/asiabylocals/reviews/phuket-3-khai-islands-hop-and-snorkel-tour-half-full-day-by-local-operator/4926499/1600.webp"] },
                { author: "Diego", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2025-11-11", text: "It was really good, however, tour started late but it was due to tourists who got there late, don’t be one of those!" },
                { author: "Dina", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2025-10-10", text: "Lots of fun. I only wish we had a little bit more time at each of the 2 islands" },
                { author: "Jessica", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2025-09-06", text: "We absolutely loved it! Overall 10/10 experience We went as a group of 4 people for the full day experience and we can all agree it was one of if not the best experience we’ve had here in phuket, the guides: Jayna,Peanut and Celine especially were absolutely amazing! Even those who I didn’t name as well, they are patient, attentive and kind. The package included drinks, and photos are taken of you and are available to purchase at the end of the tour in frames , and of course some lovely food when you come back. Bring baht in cash cuz the activity guides in the islands will charge you a card fe" },
                { author: "KH", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2025-08-08", text: "our tour guide 海盜 is pretty nice, he could speak Cantonese fluently, which enhances our communication and experience in this tour. When we got some troubles, he helped us to solve the problems effectively. He is very trustworthy, which makes our experiences interesting and enjoyable." },
                { author: "Dennis", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2025-07-08", text: "Exceeds our expectations. A great experiences for the whole family. The organization was great. The Guide was nice. We were really excited. Definitely worth it. Great Value for that price." },
                { author: "Claire", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2025-04-30", text: "Great half day trip! Suited what we wanted to do perfectly for a short time in Phuket. Picked up & dropped off to hotel, drinks and fruit provided on boat. Whole experience was super easy and the islands are stunning! Thanks for a great morning 😊" },
                { author: "Maria", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2024-12-31", text: "Patty was an amazing guide and the entire experience was great value for money!" },
                { author: "Karolina", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2024-12-27", text: "Excellent tour, especially if you don’t want a full day activity. Works very well for families with kids as it’s a quick ride from one island to the next. I usually have motion sickness on boats but the ride was super easy and I felt very well. The guides are friendly and the comms is excellent; great value for money" },
                { author: "Balan", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2024-12-14", text: "Absolutely awesome ! Got picked up from hostel with a van till the boat . They had expected us with Tuna sandwiches , coffee, water and sweets. Excellent guidance , after each island we had cold drinks on board waiting for us. After the last island on the way back we received fresh fruits . When we arrived in port they had expected us with That noodles and they drove us back to our place . The islands are small and full of tourists but very beautiful and with clean waters , they provided snorkeling equipment and a lot of things to see in to the sea. Prices of food and drinks on the islands are" },
                { author: "Allyson", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2024-12-10", text: "This was an amazing tour, especially for $25! I expected very little and was so impressed! First we went to cat island, and our guides had food to feed the cats if we wished. It also had the most coral I have ever seen! And some good walk-in snorkeling as well. The second island was a jump-off-the-boat spot and it was so good! The guides fed the fish, which didn’t happen on any of my other tours, and made for an incredible experience. Even before the feeding, that spot was the best spot I experienced (having also done a full day snorkel tour and self snorkeling at other spots). The last island" }
            ]
        },
