                { author: "Skye", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-07-15", text: "Amazing activity! The boat staff were so so friendly and made sure that me and my partner saw everything and had many photos. Snorkelling equipment is provided as well as lunch, snacks and drinks. The team take photos of you throughout the trip and at the end they are available to buy as big prints which was a lovely surprise. Overall an amazing experience!", photos: ["https://images.asiabylocals.com/asiabylocals/reviews/phi-phi-islands-maya-bay-and-khai-islands-tour/7573808/1600.webp", "https://images.asiabylocals.com/asiabylocals/reviews/phi-phi-islands-maya-bay-and-khai-islands-tour/7573809/1600.webp", "https://images.asiabylocals.com/asiabylocals/reviews/phi-phi-islands-maya-bay-and-khai-islands-tour/7573810/1600.webp"] },
                { author: "Traveller", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 3, date: "2026-07-16", text: "The guide was really attentive and helpful, however we felt there were too many people on the speedboat for it to be comfortable. Due to high sides of the boat, we couldn't see where we were going which made sea sickness much worse. We came back on the ferry and missed the Khai Islands stop because of this. Maya Bay is also extremely crowded and we felt 'herded' around. I'm glad we've seen it but would not necessarily recommend this trip." },
                { author: "Traveller", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-07-13", text: "de boot was te vol en zee was onstuimig mensen die overgaven en dan krijg ik zelf kotsnuiging" },
                { author: "Traveller", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-07-09", text: "Sehr sehr gut!! Die Guides extrem liebenswert und aufmerksam. Ich war alleine unterwegs und von mir wurden viele schöne Fotos gemacht. Wenn man die Inseln sehen möchte, ist diese Reise auf jedenfall eine Erfahrung wert" }
