                { author: "Darrell", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-03-29", text: "We had so much fun. We purchased the 2 hour riding time. Our guide was so nice and patient. Definitely recommend and would do this again!" },
                { author: "Joshua", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-05-29", text: "Activity was great ! We done the 2 hour quad biking + budha Me and Girlfriend enjoyed it and the man taking us around tour was lovely didnt hesitate to take photos of us and even took a video of us on them at the end driving about and was making sure we had enough , got us water constantly when it was needed and was just a lovely man made the experience even better. Make sure bring older shoes i brought newer ones and got covered in muck and dirt 🤣" },
                { author: "Renee", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-05-12", text: "The trip was great! Starting with pickup from resort! The ATV was amazing and guides make sure you are safe. Bikes in good working condition. They stop and take photos of you and videos whilst riding. The big Buddha is great too, lots of monkeys. You can rent a sarong at big Buddha to cover up if needed. Our family of 6 had a really good time!" },
                { author: "Steph", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-04-11", text: "we chose the 2 hour stv and big buddha trip...what value for money we had. our guide was great and we also got to take photos from the viewpoint and a go on the giant swing (not for the faint heartedly!). after the trip to Buddha, we went back to the atv's and had even more time on them. Excellent afternoon out, very chuffed." },
                { author: "Charlaine", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-03-24", text: "Had a great time. The Buddha was amazing ❤️ The guide we had was so friendly. Highly recommend" }
