  'james-bond-island-snorkeling-boat-tour': {
            averageRating: 4.49,
            totalReviews: 1805,
            guideRating: 4.74,
            valueRating: 4.31,
            reviews: [
                { author: "Poppy", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-04-26", text: "So much fun on boat 9 with Siri and ola, felt super looked after the whole time, the staff were all lovely and helpful and always came around offering to take photos of you The sights were all stunning cant complain had an excellent time", photos: ["https://images.asiabylocals.com/asiabylocals/reviews/james-bond-island-snorkeling-boat-tour/6395760/1600.webp", "https://images.asiabylocals.com/asiabylocals/reviews/james-bond-island-snorkeling-boat-tour/6395761/1600.webp", "https://images.asiabylocals.com/asiabylocals/reviews/james-bond-island-snorkeling-boat-tour/6395762/1600.webp"] },
                { author: "Antoine", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-04-19", text: "Super activity with a top team. Siri’s energy was insane. The islands were just wonderful.", photos: ["https://images.asiabylocals.com/asiabylocals/reviews/james-bond-island-snorkeling-boat-tour/6287515/1600.webp", "https://images.asiabylocals.com/asiabylocals/reviews/james-bond-island-snorkeling-boat-tour/6287516/1600.webp", "https://images.asiabylocals.com/asiabylocals/reviews/james-bond-island-snorkeling-boat-tour/6287517/1600.webp"] },
                { author: "prashanth", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-04-14", text: "The trip was wonderfully organised and guided by the charismatic Nina. she was bubbling with personality and a sharp sense of humor and always provided us with useful information at each stop. Time management and logistics were smoothly handled. The food could have had a few more healthy options.", photos: ["https://images.asiabylocals.com/asiabylocals/reviews/james-bond-island-snorkeling-boat-tour/6219624/1600.webp"] },
                { author: "Indranath", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-06-11", text: "I had a wonderful experience with this tour operator. The entire trip was very well organized, with everything running smoothly from start to finish. All the destinations were beautiful, scenic, and carefully selected, making the journey truly memorable. The staff members were professional, friendly, and always willing to help, which made the experience even more enjoyable. Their attention to detail and excellent customer service ensured that everyone felt comfortable throughout the tour. I highly recommend this tour operator to anyone looking for a hassle-free and enjoyable travel experience." },
                { author: "Jemma", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-05-01", text: "What an amazing trip Nina & Freshy were outstanding and very funny. Every stop they made sure to tell us all information and always around to take photo. Every stop gave you something different and snorkelling points where very good we saw every even a shark and again you will find Nina & Freshy is the water making sure you don’t miss a thing. Food you won’t go hungry and plenty of drink too. I would recommend Fantastic Similan Travel to anybody." },
                { author: "Giorgio", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-04-22", text: "Great organisation and super nice guides, hopefully see you soon!!" },
                { author: "CLAIRE", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-04-20", text: "Absolutely fantastic - the guides Siri and Freshy on the boat Fantastic 1 and the whole team were wonderful throughout the whole tour. The boat trip, snorkelling, visits to the beautiful island and the food were absolutely fabulous. I would definitely recommend booking this tour to one of the most beautiful places I have visited. The tour team had such great energy and knowledge, even pointing out the turtles for us during snorkelling ! Fabulous trip" },
                { author: "Luke", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-04-05", text: "From the start the planning was clear , breakfast dinner snacks and cold drinks provided all day, the speedboat was busy but the staff and the boat crew made our time! The most clear water I’ve ever seen! Absolutely worth the money and a great way to see the islands." },
                { author: "Meri", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-03-25", text: "It was very nice, the team of Nancy was amazing, very funny and super helpful and friendly" },
                { author: "Ankur", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-03-17", text: "Overall experience was very smooth and enjoyable. Right from our pickup till drop back to hotel. Siri and other staff were great hosts, they coordinated very well and took great care of us. Overall management was very good and we were kept busy throughout the day with travel, sightseeing and some decent food." },
                { author: "Charles", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-03-13", text: "Hotel pickup in Kamala in a well air cooled van was great, a long journey to Khao lak and back didn’t take away the overall experience of this trip in all honesty. The meals provided by this tour is what you would expect! Our “main guide” Siri was another level, full of bounce, and literally you clung to her every word and action. The other guides were cool and throughout the trip were always interacting with you asking if you’d like photos taken, a lovely touch, not as commanding as Siri but we got on well with all the guides to be honest. As for the tour to the similan islands…these islands" },
                { author: "Renet", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-03-08", text: "Well organized activity, cheerful team and guides, stunning views and unforgettable experience! Definitely worth the money despite it’s a bit far from Phuket - around 2 hours with a van to the pier and another 1 h and 15 - 30 min with the boat to the islands. Amazing marine world and the snorkelling is highly recommended!" }
            ]
        },
