  'save-20-patong-elephant-ethical-sanctuary-tour': {
            averageRating: 4.79,
            totalReviews: 2274,
            guideRating: 4.89,
            valueRating: 4.68,
            reviews: [
                { author: "Klair", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-09-10", text: "The tour was very personal and informative. At no point did I feel concerned about how the elephants are treated. The carers and staff care deeply about the elephants and their wellbeing", photos: ["https://images.asiabylocals.com/asiabylocals/reviews/save-20-patong-elephant-ethical-sanctuary-tour/8634454/1600.webp", "https://images.asiabylocals.com/asiabylocals/reviews/save-20-patong-elephant-ethical-sanctuary-tour/8634455/1600.webp"] },
                { author: "William", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-09-09", text: "Very informative magical experience the guide was fantastic x a defo must do", photos: ["https://images.asiabylocals.com/asiabylocals/reviews/save-20-patong-elephant-ethical-sanctuary-tour/8623925/1600.webp", "https://images.asiabylocals.com/asiabylocals/reviews/save-20-patong-elephant-ethical-sanctuary-tour/8623926/1600.webp", "https://images.asiabylocals.com/asiabylocals/reviews/save-20-patong-elephant-ethical-sanctuary-tour/8623927/1600.webp"] },
                { author: "David", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-09-09", text: "Excellent: Very good experience with guide and the tour itself. I’m glad that the elephants could live without being forced to bath or carry people. I highly recommend.", photos: ["https://images.asiabylocals.com/asiabylocals/reviews/save-20-patong-elephant-ethical-sanctuary-tour/8618226/1600.webp", "https://images.asiabylocals.com/asiabylocals/reviews/save-20-patong-elephant-ethical-sanctuary-tour/8618227/1600.webp"] },
                { author: "Philip", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-09-15", text: "Amazing experience and I would highly recommend. Very knowledgeable team, and we were able to get up close with the Elephants." },
                { author: "Rebecca", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-09-15", text: "Amazing experience, our guide was so knowledgeable about the elephants and shared lots of stories and anecdotes about them. They genuinely care about the elephants. This appears to be a truly ethical sanctuary, and I highly recommend it." },
                { author: "Angela", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-09-12", text: "We had a lovely time with our lovely wee tour guide “May” such a privilege getting so close to the elephants & even more so if they (the elephants) allow you to touch them. Learning about their diet and how they have freedom to roam on the property made us feel lucky that all 5 elephants were close by on the day we visited & we were able to prepare and feed them snacks. My favourites were Malik & Aussie 🫶" },
                { author: "Natálie", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-09-06", text: "This elephant sanctuary is absolutely beautiful and incredibly well-maintained. It is clear how deeply the staff care for the animals and prioritize their well-being. As part of the trip, we even got to prepare snacks for the elephants and feed them directly, which was such a special touch. Our tour guide was amazing—she shared details and stories about each individual elephant, their backgrounds. Seeing them happy and thriving was truly inspiring. I highly recommend visiting to anyone who wants an ethical and memorable elephant experience ✨" },
                { author: "Sarah", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-08-24", text: "An incredible and unforgettable experience! The staff clearly care deeply for the animals, and it was wonderful to see how well looked after they are. We would have happily stayed much longer if we could. The memories and photos from this experience will stay with us forever! ★★★★★" },
                { author: "Taylor", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-08-27", text: "This experience was on of a kind. myself and my partner spent ages trying to find a sanctuary that was ethical. This hit the mark. Chi Chi our guide was amazing, knowlegable and kind. The elephants were well looked after and well treated. they were given space and opportunity to walk around freely. It was quiet hot when we went and they made sure the elephants had access to lots of water. it really was a magical experience." },
                { author: "Charlotte", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-08-24", text: "We were picked up from our hotel near patong beach and driven to the sanctuary. It was a very short trip, under 15 mins. When we got there we were greeted with umbrellas there was a downpour. Our guide was excellent and checked us in and guided us to the first set of elephants. We made elephant snacks and took them to the elephants to feed them. Our guide took pictures and videos of us and told us such valuable information. It was brilliant to see the animals in a free environment. This was the highlight of my Thai trip. Thank you so much!" },
                { author: "Shauna", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-08-24", text: "Visiting this elephant sanctuary was an amazing and truly memorable experience. The staff were incredibly kind, welcoming, and clearly passionate about caring for the elephants. It was especially meaningful to learn that the elephants had been rescued from shows and are now able to live in a much more natural and caring environment. I also loved knowing that the money from our visit helps support the sanctuary and contributes towards rescuing and caring for even more elephants in the future. It felt wonderful to support such an important cause while having such a special experience. I would hi" },
                { author: "Leanne", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-08-22", text: "The tour was absolutely fantastic, we had mae as our guide and she was superb! This sanctuary is well and truly ethical, the elephants had the rule of the roost, they could move around as they wished and the guides are so knowledgeable about the elephants!🩷 You can tell they truly care and respect the animals, they’re like family🐘 Really glad I didn’t get stung with this one and would recommend it to anyone thinking of attending🫶🏻" }
            ]
        },
