                { author: "Jamie", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2025-04-05", text: "We had a wonderful 2 day adventure to Phi Phi from Karon Beach in Phuket. Zank and his team were very helpful and communicated everything from Pick up at our hotel to connecting speedboat, hotel and long boat tour. The best part was the long boat tour around Phi Phi with Maya Beach, snorkeling and swimming. Our Long Boat captain Pong was amazing and took us on a beautiful trip, definitely worth it. We were very lucky and had the long boat to ourselves so he allowed us as much time as we wanted, nothing was rushed." },
                { author: "Traveller", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-06-25", text: "Had a great trip. Organisation of the trip is great, the resort is decent, and the snorkeling was so good. I’d recommend it." },
                { author: "Christopher", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 3, date: "2026-01-09", text: "inzipiell war die Tour schön, jedoch hat der Zeitplan überhaupt nicht gestimmt. Die Organisation wirkte insgesamt chaotisch und die Abläufe waren schlecht abgestimmt. Es gab keine klaren oder präzisen Anweisungen – Informationen zu Essen, Ablauf der Tour oder Treffpunkten fehlten größtenteils und mussten aktiv erfragt werden. Die Phi-Phi-Inseln selbst sind dennoch sehr schön, allerdings würden wir sie eher mit einem anderen Anbieter empfehlen." },
                { author: "Traveller", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2025-06-02", text: "le isole sono meravigliose" },
                { author: "Traveller", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2025-05-19", text: "bu türün size sunduguyen güzel şey adada kalıyor olmanız. böylece seyir noktalarını keşfedebilir ve gece eğlencelerine katılabilirsiniz. tur rehberimiz her şeyimiz ile ilgilendi. harika bir deneyimdi" },
                { author: "Traveller", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 3, date: "2025-04-21", text: "Attività nel complesso bella ! La pecca è stato il giro delle isole, molto breve rispetto alle aspettative" }
