  'coral-and-racha-islands-day-trip-by-speedboat': {
            averageRating: 4.41,
            totalReviews: 580,
            guideRating: 4.54,
            valueRating: 4.33,
            reviews: [
                { author: "Kevin", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-05-03", text: "Had a great time on this island tour. The buffet style lunch was actually really good and our tour guides were friendly and funny. Really enjoyed both Racha and Coral island. Seeing Horn Bills and Monitor Lizards on Coral island was also super cool.", photos: ["https://images.asiabylocals.com/asiabylocals/reviews/coral-and-racha-islands-day-trip-by-speedboat/6487912/1600.webp"] },
                { author: "Daniel", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-04-07", text: "Highly recommend this trip. Family of four (2 adults and 2 teenage boys). Communication via notifications and emails in the days leading up to the trip was really good. On the day the transport arrived bang on time as promised. Check in process was smooth and our guide explained how the day would work. The boat was fun and had lots of complimentary refreshments on board. The islands were beautiful and there was something for everyone on offer while we were there. We all agreed it was a great day!", photos: ["https://images.asiabylocals.com/asiabylocals/reviews/coral-and-racha-islands-day-trip-by-speedboat/6114041/1600.webp", "https://images.asiabylocals.com/asiabylocals/reviews/coral-and-racha-islands-day-trip-by-speedboat/6114043/1600.webp", "https://images.asiabylocals.com/asiabylocals/reviews/coral-and-racha-islands-day-trip-by-speedboat/6114142/1600.webp"] },
                { author: "pinar", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-04-04", text: "Amazing Tour! Everything was organized perfectly and in time. We have been picked up at 08:03 (08:00/8:15 was the expected time). We had a short check in for about 30-45 min at the port and went to the boat. It was not too crowded and enough space for everyone. The first island (racha) was amazing! Beautiful place with white sand. We had around 2h to spend there. After that we went to corak island where we had a nice bufdet and free beach beds. Also here plebty of time to enjoy the beautiful beach! Thanks a lot", photos: ["https://images.asiabylocals.com/asiabylocals/reviews/coral-and-racha-islands-day-trip-by-speedboat/6071412/1600.webp", "https://images.asiabylocals.com/asiabylocals/reviews/coral-and-racha-islands-day-trip-by-speedboat/6071414/1600.webp", "https://images.asiabylocals.com/asiabylocals/reviews/coral-and-racha-islands-day-trip-by-speedboat/6071415/1600.webp"] },
                { author: "Janet", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-07-24", text: "Great value for money, fab crew. Smooth hotel pickup, speedboat with soft drinks offered on board, a basic tasty lunch - yes there’s a lot of other tourists on both islands but they’re beautiful spots. Worth doing for sure!" },
                { author: "Sandra", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-03-26", text: "A fab day out . Very well organised and Sunny, our guide m, was brilliant" },
                { author: "Rachel", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-03-12", text: "Amazing day - Ritt was a fantastic guide and all the crew were so lovely helping everyone on and off the boat. The trip is great value - the islands so beautiful and unspoilt. One of my favourite trips - thank you" },
                { author: "Piyush", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-03-12", text: "Had a great experience with Sasha as our guide during the trip. Everything was well organized, the journey felt smooth, and we always felt safe throughout. Sasha was helpful, professional, and made sure the trip went comfortably. Overall, it was definitely worth it and I’d recommend Sasha to anyone looking for a reliable guide." },
                { author: "Sarah", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-02-16", text: "Racha Island waters are literally heaven on earth! Coral Island too! 2-3 hours on each island so nice and chill" },
                { author: "Mark", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-02-07", text: "Skip Phi Phi islands and head to Rachi. Absolutely stunning. From the water to the sand this is what I came to Thailand for! Beautiful island. The only issue is no chairs or umbrellas so be prepared to bring with you the beach blankets and towels. I would go back in a moment. Researched the hotel there to stay but sold out during our stay." },
                { author: "Christopher", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-02-06", text: "It was a snorkeling tour, so I would have liked to spend more time snorkeling then the allowed ~30 minutes. The tour was great and Racha Beach was beautiful, but I wouldn't have loved to have less time on coral beach and maybe an extra excursion to go snorkeling instead." },
                { author: "Amy", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-02-21", text: "Our guide was amazing. The islands were beautiful and the snorkelling was so much fun! Transport from the hotel was quick and efficient and the boat was a smooth ride. Would definitely recommend!" },
                { author: "Szymon", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-02-18", text: "All in all great experience Guide did struggle slightly with hospitality but hey! no one is perfect. https://youtu.be/CxtbZlj_bGk?si=DDB5LY5oU62Io6-b" }
            ]
        },
