            totalReviews: 1,
            guideRating: 5.0,
            valueRating: 5.0,
            reviews: [
                { author: "Anthony", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-09-17", text: "🚐 Return hotel transfers are included. Our driver was already waiting outside the hotel when we came down in the morning, which was a great start to the day. When you are ready to leave the water park, you just message the driver about 20 minutes beforehand and they come back to collect you. It was all very straightforward. Communication with the tour operator was really good from the moment we booked. They replied quickly and kept us updated, so we always knew what was happening. We had a great day at Andamanda Water Park. There are loads of slides and pools, and the park was much bigger than", photos: ["https://images.asiabylocals.com/asiabylocals/reviews/andamanda-water-park-full-day-adventure-in-phuket/8770040/1600.webp", "https://images.asiabylocals.com/asiabylocals/reviews/andamanda-water-park-full-day-adventure-in-phuket/8770041/1600.webp", "https://images.asiabylocals.com/asiabylocals/reviews/andamanda-water-park-full-day-adventure-in-phuket/8770049/1600.webp"] }
            ]
