  'similan-island-adventure-tour': {
            averageRating: 4.25,
            totalReviews: 49,
            guideRating: 4.52,
            valueRating: 4.23,
            reviews: [
                { author: "Mellisa", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-05-07", text: "guides and crew were amazing, plenty of beverages and food, lovely views, recommend using life jackets for snorkelling. It was a very long trip from Pa tong totalling of 12hrs or more in travelling and site seeing", photos: ["https://images.asiabylocals.com/asiabylocals/reviews/similan-island-adventure-tour/6551527/1600.webp", "https://images.asiabylocals.com/asiabylocals/reviews/similan-island-adventure-tour/6551528/1600.webp", "https://images.asiabylocals.com/asiabylocals/reviews/similan-island-adventure-tour/6551529/1600.webp"] },
                { author: "Beatriz", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-03-07", text: "It was so worth it, the people on the boat are amazing and happy, they made the day even more fun with the amazing beaches we’ve been. Don’t skip this place when coming to Thailand. 😍😍😍", photos: ["https://images.asiabylocals.com/asiabylocals/reviews/similan-island-adventure-tour/5720442/1600.webp", "https://images.asiabylocals.com/asiabylocals/reviews/similan-island-adventure-tour/5720443/1600.webp", "https://images.asiabylocals.com/asiabylocals/reviews/similan-island-adventure-tour/5720444/1600.webp"] },
                { author: "Kilian", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-03-26", text: "Top. Organisation au oignons.", photos: ["https://images.asiabylocals.com/asiabylocals/reviews/similan-island-adventure-tour/5954411/1600.webp", "https://images.asiabylocals.com/asiabylocals/reviews/similan-island-adventure-tour/5954412/1600.webp"] },
                { author: "Daniel", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2025-04-05", text: "Great trip, the si.ilan island was beautiful. very fast speedboat which was exciting and felt very safe. Lunch was at another national park island with lots of choice. We were even allowed to take cold drinks off the boat everytime we visited an island." },
                { author: "Nadene", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 4, date: "2026-03-09", text: "The Snorkelling was amazing and the islands are beautiful and well worth it, but if you travelling from Phuket, then it is a very long day returning at 7pm. We were very well catered for and there was plenty of food for breakfast, lunch and Tea but unfortunately the lunch was cold. Staff are great and ensure you have an amazing stress free day. The only thing that was a little disappointing was the staff approaching everyone with the Tip jar. I intended to give a tip anyway, but some people may feel under pressure to do so. We had an amazing day and would recommend it." },
                { author: "Traveller", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-05-07", text: "Ci siamo trovati benissimo e filato tutto liscio l’escursione è stata bellissima non è mancato niente sono veramente in gamba grazie 1000!" },
                { author: "Traveller", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 4, date: "2026-04-25", text: "Tolle Inseln und mega schöne Natur" },
                { author: "Jessy", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-04-16", text: "Une superbe organisation du début à la fin, merci infiniment" },
                { author: "Biagio", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 3, date: "2026-03-24", text: "il tour è molto bello, le Similan Island sono meravigliose...Olivia ed il suo team fantastici, simpatici e molto disponibili...ma consiglio il tour solo se vi trovate vicino al porto di partenza, da Phuket ci sono troppe ore di viaggio, più della metà e diventa troppo stancante..." },
                { author: "Mike", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 3, date: "2026-03-05", text: "The staff and lunch very good Similan Islands were beautiful. Unfortunately depending where ur hotel is to take off point can be arduous We spent 4 hours, 2 hours each way to take off point and 1.5 hours, each way in large boat going fairly fast. It’s a reality where islands are but a ton of travel for 5 hours pleasure. Glad we can say we saw but would never entertained if we did more research on timings." },
                { author: "Florian", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 3, date: "2026-03-19", text: "Gemischte Gefühle. Anstelle der Bilder befindet man sich eher in Massentourismus. Der Anbieter fertigt pro Tag mehrere hundert Personen ab. 4-5 Boote mit je ca. 66 Personen. Das sollte vor der Buchung transparenter dargestellt werden. Dementsprechend auf Masse ist das Essen und die Erfahrung auf den Inseln. Die guides waren aber sehr herzlich und wir haben beim Schnorcheln eine Schildkröte gesehen." },
                { author: "Elodie", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-02-23", text: "Bonne excursion , les lieux sont tellement magnifiques. Trop de touristes par contre… Très bien organisé, on a nous donne un sac avec une paillasse, serviettes, matériel pour snorkelling, 3 repas , de l’eau du pepsi des petites gourmandises plusieurs fois dans la journée Seul bémol le transport en bateau qui est vraiment pas agréable , on dirait du bétail dans une remorque" }
            ]
        },
