  'phuket-cheow-guided-tour': {
            averageRating: 4.66,
            totalReviews: 105,
            guideRating: 4.67,
            valueRating: 4.38,
            reviews: [
                { author: "Mhd", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2025-12-28", text: "Great tour with a perfect mix of kayaking, swimming, and a fun longtail boat ride. The mini-hike and cave were interesting and well explained, and the food was a solid 10/10 - if you’re into Thai-food. The only small downside was that the hike felt a bit too short, I would’ve loved it to be longer, but that’s just a personal preference. Overall, highly recommended!", photos: ["https://images.asiabylocals.com/asiabylocals/reviews/phuket-cheow-guided-tour/5022204/1600.webp", "https://images.asiabylocals.com/asiabylocals/reviews/phuket-cheow-guided-tour/5022205/1600.webp", "https://images.asiabylocals.com/asiabylocals/reviews/phuket-cheow-guided-tour/5022206/1600.webp"] },
                { author: "Pam", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2025-10-18", text: "Aside from the weather being rainy and overcast - the trip was amazing. Can’t control the weather :). Lunch was fantastic, the jungle walk - muddy but fun, big spiders in the cave. A Great day!!", photos: ["https://images.asiabylocals.com/asiabylocals/reviews/phuket-cheow-guided-tour/4275973/1600.webp", "https://images.asiabylocals.com/asiabylocals/reviews/phuket-cheow-guided-tour/4275974/1600.webp", "https://images.asiabylocals.com/asiabylocals/reviews/phuket-cheow-guided-tour/4275975/1600.webp"] },
                { author: "Caitlin", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-04-11", text: "Excellent activity - ran smoothly start to finish including pick up in Phuket. Guide was friendly and helpful - Fern had excellent English and a sense of humour as she kept the group of 16 people together. There were a lot of tourists groups that overlapped a bit and no wildlife awake in the jungle so just keep that in mind for your expectations. Food was family style with a variety of Thai dishes and fruit. It is a long drive from Phuket - shorter to go from Krabi." },
                { author: "Anna", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-02-03", text: "A beautiful place and overall great trip, well planned😊" },
                { author: "Collin", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-01-05", text: "Great full day trip with stunning views, good food and a lovely guide. Highly recommended!" },
                { author: "Jane", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2025-08-07", text: "This was a fantastic activity. It was a long way for us to travel from Phuket - but worth it. The taxi was very comfortable which allowed us to snooze - this helped soooo much. Khoa Sok National park is absolutely stunning and our guide did everything he could to make the trip special and to avoid the crowds. We hardly mixed with other groups at all - which was amazing! He had pictures and stories to share with us. Brought everything to life. We loved it. Only thing - wish we had stayed on the lake for a night or 2… breathtaking place…" },
                { author: "Raffaella", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2025-04-26", text: "Just one word: perfect. During the booking, the price of the tour may seem high, but in reality it’s very low; the guide is very kind and well prepared. He always provides bottle of water and also food in the most tiring moments. He explained everything we saw, in an interesting way, catching our attention every time. And we never felt bored, because every activity is amazing not only for the incredible environments you see and live, but for how the activities followed one another. As I said at the start, just perfect. Absolutely recommended." },
                { author: "Corneliu", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2025-04-18", text: "English speaking of the guide can be improved Swimming with life vest is NOT swimming. That rule should be reconsidered or you should don't include swimming in the tour" },
                { author: "Faz", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2025-04-07", text: "Great services, from the pick-up at our hotel to Danny our guide, super fun and great quality 👌" },
                { author: "Siebren", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2025-01-28", text: "We had a great time. The tour guide was really friendly and did a great job explaining everything. The park is beautiful, definitely recommend booking this tour." },
                { author: "Liam", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2024-11-25", text: "What a great day out and such a beautiful landscape to see and experience! Lunch provided was very good and plenty of food to fill up on. The swim and chill time in the water was so nice and cooling after a little hike through the jungle to see some types of trees. Transport to and from the hotel was smooth and easy!" },
                { author: "Giulia", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 4, date: "2025-04-19", text: "The tour is good and kayaking made my day, although the van was not that comfortable and the road got very bumpy. It takes 3 hours to get to the National Park so it was quite tiring and I feel like I didn't have enough free time to explore the place. I would recommend this day trip but definitely not starting from Phuket. Spending 6 hours on the road to get only 6 hours of actual tour is too much" }
            ]
        },
