            reviews: [
                { author: "Khloe", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 1, date: "2026-02-01", text: "Over paid…and communication was very bad" },
                { author: "Traveller", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 3, date: "2025-12-28", text: "The show and presentation is wonderful. However, the organization of it all is chaos utter chaos.! Prepare for unattended children and not so great food. Also, our driver came to pick us up in for a 2 Hour drive and we weren’t provided any beverages. One of the nice passengers insisted that the driver stop at a shop and she bought us all water and I think that was very kind, but she shouldn't have had to purchase for 8 people. There should’ve been beverages ready for us for such a long drive and a hot climate. Overall, I would say that this was a fair to OK trip." },
                { author: "Mike", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 4, date: "2025-09-29", text: "Der Magic CARNIVAL ist für Kinder perfekt. Das RoyaleDinner ein Buffet im Großraumsaal und gut organisiert. Die Plätze zur Show waren in der Mitte, zwar nicht königlich aber es war ok. Zur Show sind keine Aufnahmen gestattet, schade. Der Transfer war pünktlich 👍" }
            ]
