            reviews: [
                { author: "Francis", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2025-12-06", text: "The tour guide Mr Happy was very helpful and extremely experienced in this field. He made the tour interesting and gave us details about the places we visited. Looking forward to my next trip already.", photos: ["https://images.asiabylocals.com/asiabylocals/reviews/james-bond-and-phang-nga-bay-tour-by-longtail/4830113/1600.webp", "https://images.asiabylocals.com/asiabylocals/reviews/james-bond-and-phang-nga-bay-tour-by-longtail/4830114/1600.webp", "https://images.asiabylocals.com/asiabylocals/reviews/james-bond-and-phang-nga-bay-tour-by-longtail/4830115/1600.webp"] },
                { author: "Sultina", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2025-07-15", text: "Perfect timing for everything couldv had a little more time at Hanes bond island but everything was perfect as well as how helpful the guide was", photos: ["https://images.asiabylocals.com/asiabylocals/reviews/james-bond-and-phang-nga-bay-tour-by-longtail/3095085/1600.webp", "https://images.asiabylocals.com/asiabylocals/reviews/james-bond-and-phang-nga-bay-tour-by-longtail/3095086/1600.webp", "https://images.asiabylocals.com/asiabylocals/reviews/james-bond-and-phang-nga-bay-tour-by-longtail/3095089/1600.webp"] },
                { author: "Chantal", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-04-12", text: "Excellent day ..we had a great time . Long tail boat trip was fantastic .. long time I. The van however boat trip was worth it . Fab guide thank you . Highly recommend this trip" },
                { author: "Dillon", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2025-12-09", text: "Our guide Happy was very helpful and friendly. I felt like we were in great hands and were lucky to be able to see so much in one day!" },
                { author: "Daiana", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2025-11-23", text: "Great James Bond tour! Our guides Happy and Kim were fantastic, super fun, helpful, and made the whole trip even better. Highly recommend!" },
                { author: "Mykaila", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2025-06-03", text: "My guide Happy was so lovely! Very funny and easy going, making it a wonderful experience." },
                { author: "Jake", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2025-05-04", text: "The day was well planned out and we enjoyed every moment of it. The itinerary is jam packed, however you will still have enough time to enjoy each point of interest. The buffet lunch was also delicious and varied. Finally, the guide Happy was absolutely amazing, explaining everything in detail and genuinely elevating the experience even further. We highly recommend taking this tour!" },
                { author: "Oscar", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2025-05-02", text: "Happy was our tour guide and he was great, kept the tour running and kept us on time. He was knowledgeable and fun. This tour is amazing, it is an incredible part of the world. Loved the cave with the reclining Buddha." },
                { author: "Jess", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2025-04-25", text: "Lovely day out - the experience of the long boat was great. You get to see a lot of the national park from the water. All of the stops are stunning and a must see. Happy was our tour guide and he was excellent." },
                { author: "Vanessa", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2025-03-15", text: "The guide was practical and friendly. The trip was well organized." },
                { author: "Jessica", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2025-03-07", text: "From beginning to end this tour was fantastic! Our tour guide (Happy) was so amazing, he was full of facts and information about the island and their history and he was so friendly, we enjoyed every part of the tour but we especially loved kayaking through the mangroves, my husband did lose his phone so a helpful tip would be to definitely buy a waterproof neck case or you will lose it 😢 Other than that we had a blast, the kids have all said it has been the highlight of our trip so far! ❤️" },
                { author: "Lynne", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2025-02-17", text: "Happy was a great guide, we didn’t find it over crowded with tourists at all. It was a really great day." }
            ]
