  'elephant-jungle-sanctuary-feeding-experience-in-pattaya': {
            averageRating: 4.85,
            totalReviews: 477,
            guideRating: 4.89,
            valueRating: 4.83,
            reviews: [
                { author: "Glenda", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-09-15", text: "The tour was wonderful, for its cheap price, it was very happy to feed the very trained elephants, the very trained and attentive guides, the courtesy of coffee, iced drinks, cookies, ice towels for your face ect, ect.. the first-class transportation with AC, I recommend, was a unique and wonderful experience to share with these beautiful elephants. Ahhhh they give you a very educational explanation of the elephants and what you should do and where to touch them, they take the photos, if you do not have an companion.", photos: ["https://images.asiabylocals.com/asiabylocals/reviews/elephant-jungle-sanctuary-feeding-experience-in-pattaya/8728363/1600.webp"] },
                { author: "Nargis", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-09-08", text: "Worth the experience! Two stages: feeding the elephants and paper making out of their poo. Elephants are sooooo friendly and happy to see us with food of course. The guide was so helpful and he was attentive to anything you needed. Speaks English; the caretakers don’t speak English but the guide will assist. Worth every penny with mum.", photos: ["https://images.asiabylocals.com/asiabylocals/reviews/elephant-jungle-sanctuary-feeding-experience-in-pattaya/8602569/1600.webp", "https://images.asiabylocals.com/asiabylocals/reviews/elephant-jungle-sanctuary-feeding-experience-in-pattaya/8602570/1600.webp"] },
                { author: "corinne", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-09-03", text: "Guys, all I can say is what an experience…no hesitation in my 5 star rating! Spending time with these majestic creatures was nothing short of amazing! We initially booked for just feeding which was my mistake; however we very easily managed to upgrade once there. You get very up close to the elephants and get the opportunity to take memorable photos and videos on your own phones. Everyone there is so friendly, so in addition to the person going round taking pictures, staff will also take pictures for you. The photos are also free and available to download after your visit…we received ours with", photos: ["https://images.asiabylocals.com/asiabylocals/reviews/elephant-jungle-sanctuary-feeding-experience-in-pattaya/8502311/1600.webp", "https://images.asiabylocals.com/asiabylocals/reviews/elephant-jungle-sanctuary-feeding-experience-in-pattaya/8502312/1600.webp"] },
                { author: "Carina", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-09-07", text: "Great Day at Pattaya Elephant Sanctuary Visiting the Elephant Sanctuary Pattaya was a fantastic experience from start to finish. Seeing the elephants roaming freely and being treated with genuine care, without any riding or forced tricks, made the whole visit feel authentic and respectful. Feeding them, learning their backgrounds from the friendly guides, and spending time in such a peaceful environment was definitely a highlight of the trip. The entire tour was well-organized, relaxed, and completely worth it. I highly recommend checking it out if you're in Pattaya!" },
                { author: "Mohsene", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-09-07", text: "Excellente experience, I really recommend it 😍😍😍" },
                { author: "Sonya", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-08-27", text: "Tim was amazing and the elephants were sweet and had their own personalities. It was a wonderful time." },
                { author: "Jakub", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-08-24", text: "Very good, If you're in Pattaya, don't miss this one out" },
                { author: "Lisa", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-08-08", text: "Kangaroo was an amazing tour guide. So knowledgeable and you can tell he loves his job. We found the whole morning incredible and would definitely say this is a must do activity for any age." },
                { author: "Paul", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-08-07", text: "Simply an amazing experience. Everyone was so helpful and kind. Having more knowledge about the life of an elephant and the way they live. Many thanks to all the staff for a wonderful tour." },
                { author: "Jack", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-09-01", text: "The tour guide Dech was absolutely incredible. Can not thank him enough. Such a beautiful experience and HIGHLY recommend. The elephants are able to roam around and NOT chained. Very ethical and loving" },
                { author: "Sophie", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-08-27", text: "Really good value and my children loved the guides so funny and friendly" },
                { author: "Amina", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-08-07", text: "It was amazing! The elephants were so beautiful & sweet. The tour guides were very knowledgeable and friendly. They also had great sense of humor. If you’re in Pattaya, this is the elephant tour to do! It wasn’t overbooked or crowded, so it was an intimate experience with the elephants." }
            ]
        },
