  'experienced-atv-buggy-off-road-tour-with-meal-in-pattaya': {
            averageRating: 4.63,
            totalReviews: 134,
            guideRating: 4.78,
            valueRating: 4.57,
            reviews: [
                { author: "Benjamin", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-08-31", text: "amazing tour and vie of Pattaya. my driving experience was only car (8years experience). first time driving an ATV and doing off road with a vehicle. going down the mountain was scary but an ATV is easy. There was a beginner group in which I was not but I got no issue with the ATV. so beginners friendly. Lots of emotions and fun. The guide also takes a lot of pictures for souvenirs." },
                { author: "Alex", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-07-07", text: "Had a really good day on the ATV!!! The pick up was on time and all the staff were really helpful!!! The course you are taken on is very exciting and definitely felt adventurous!!! The food afterwards was a lovely touch!!! Would definitely rebook this activity next time I am in Pattaya!!!" },
                { author: "Matthew", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-05-22", text: "Great company, and Jay was a great guide, lived our afternoon doing this A⭐️" },
                { author: "George", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-05-21", text: "it was really fun and our guides were awesome they made it really fun and the tour was actually fast paced once they realized we were skilled on the ATVs which made the experience alot better" },
                { author: "Troy", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-04-15", text: "I’ve done ATVing in like 6 other countries and this was definitely the best so far. We did it as a small group of 2 plus the guide and it was fast paced and on rugged trail, we really enjoyed that." },
                { author: "Gayle", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-04-05", text: "enjoyed the route we went. so much fun. definitely recommend face masks." },
                { author: "Thomas", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-03-30", text: "My wife and I are in our late 70s and found the trip to be perfect and a great value. The tour people thought of everything, including clothing, dust masks, water along the trail, and a place to clean up before a wonderful post-ride sandwich, french fries, and can of Coke. Lockers and cooling fans also enhanced the experience. My biggest personal problem was dealing with left-hand driving since we are from the US. There is some low-traffic road driving to navigate before reaching the dirt trails." },
                { author: "Allain", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-03-20", text: "We had a great experience at Pattaya ATV. Service was excellent, quad bikes were new and well maintained and the track was great. After the ride we were given a lovely lunch with drinks. Thank you to the team at Pattaya ATV for the great experience you provided. Five Stars ⭐️⭐️⭐️⭐️⭐️" },
                { author: "Gil", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-01-31", text: "The Road was very long and very nice. Jay, the guide was very kind and very helpfull were ever required. Due to days without rain it was very dusty. But over all it was great adventure for us." },
                { author: "Casey", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2025-12-30", text: "Great family experience. My two older sons, 17&21, drove buggies with me and the 10 year old as passengers. Good mix of trails, group ride was fun. Would be awesome to do the tour again during rain or wet season." },
                { author: "DARYL", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2025-10-24", text: "Excellent excursion, challenging, awesome guide and great viewpoint, Happy to take photos of you and they captured the whole trip on a go pro you can if you wish, but no hard sell,." },
                { author: "Logan", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2025-10-22", text: "Awesome Buggy tour, the best one I have done yet. Our guide Gun was excellent and lead the way at a fast pace for our experienced group. The Burger and refreshments were top notch also. Money well spent, Highly recommend this tour." }
            ]
        },
