  'coral-island-speedboat-tour-indian-lunch-and-transfer': {
            averageRating: 3.42,
            totalReviews: 51,
            guideRating: 3.24,
            valueRating: 3.37,
            reviews: [
                { author: "Alexandre", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2025-11-01", text: "was one of the best experiences I have had on my life. very friendly and polite staff. the information, lunch was excellent 👌", photos: ["https://images.asiabylocals.com/asiabylocals/reviews/coral-island-speedboat-tour-indian-lunch-and-transfer/4463642/1600.webp", "https://images.asiabylocals.com/asiabylocals/reviews/coral-island-speedboat-tour-indian-lunch-and-transfer/4463652/1600.webp"] },
                { author: "Neeel", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2025-12-16", text: "We had a great experience on this tour, and honestly, it is one of the best tours available in this price range. The tour is clearly designed for the Indian market, keeping budget, food preferences, and adventure activities in mind. If you enjoy parasailing, sea walking, this tour is perfect for you. This tour may not be suitable for people who prefer a quiet or luxury-style island trip or who are not interested in adventure activities. Some negative comments seem to miss this point and compare it with much more expensive or private tours, which isn’t a fair comparison considering the price an" },
                { author: "Mareks", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2025-09-01", text: "Everything was so good planned and special thanks to guide, she managed all the movements smoothly and on time. Great value." },
                { author: "Mokhira", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2025-08-24", text: "I booked a tour for my mom, they treated her very well, she came back home so happy, everything was great, I sincerely appreciate everyone that is operating this tour" },
                { author: "Francois", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 4, date: "2025-12-28", text: "They forgot to pick us up, so we decided to book a \"Bolt\" car and we went to the Bali Hai pier, where we joined the group. Firts stop with speedboat was a platform where you get info about the possible watersports (parasailing 800 bath; jetsky 500 bath, bananaboat 400 bath and underwater walking 1600 bath; you stay at Coral Island for about 1 to 2 hours, then return to Pattaya and you get a free Indian lunch, and after transfer back to your pick-up location" },
                { author: "Traveller", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-08-04", text: "This trip is full value for money. Our guide \"Nim\" was very good. Starting from the onward journey in speedboat to the exhilarating parasailing, the colourful water of the coral island, the return trip.. all were very well managed. Though the Indian buffet lacked flavour..best part is pick up and drop off from your hotel... fully recommend" },
                { author: "Traveller", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-05-24", text: "It was a great day and had great pleasure for a very little amount. the food was delicious and arrangements were well aligned. Good value for small cost." },
                { author: "davide", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 1, date: "2026-01-24", text: "Siamo arrivati alle barche troppa gente...la spiaggia era affollatissima...saremo stati due ore ..di cui mezz'ora di pranzo. Non la consiglierei.." },
                { author: "Traveller", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 1, date: "2026-01-16", text: "Leider reine Massenabfertigung. Man will nur Aktivitäten verkaufen, die ein Witz sind (Parasailing Flugzeit 2min). Der Strand ist völlig überladen (man sieht den Sand kaum). Von den 60min Verweildauer gehen noch 30min fürs Essen ab, also kaum Aufenthalt." },
                { author: "Jörg", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 1, date: "2026-01-03", text: "Falsche Beschreibung man sollte die richtige Reihenfolge beachten erst die Plattform wo man aggressiv gezwungen wird Aktivitäten zu buchen die dann auch den dazu gehörigen Preis haben wer das nicht möchte wartet und wartet bis alle anderen fertig sind😩 danach geht es zu Insel dort hat man maximal 2 Stunden Zeit sich am Strand aufzuhalten dann geht es wieder zurück das Essen findet dann wieder in Pattaya statt😳" },
                { author: "Traveller", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 1, date: "2026-01-02", text: "Organisation en dessous de tout , changement de l’heure de prise en charge sans préavis et annulation de La réservation sous prétexte d’avoir manifester mon mécontentement prise en charge réservé à 09h00 modifié à 10h00 et chauffeur se trompe d’adresse sans me contacter par téléphone . Au final on me dit à 10h30!qu’un autre chauffeur va venir vers 11h00 . Je manifeste mon mécontentement légitime à nouveau et on annule ma réservation . Plus jamais ce tour opérateur . Il vaut mieux prendre un bateau direct du port pour Koh Larn à Bali Hai Pear 150 Bath aller ." },
                { author: "Traveller", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 1, date: "2025-12-31", text: "Ritardo del Transfer di un’ora… pranzo solamente alle 16 pm. Giornata allucinante! Sconsigliatissimo." }
            ]
        },
