                { author: "Amee", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-03-11", text: "Our tour guide was Duke and she made sure we were always comfortable and well involved during our trip; asking the zoo staff lots of questions in order to get the best experience. The zoo itself has an amazing collection of animals but unfortunately we didnt have a chance to see everything; nevertheless we still had a great day! The trams in the zoo were a nice touch being able to hop on and off to see more of the zoo without walking in the heat. Also there are plenty of places to eat/snack around the park so you don't have to worry about taking your own. The J-park Japanese Village was very c", photos: ["https://images.asiabylocals.com/asiabylocals/reviews/khao-kheow-zoo-and-j-park-japanese-village-day-trip-in-pattaya/5765994/1600.webp", "https://images.asiabylocals.com/asiabylocals/reviews/khao-kheow-zoo-and-j-park-japanese-village-day-trip-in-pattaya/5765995/1600.webp", "https://images.asiabylocals.com/asiabylocals/reviews/khao-kheow-zoo-and-j-park-japanese-village-day-trip-in-pattaya/5765996/1600.webp"] },
                { author: "Henrik", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 4, date: "2026-03-06", text: "Zoo is good fun the Japanese Village...is basically an outdoor small shopping mall...not too much to see but as a part of the program on the way back from the zoo it is a good break for food or coffee", photos: ["https://images.asiabylocals.com/asiabylocals/reviews/khao-kheow-zoo-and-j-park-japanese-village-day-trip-in-pattaya/5711021/1600.webp", "https://images.asiabylocals.com/asiabylocals/reviews/khao-kheow-zoo-and-j-park-japanese-village-day-trip-in-pattaya/5711022/1600.webp"] },
                { author: "Vicki", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 3, date: "2026-01-20", text: "Great driver and was prompt at collecting dropping off and explaining the trip to us . zoo was good but the tram didn't take us to all of the stops so missed half of the animals. what we did see though we enjoyed" },
                { author: "Traveller", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 4, date: "2025-11-19", text: "Being an Open Zoo, option to engage with animals in close range. Availability of ‘Golf Cart’ ( at additional cost), is an excellent way to move around and visit all parts of the Zoo. Plenty of food/drink options available. The Penguin show was not impressive. Signages and direction maps can be improved further by adding some more and including distance information." }
