                { author: "Glenda", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-09-18", text: "The tour was excellent, our guide Nick is very attentive, friendly and polite. He gave us a review and history of every place we visited. It was a wonderful experience. We went up to the 78th floor for dinner and seeing the city is beautiful. In case everything is worthwhile and the guide speaks Russian and English, very nice and I appreciate, he works attending his group in two languages. I recommend it one hundred percent.", photos: ["https://images.asiabylocals.com/asiabylocals/reviews/ayutthaya-and-big-buddha-full-day-tour/8781614/1600.webp", "https://images.asiabylocals.com/asiabylocals/reviews/ayutthaya-and-big-buddha-full-day-tour/8781616/1600.webp", "https://images.asiabylocals.com/asiabylocals/reviews/ayutthaya-and-big-buddha-full-day-tour/8781617/1600.webp"] }
